b83af6b60be/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-02T22:18:24Z","email":"toxmon@users.noreply.github.com","name":"ToXMon"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-02T22:18:24Z","email":"toxmon@users.noreply.github.com","name":"ToXMon"},"message":"fix: add AXL_NODE_A_URL/B_URL env vars to frontend production SDL\n\nROOT CAUSE: Frontend Docker container missing AXL_NODE_A_URL and AXL_NODE_B_URL\nenv vars. Route handler (route.ts) fell back to host.docker.internal which fails\nin Akash cloud, causing all AXL node probes to return offline.\n\nFix: Added AXL_NODE_A_URL and AXL_NODE_B_URL env vars pointing to live Akash\nAXL node ingress URLs in deploy/akash/frontend-prod.yaml.\n\nResult: Frontend /api/axl now returns status=ok for both AXL nodes.\nClient-side React shows ONLINE with green dots within 2s of page load.\nAll 4 Akash deployments preserved on same URIs.\n\nAlso improved requester agent ENS error handling (wrapped discoverProvider\nin try/catch so ENS resolution failure does not crash the agent flow).","tree":{"sha":"543f7a1c3c72838c653b90417a0ba42472f5285e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ToXMon/agenttrust/git/trees/543f7a1c3c72838c653b90417a0ba42472f5285e"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ToXMon/agenttrust/git/commits/f51f584d74afd8045007cf4d00ae5b83af6b60be","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/112281672?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ToXMon/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ToXMon/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ToXMon/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ToXMon/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ToXMon","id":112281672,"login":"ToXMon","node_id":"U_kgDOBrFISA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ToXMon/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/user