,"message":"WP6: agent implementations with live AXL + Basenames integration\n\n- RequesterAgent: ENS discovery, on-chain trust verification, AXL service requests, payment release\n- ProviderAgent: AXL message handling, REAL on-chain analytics (gas/tx stats from Base Sepolia), verifiable SHA-256 output\n- RequesterENSSetup: live Basenames text record registration\n- ProviderENSSetup: live Basenames with trust verification\n- Both agents connect to respective AXL nodes (A=9002, B=9012)\n- Trust scores read from deployed TrustNFT on Base Sepolia\n- No mocks, no stubs, no TODO placeholders - everything live","tree":{"sha":"c30b833cff4cbfe51628a4cd7c3bd3f03bd1c182","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ToXMon/agenttrust/git/trees/c30b833cff4cbfe51628a4cd7c3bd3f03bd1c182"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ToXMon/agenttrust/git/commits/193bc28d23692a25cfcc51a9c39783f6e3f75365","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/112281672?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ToXMon/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ToXMon/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ToXMon/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ToXMon/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ToXMon","id":112281672,"login":"ToXMon","node_id":"U_kgDOBrFISA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ToXMon/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ToXMon/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ToXMon/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ToXMon/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ToXMon/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ToXMon","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/ToXMon/agenttrust/commit/193bc28d23692a25cfcc51a9c39783f6e3f75