in, /auth/me,\n  /api/metrics (viewer+), /api/users (cx/admin), /api/users/:id/ban\n- apps/host: 단독 실행 React 18 + Rspack on :3000 (MFA 미연결)\n- apps/metrics: 단독 실행 + MetricsDashboard exposed-ready 컴포넌트 on :3001\n- apps/users: 단독 실행 + UserList exposed-ready 컴포넌트 on :3002\n\nstarter 상태이므로 ModuleFederationPlugin / shared 설정은 의도적으로 비어있어요.\nStep 1부터 멘티가 직접 붙입니다.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"ec486e98c873652699c17f3eb3a02e3970daaf4c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/woobottle/dashboard-mfa/git/trees/ec486e98c873652699c17f3eb3a02e3970daaf4c"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/woobottle/dashboard-mfa/git/commits/665e66cc1377a22e80b4aa19f89b5340a58f9d0d","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/44644821?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Siihyun/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Siihyun/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Siihyun/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Siihyun/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Siihyun","id":44644821,"login":"Siihyun","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ0NjQ0ODIx","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Siihyun/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Siihyun/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Siihyun/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Siihyun/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Siihyun/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Siihyun","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/woobottle/dashboard-mfa/commit/665e66cc1377a22e80b4aa19f89b5340a58f9d0d","node_id":"C_kwDOSM2N1doAKDY2NWU2NmNjMTM3N2EyMmU4MGI0YWExOWY4OWI1MzQwYTU4ZjlkMGQ","parents":[],"sha":"665e66cc1377a22e80b4aa19f89b5340a58f9d