login":"hololocheck","node_id":"U_kgDODQbgmQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hololocheck/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hololocheck/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hololocheck/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hololocheck/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hololocheck/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/hololocheck","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hololocheck/keybordstudio/commits/0c4e79a40fd11e2fcf28f824cf5cc032ca126345/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-04-28T12:48:10Z","email":"hangdajinzi647@gmail.com","name":"hololocheck"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-04-28T12:48:10Z","email":"hangdajinzi647@gmail.com","name":"hololocheck"},"message":"Phase 15: PCB Studio + Keymap Studio + modular filament TDS\n\nMajor restructure / new feature pass:\n\n1. PCB Studio (4th Studio, 14 files / ~4,000 lines)\n   - Visual keyboard PCB designer with auto-routing\n   - RS-274X Gerber + Excellon drill + BOM/CPL CSV exporters\n   - JLCPCB/PCBWay/Elecrow ZIP bundling\n   - Full DRC (clearance / drill / edge / hole spacing / courtyard)\n   - 3D preview with 8 board colors\n   - 20 footprints (MX/Choc/Alps/Topre, SOD-123, USB-C, Pro Micro, RP2040, etc.)\n\n2. Keymap Studio (5th Studio, 13 files / ~3,000 lines)\n   - Razer Synapse-style browser keymap editor\n   - 195 QMK keycodes + 4 layers + 16 macros\n   - 10 RGB lighting modes + per-key color\n   - WebHID/VIA bridge for real-time hardware sync\n   - Export: KeybordStudio JSON / VIA Editor / QMK / plain text\n\n3. Modular filament TDS database (modules/keycap/filament-data/)\n   - 7 vendors x 92 materials with per-product mechanical TDS\n   - Per-vendor file structure (bambulab.js, polymaker.js, ...)\n   - Unified API (listVendors, getMaterial, getTDS, buildPriceTable)\n   - Drives both filament cost panel and stem strength FEA\n   - Auto-fallback to generic for unregistered vendors\n\n4. Stem Strength FEA (modules/keycap/stem-fea.js)\n   - Beam-theory analysis: pull-off / press / side-load / hoop / layer\n   - AMS-aware: auto-detect vendor from registered filament\n   - Generic fallback with warning when vendor TDS missing\n\n5. Array View / Keyset View\n   - Real keycap geometry per key (not just BoxGeometry)\n   - Custom text placement dialog with 2D layout\n   - Bulk slider / font / text-mode application\n   - Integrated with normal export (no separate bulk export)\n\n6. UI / UX overhaul\n   - Generic <select> dropdown enhancer with smooth animations\n   - Toggle switch CSS via CSS custom properties (no more knob misalignment)\n   - Studio switch + canvas swap animations (JS-triggered class toggle)\n   - Cyan scrollbar consistency across all panels (#006064)\n   - Header layout fix (no more wiki/github overlap on narrow sidebars)\n   - Filament cost panel scrollbar only on demand\n   - Various overflow fixes (sprue kit / env backup / dropdown borders)\n\n7. Code cleanup\n   - Removed assist function group (broken profile compare / clearance check)\n   - Removed preflight check\n   - Removed AMS screenshot import\n   - Extracted toast-service / csg-cache / idb-helpers / dropdown-enhance\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"b090ed31c1ea5831ddbeb49f11cd35dda3d4438e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hololocheck/keybordstudio/git/trees/b090ed31c1ea5831ddbeb49f11cd35dda3d4438e"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hololocheck/keybordstudio/git/commits/0c4e79a40fd11e2fcf28f824cf5cc032ca126345","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/218554521?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hololocheck/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hololocheck/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hololocheck/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hololocheck/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/hololocheck","id":218554521,"login":"hololocheck","node_id":"U_kgDODQbgmQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hololocheck/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hololocheck/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hololocheck/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hololocheck/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hololocheck/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/hololocheck","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/hololocheck/keybordstudio/commit/0c4e79a40fd11e2fcf28f824cf5cc032ca126345","node_id":"C_kwDOSM83wtoAKDBjNGU3OWE0MGZkMTFlMmZjZjI4ZjgyNGNmNWNjMDMyY2ExMjYzNDU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/hololocheck/keybordstudio/commit/924479b0d08a4f1eab3fea7d937a8357234d35c7","sha":"924479b0d08a4f1eab3fea7d937a8357234d35c7","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hololocheck/keybordstudio/commits/924479b0d08a4f1eab3fea7d937a8357234d35c7"}],"sha":"0c4e79a40fd11e2fcf28f824cf5cc032ca126345","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hololocheck/keybordstudio/commits/0c4e79a40fd11e2fcf28f824cf5cc032ca126345"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/218554521?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hololocheck/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hololocheck/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hololocheck/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hololocheck/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/hololocheck","id":218554521,"login":"hololocheck","node_id":"U_kgDODQbgmQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hololocheck/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hololocheck/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hololocheck/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hololocheck/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hololocheck/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/hololocheck","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hololocheck/keybordstudio/commits/924479b0d08a4f1eab3fea7d937a8357234d35c7/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-04-26T20:49:27Z","email":"hangdajinzi647@gmail.com","name":"hololocheck"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-04-26T20:49:27Z","email":"hangdajinzi647@gmail.com","name":"hololocheck"},"message":"Phase 14: remove theme buttons + add Keyset View (whole-keyboard preview & bulk export)\n\n【テーマボタン削除】\n- アシスト機能セクションの「現在の設定をテーマ保存」「テーマ一覧」を削除\n- 関連の event handler 接続も削除 (saveTheme / listThemes 関数本体は残置、\n  ユーザーから明示削除指示があれば更にクリーンアップする)\n- localStorage の kbs_keycap_themes は既存データ保護のため残す\n- i18n: btn_theme_save / btn_theme_load 削除\n\n【配列ビュー (Phase 14)】\nユーザー要望「キーキャップを配列で並べて確認・編集・一括保存」を実装。\n\nUI (アシスト機能セクション内):\n- toggle: 配列ビュー (キーボード全体)\n- select: 60% ANSI / 65% ANSI / TKL ANSI / Full ANSI / 60% JIS\n- button: 一括 STL 出力 (ZIP)\n\nstate 追加:\n- keysetViewEnabled: false\n- keysetLayoutId: ''60-ansi''\n- keysetSpacing: 19.05 (mm)\n\nKEYSET_LAYOUTS テーブル (5 種):\n- 60-ANSI: 数字行 + QWERTY + ASDF + ZXCV + Mod 計 61 キー\n- 65-ANSI: 60 + 矢印列 + Del/PgU/PgD = 68 キー\n- TKL-ANSI: 65 + ファンクション行 + ナビ 6 キー\n- Full-ANSI: TKL + Numpad\n- 60-JIS: 60-ANSI から ANSI Enter 除去 + JIS Enter + 半/全キー\n\n描画 (updateKeysetModel):\n- mainGroup.clear()\n- 各キーを BoxGeometry (現状の colBody / 幅 w*pitch) で配置\n- ラベルは Three.js Sprite (Canvas テクスチャ) で上面表示\n- 配列の中心が原点になるよう offset 計算\n\nupdateModel ラップ:\n- state.keysetViewEnabled が true の時 updateKeysetModel に分岐\n- false ならオリジナルの updateModel を呼ぶ (1 キー詳細描画)\n\n一括 STL 出力 (exportKeysetSTL):\n- 各キーの BoxGeometry を STLExporter で STL 化\n- JSZip で {label}_{w}u.stl の形式でファイル名付与\n- saveAs で keybordstudio_{layoutId}_{count}keys.zip として保存\n\nwindow._kbsUpdateKeyset / _kbsExportKeyset を公開 (デバッグ・外部スクリプト用)\n\n【簡略点 (Phase 15+ で改善余地)】\n- 各キーは BoxGeometry (簡易表示)。プロファイル形状の体感再現は通常モードを利用\n- STL 出力も Box ベース。実際のキーキャップ形状で出力したい場合は\n  「個別 export」を順次回す形にするか、updateModel を毎回呼ぶ実装が必要\n  (60 キー × CSG 重い処理 = 数十秒〜数分かかる、要対策)\n- 配列のレイアウト定義は手書き。Layout Studio との連携は Phase 15+","tree":{"sha":"7e61634ad5aac5d83f3b9235aa03660dd724ba0d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hololocheck/keybordstudio/git/trees/7e61634ad5aac5d83f3b9235aa03660dd724ba0d"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hololocheck/keybordstudio/git/commits/924479b0d08a4f1eab3fea7d937a8357234d35c7","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/218554521?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hololocheck/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hololocheck/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hololocheck/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hololocheck/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/hololocheck","id":218554521,"login":"hololocheck","node_id":"U_kgDODQbgmQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hololocheck/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hololocheck/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hololocheck/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hololocheck/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hololocheck/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/hololocheck","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/hololocheck/keybordstudio/commit/924479b0d08a4f1eab3fea7d937a8357234d35c7","node_id":"C_kwDOSM83wtoAKDkyNDQ3OWIwZDA4YTRmMWVhYjNmZWE3ZDkzN2E4MzU3MjM0ZDM1Yzc","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/hololocheck/keybordstudio/commit/41a90e5da15c54efbb97a68d20324c79924379b7","sha":"41a90e5da15c54efbb97a68d20324c79924379b7","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hololocheck/keybordstudio/commits/41a90e5da15c54efbb97a68d20324c79924379b7"}],"sha":"924479b0d08a4f1eab3fea7d937a8357234d35c7","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hololocheck/keybordstudio/commits/924479b0d08a4f1eab3fea7d937a8357234d35c7"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/218554521?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hololocheck/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hololocheck/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hololocheck/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hololocheck/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/hololocheck","id":218554521,"login":"hololocheck","node_id":"U_kgDODQbgmQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hololocheck/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hololocheck/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hololocheck/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hololocheck/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hololocheck/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/hololocheck","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hololocheck/keybordstudio/commits/41a90e5da15c54efbb97a68d20324c79924379b7/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-04-26T20:38:39Z","email":"hangdajinzi647@gmail.com","name":"hololocheck"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-04-26T20:38:39Z","email":"hangdajinzi647@gmail.com","name":"hololocheck"},"message":"Phase 13: complete the deferred trio (HarfBuzz auto / Pyodide local / keycap split)\n\nPhase 12+ で残した「利用実績ベースで段階対応」3 系統を全てミニマム実装。\n\n【Phase 13-A: HarfBuzz fontBuffer 自動配線】\n- 3dfont-engine.js: parse() の戻り値の _meta に sourceBuffer (元 ArrayBuffer) を保持\n- createTextShapes は options.fontBuffer 未指定でも data._meta.sourceBuffer を\n  自動で参照して shape する\n- 呼出側は fontBuffer を毎回渡す必要がなくなり、HarfBuzz 有効化だけで自動的に\n  shaping が効くようになった\n\n【Phase 13-B: Pyodide ローカル化】\n- lib/vendor/download-pyodide.sh: Pyodide 0.24.1 公式 release tar.bz2 を取得・展開\n- lib/vendor/patch-pyodide.sh: index.html の CDN URL (pyodide.js / indexURL) を\n  lib/vendor/pyodide/ パスに sed 書換\n- Makefile に pyodide / offline-full ターゲット追加:\n  - make pyodide       (Pyodide のみ DL+patch)\n  - make offline-full  (offline + pyodide で完全オフライン)\n  - make clean-vendor  (pyodide ディレクトリも削除)\n- 注: file:// で Pyodide を読むと CORS で落ちるため、ローカルサーバ経由を\n  patch-pyodide.sh の出力で案内\n\n【Phase 13-C: modules/keycap/ さらなる分離】\n新ファイル: modules/keycap/keycap-render.js\n- computeKeycapBaseDim(uSize, pitch): base 寸法計算\n- computeKeycapHeight(profile, row): プロファイル別高さ\n- computeKeycapVolume(state): 体積概算 (cm³)\n- computeKeycapWeight(state, material): 重量推定 (g)\n- computeKeycapCost(state, material): コスト概算 ($)\n- computeSafeArea(state): トップ面安全領域 (mm)\n- estimatePrintTimeSec(state): 印刷時間推定 (秒、FDM 標準)\n- computeFaceDimensions(state): 5 面の利用可能寸法\n- aggregateBatchEstimate(states, material): 複数 keycap 一括集計\n\nこれらは index.html の state グローバルに依存せず、引数経由で受け取る形なので、\nkeycap-module.js から re-export して新規コードがすぐに使える。\nTHREE.js 依存はゼロ。\n\n【Phase 14+ 残】\n- index.html → modules/keycap/* への makeTextGeo / updateModel / createConformedText /\n  createBodyParts 等の漸次移植 (5-10 PR 規模)\n- Pyodide CI (GitHub Actions でリリース zip 自動作成)\n- HarfBuzz の各文字組み機能テスト (アラビア語 / インド系 / CJK 縦書き)\n\nSanity-checked: 全ファイル node --check 通過.","tree":{"sha":"9a2d9beb54c7a48000c21e83c29a765d5816789c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hololocheck/keybordstudio/git/trees/9a2d9beb54c7a48000c21e83c29a765d5816789c"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hololocheck/keybordstudio/git/commits/41a90e5da15c54efbb97a68d20324c79924379b7","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/218554521?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hololocheck/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hololocheck/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hololocheck/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hololocheck/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/hololocheck","id":218554521,"login":"hololocheck","node_id":"U_kgDODQbgmQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hololocheck/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hololocheck/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hololocheck/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hololocheck/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hololocheck/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/hololocheck","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/hololocheck/keybordstudio/commit/41a90e5da15c54efbb97a68d20324c79924379b7","node_id":"C_kwDOSM83wtoAKDQxYTkwZTVkYTE1YzU0ZWZiYjk3YTY4ZDIwMzI0Yzc5OTI0Mzc5Yjc","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/hololocheck/keybordstudio/commit/37e76ee102fc64ee105b64cb0dc5e0b32290adf5","sha":"37e76ee102fc64ee105b64cb0dc5e0b32290adf5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hololocheck/keybordstudio/commits/37e76ee102fc64ee105b64cb0dc5e0b32290adf5"}],"sha":"41a90e5da15c54efbb97a68d20324c79924379b7","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hololocheck/keybordstudio/commits/41a90e5da15c54efbb97a68d20324c79924379b7"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/218554521?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hololocheck/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hololocheck/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hololocheck/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hololocheck/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/hololocheck","id":218554521,"login":"hololocheck","node_id":"U_kgDODQbgmQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hololocheck/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hololocheck/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hololocheck/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hololocheck/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hololocheck/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/hololocheck","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hololocheck/keybordstudio/commits/37e76ee102fc64ee105b64cb0dc5e0b32290adf5/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-04-26T20:33:04Z","email":"hangdajinzi647@gmail.com","name":"hololocheck"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-04-26T20:33:04Z","email":"hangdajinzi647@gmail.com","name":"hololocheck"},"message":"Phase 12+: complete the 3 mega-scale items (HarfBuzz / offline / keycap split)\n\nPhase 11 で見送った最後の超大規模3系統を全てミニマム実装。\n\n【Phase 12-A: オフラインパッケージ完全自動化】\n- lib/vendor/patch-offline.sh: index.html の CDN URL を sed で lib/vendor/ パスに\n  自動書換 (lz-string / FileSaver / jszip / three / addons / three-bvh-csg /\n  three-mesh-bvh)、書換前にバックアップ (.online.bak) 作成\n- lib/vendor/restore-online.sh: バックアップから CDN 版に復元\n- Makefile: ワンコマンドで完結\n  - make offline       (DL + patch)\n  - make online        (CDN へ復元)\n  - make zip           (KeybordStudio-offline-*.zip 生成)\n  - make clean-vendor  (DL ファイル削除)\n- Pyodide (~6MB) は CDN のまま、必要なら別途 lib/vendor/pyodide/ 配置を README で案内\n\n【Phase 12-B: HarfBuzz WASM 完全統合】\n3dfont-engine.js:\n- createTextShapes が options.useShaping !== false かつ options.fontBuffer ありで\n  window._harfbuzzInstance がセットされていれば shape 結果を採用\n- shape 結果の x_advance / x_offset / y_offset を使って glyph 配置\n- HarfBuzz が無い・shape が null・shape 失敗 → 既存の単純レイアウトに静かに fallback\n- _buildShapesAtOffset(THREE, computed, offsetX, offsetY) に Y オフセット引数追加\n  (旧 2 引数呼出は offsetY=0 で動作、後方互換)\n\nindex.html:\n- window._kbsLoadHarfBuzz() を新規公開: 動的 import で hbjs.js / hb.wasm を CDN ロード\n- localStorage.kbs_enable_harfbuzz === ''1'' なら起動時に自動ロード\n- 既定では読み込まない (~600KB のため明示有効化が必要)\n\n【Phase 12-C: modules/keycap/ 段階的分離】\n新ファイル 3 本を新規作成、keycap-module.js から re-export:\n\n- modules/keycap/keycap-state.js\n  - KEYCAP_INITIAL_STATE: index.html の initialState と等価な定数定義 (Object.freeze)\n  - createKeycapState(): deep clone した新インスタンスを返す\n\n- modules/keycap/keycap-presets.js\n  - PROFILE_INFO (Cherry/OEM/SA/XDA/DSA/KAT/MT3/Cherry LP/Choc + 高さ・傾き・説明)\n  - ROW_INFO (R1-R4 + F + tilt 角度)\n  - MATERIAL_PRESETS (PLA/ABS/PETG/Resin/Nylon)\n  - ENGRAVE_DEPTH_PRESETS (FDM/Resin/Laser/Inlay)\n  - STEM_TYPES (MX/Choc/Alps/Topre)\n\n- modules/keycap/keycap-helpers.js\n  - lerp / clamp / deg2rad / rad2deg\n  - hexToRgb / rgbToHex / colorDiff\n  - pointInRect / pointInCircle\n  - estimateWeightGrams / estimateCostUSD\n  - deepClone / shallowDiff\n\nindex.html 側の initialState 定義はそのまま残し (互換維持)。新規コードは\nKeycapModule から import して使う。Phase 13+ で index.html → import 化を\n段階的に進める足場が完成。\n\n【テスト】\nnode --check / --input-type=module --check 全 5 ファイル exit 0.\npatch-offline.sh / download-vendor.sh は実行可能ビット OK 確認。\n\n【真の Phase 13+ 残】\nHarfBuzz fontBuffer の自動取得 (parse 時の ArrayBuffer 保持)、\nPyodide ローカル化、index.html → modules/keycap/* への完全移植 (数千行規模) は\n依然として大規模で、利用実績を見つつ段階的に進める。","tree":{"sha":"311ff70c60f981195c5d9e187450054b229cf8b0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hololocheck/keybordstudio/git/trees/311ff70c60f981195c5d9e187450054b229cf8b0"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hololocheck/keybordstudio/git/commits/37e76ee102fc64ee105b64cb0dc5e0b32290adf5","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/218554521?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hololocheck/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hololocheck/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hololocheck/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hololocheck/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/hololocheck","id":218554521,"login":"hololocheck","node_id":"U_kgDODQbgmQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hololocheck/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hololocheck/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hololocheck/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hololocheck/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hololocheck/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/hololocheck","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/hololocheck/keybordstudio/commit/37e76ee102fc64ee105b64cb0dc5e0b32290adf5","node_id":"C_kwDOSM83wtoAKDM3ZTc2ZWUxMDJmYzY0ZWUxMDViNjRjYjBkYzVlMGIzMjI5MGFkZjU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/hololocheck/keybordstudio/commit/54ae975853589beb8f3cd7e88be290830a71f7b6","sha":"54ae975853589beb8f3cd7e88be290830a71f7b6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hololocheck/keybordstudio/commits/54ae975853589beb8f3cd7e88be290830a71f7b6"}],"sha":"37e76ee102fc64ee105b64cb0dc5e0b32290adf5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hololocheck/keybordstudio/commits/37e76ee102fc64ee105b64cb0dc5e0b32290adf5"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/218554521?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hololocheck/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hololocheck/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hololocheck/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hololocheck/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/hololocheck","id":218554521,"login":"hololocheck","node_id":"U_kgDODQbgmQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hololocheck/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hololocheck/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hololocheck/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hololocheck/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hololocheck/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/hololocheck","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hololocheck/keybordstudio/commits/54ae975853589beb8f3cd7e88be290830a71f7b6/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-04-26T20:24:31Z","email":"hangdajinzi647@gmail.com","name":"hololocheck"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-04-26T20:24:31Z","email":"hangdajinzi647@gmail.com","name":"hololocheck"},"message":"Phase 11: complete the previously-deferred backlog\n\nPhase 12+ で見送る予定だった残項目を全て実装。残るのは超大規模リファクタのみ。\n\n【3dfont-engine】\n- parseFvarAxes(): fvar テーブルから可変フォントの軸情報 (tag/min/default/max) を抽出\n- shapeText(typefaceJSON, text, fontBuffer): HarfBuzz WASM 統合の入口\n  - window._harfbuzzInstance がセットされていれば HarfBuzz でシェイピング\n  - 合字 / アラビア語 / インド系結合文字 / CJK 縦書きで威力を発揮\n  - 利用不可なら null を返し caller は FontEngine3D 単純レイアウトへ fallback\n\n【mesh-fix-lib】(agent 4 で完了済)\n- AbortSignal による repair キャンセル (extra.signal で渡す)\n- changedRegions: 修復前後の頂点位置ハッシュ集合差分で added/removed を近似抽出\n- validate3MFContent: 3MF 内の object/resources/build 構造を検証\n\n【Body Generator】\n- 分割ケース設計 (Bed-size check):\n  - PRINTER_BED_SIZES 9 機種 (Bambu / Prusa / Creality / Voron)\n  - checkSplitCase(bedKey): レイアウト + ベゼル + 壁厚 + tilt から外寸計算\n  - 収まらなければ推奨分割数 (例: 2×2 = 4 パーツ) と推奨ジョイントを提示\n  - UI: アシスト機能セクションに「分割判定」ボタン\n\n【Layout Studio】\n- LAYOUT_PRESETS に 13 プリセット追加: 30/50/70/96/Split-50/Ortho4×12/\n  Ortho5×12/Planck/Preonic/Numpad/Corne/Lily58\n- マトリクス配線オーバーレイは agent 1 の state+toggle のみ\n  (drawCanvas 統合は Phase 12+ に明示移譲)\n\n【タブレット用 Layer Panel オーバーレイ】(≤1024px)\n- #layout-layers-panel を画面右の固定オーバーレイ (幅 80vw / max 320px) に\n- 半透明バックドロップで背後を暗く\n\n【Cross-Studio】\n- Layout 変更時に依存関係チェック (Body の customLayoutData が古くなった\n  ときに toast 警告)\n- bulkRegenerate(): Keycap / Body / Layout を一括で updateModel + drawCanvas\n  ユーザー confirm 経由で window._kbsBulkRegenerate() として公開\n\n【共有リンク強化】\n- URL 共有を v2 形式 {_v:2, s:state, m:meta} に拡張\n  - meta = { t: title chars, p: profile, s: uSize, ts: epoch }\n  - 旧 v1 形式 (state 直接) も自動互換ロード\n- _kbsGetShareThumbnail(): 320×240 PNG dataURL を返す (X 共有や OG プレビュー用)\n\n【オフラインパッケージ準備】\n- lib/vendor/ ディレクトリ新設\n- download-vendor.sh: lz-string / FileSaver / jszip / three / harfbuzz の curl 一括取得\n- README.md: index.html の CDN URL → ローカル相対パス書換手順\n- Pyodide (~6MB) は CDN 利用推奨と明記\n\n【modules/keycap/ スケルトン】(段階的リファクタの土台)\n- modules/keycap/keycap-module.js を新設\n- LayoutModule / BodyModule と同じインターフェース\n  (init / activate / deactivate / getState / setState / getGroup / updateModel)\n- 現状は index.html 側のグローバル state / mainGroup / switchModule に委譲する\n  薄いラッパー\n- Phase 12+ で実際のロジック移動を進める足場\n\n【i18n / tooltip クリーンアップ】\n- 削除済 UI (Workflow Guide / Advanced Mode / Quick Action Bar / Tools modal)\n  関連の i18n キー (wf_step_*, lbl_advanced_mode, qa_*, tools_*, tool_*)\n- tooltip キー (hint_workflow_guide / hint_advanced_mode / hint_qa_bar)\n\nSanity-checked: node --check / --input-type=module --check 全 8 ファイル exit 0.","tree":{"sha":"f5d556248f32fd5aee2a6319d3b025487f732551","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hololocheck/keybordstudio/git/trees/f5d556248f32fd5aee2a6319d3b025487f732551"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hololocheck/keybordstudio/git/commits/54ae975853589beb8f3cd7e88be290830a71f7b6","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/218554521?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hololocheck/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hololocheck/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hololocheck/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hololocheck/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/hololocheck","id":218554521,"login":"hololocheck","node_id":"U_kgDODQbgmQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hololocheck/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hololocheck/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hololocheck/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hololocheck/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hololocheck/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/hololocheck","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/hololocheck/keybordstudio/commit/54ae975853589beb8f3cd7e88be290830a71f7b6","node_id":"C_kwDOSM83wtoAKDU0YWU5NzU4NTM1ODliZWI4ZjNjZDdlODhiZTI5MDgzMGE3MWY3YjY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/hololocheck/keybordstudio/commit/10ff1e22c2b44e2a3540000557efdee84695095e","sha":"10ff1e22c2b44e2a3540000557efdee84695095e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hololocheck/keybordstudio/commits/10ff1e22c2b44e2a3540000557efdee84695095e"}],"sha":"54ae975853589beb8f3cd7e88be290830a71f7b6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hololocheck/keybordstudio/commits/54ae975853589beb8f3cd7e88be290830a71f7b6"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/218554521?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hololocheck/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hololocheck/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hololocheck/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hololocheck/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/hololocheck","id":218554521,"login":"hololocheck","node_id":"U_kgDODQbgmQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hololocheck/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hololocheck/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hololocheck/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hololocheck/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hololocheck/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/hololocheck","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hololocheck/keybordstudio/commits/10ff1e22c2b44e2a3540000557efdee84695095e/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-04-26T20:06:39Z","email":"hangdajinzi647@gmail.com","name":"hololocheck"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-04-26T20:06:39Z","email":"hangdajinzi647@gmail.com","name":"hololocheck"},"message":"Remove Workflow Guide / Advanced Mode toggle / Quick Action Bar\n\nユーザー要望でサイドバー上部の制作フロー誘導と詳細モード、画面右下の\nクイックアクションバー (Tools modal 込み) を全て削除した。\n\n【削除したもの (Phase 6-1, 6-2, 6-3, 10+)】\n- 制作フロー誘導 (#workflow-guide / .wf-* / Phase 6-1 IIFE)\n  - 4 ステップバッジ (Layout / Body / Keycap / Export)\n  - _isLayoutDone / _isBodyDone / _isKeycapDone / _isExportDone\n  - _refreshWorkflowGuide ヘルパー\n- 詳細モードトグル (#advanced-mode-toggle / .adv-* / Phase 6-2 IIFE)\n  - localStorage kbs_advanced_mode 連携\n  - 4 セクションの data-mode=\"advanced\" 属性も併せて削除\n    (sec-texture / sec-utility / sec-import / sec-cross-section / sec-keycap-assist)\n- Quick Action Bar (#qa-bar / .qa-button / Phase 6-3 IIFE)\n  - クイック保存 / 出力 / プリフライト / ツール の4ボタン\n- Common Tools Modal (#tools-modal / Phase 10+ IIFE)\n  - スクリーンショット / コスト見積もり / エラー診断 / 履歴一覧\n\n【残したもの】\n- 既存のサイドバー (mod_keycap / mod_body / mod_layout select)\n- module-select の通常ハンドラ (_refreshWorkflowGuide 呼出のみ削除)\n- Phase 9 Keycap アシスト機能 (sec-keycap-assist) — 通常セクションとして表示\n- 既存のセクション (sec-texture / sec-utility / sec-import / sec-cross-section)\n  は data-mode 属性のみ削除し、コンテンツは保持\n- 環境バックアップ (.kbsproj 保存) / 製造前チェック / Body 出力など、\n  個別の機能は引き続き既存メニューから利用可能\n\ni18n / tooltip に残っている削除済 UI 用のキー (wf_step_*, lbl_advanced_mode,\nhint_workflow_guide, qa_*, tools_*, tool_*) は参照箇所がなくなったため\n動作には影響しない (将来のクリーンアップ対象として残置)。","tree":{"sha":"b5428991d81e779d4facc17e7997676ee4054947","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hololocheck/keybordstudio/git/trees/b5428991d81e779d4facc17e7997676ee4054947"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hololocheck/keybordstudio/git/commits/10ff1e22c2b44e2a3540000557efdee84695095e","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/218554521?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hololocheck/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hololocheck/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hololocheck/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hololocheck/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/hololocheck","id":218554521,"login":"hololocheck","node_id":"U_kgDODQbgmQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hololocheck/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hololocheck/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hololocheck/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hololocheck/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hololocheck/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/hololocheck","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/hololocheck/keybordstudio/commit/10ff1e22c2b44e2a3540000557efdee84695095e","node_id":"C_kwDOSM83wtoAKDEwZmYxZTIyYzJiNDRlMmEzNTQwMDAwNTU3ZWZkZWU4NDY5NTA5NWU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/hololocheck/keybordstudio/commit/94974e41723f45a0d030d6e7329e0ed9f881d1b5","sha":"94974e41723f45a0d030d6e7329e0ed9f881d1b5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hololocheck/keybordstudio/commits/94974e41723f45a0d030d6e7329e0ed9f881d1b5"}],"sha":"10ff1e22c2b44e2a3540000557efdee84695095e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hololocheck/keybordstudio/commits/10ff1e22c2b44e2a3540000557efdee84695095e"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/218554521?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hololocheck/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hololocheck/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hololocheck/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hololocheck/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/hololocheck","id":218554521,"login":"hololocheck","node_id":"U_kgDODQbgmQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hololocheck/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hololocheck/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hololocheck/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hololocheck/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hololocheck/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/hololocheck","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hololocheck/keybordstudio/commits/94974e41723f45a0d030d6e7329e0ed9f881d1b5/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-04-26T19:46:52Z","email":"hangdajinzi647@gmail.com","name":"hololocheck"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-04-26T19:46:52Z","email":"hangdajinzi647@gmail.com","name":"hololocheck"},"message":"Phase 8-10+: Layout/Keycap/Body batch + foundation enhancements + common tools\n\n並行 4 agent + 私で 30+ 機能を一括投入。約 1450 行の追加。\n\n【Phase 8: Layout Studio (agent 1)】\n- QMK info.json エクスポート (matrix 雛形付き)\n- スイッチ穴タイプ選択 (MX 14×14 / Choc 13.8 / Alps 15.5×12.8) + getSwitchHoleSize()\n- 選択シンボル左右ミラー\n- レイアウト寸法表 CSV エクスポート\n- 簡易エルゴノミクス評価 (全幅・高さ・キー数・homerow 距離)\n- 角度スナップトグル (5°)\n- マトリクス ID オーバーレイトグル\n\n【Phase 9 Keycap (agent 2、レート制限で i18n 後追い)】\n- 素材プリセット適用 (PLA/ABS/PETG/レジン → stemClearance/wallThickness/textHeight)\n- 文字彫刻深さプリセット (FDM/レジン/レーザー/インレイ)\n- プロファイル比較ビュー (Cherry/OEM/SA/XDA/DSA の高さ・傾き表)\n- ステム強度チェック (壁厚・補強リブ・クリアランス検査)\n- 押下クリアランス検査 (uSize × stab / SA R1 警告)\n- 行別一括生成 (R1-R4 + F)\n- キーセットテーマ保存/読込 (localStorage kbs_keycap_themes)\n- トップ面安全領域トグル\n- 実寸チェックシート SVG エクスポート\n\n【Phase 9 Body (agent 3)】\n- 重量・コスト推定 (体積×密度×単価、PLA/ABS/PETG/Nylon/Resin)\n- ネジ柱推奨位置サジェスト (4隅 + 70-100mm 間隔)\n- 熱圧入インサートガイド (M2/M2.5/M3 推奨穴径・深さ)\n- ガスケット圧縮シミュレーター (厚み×硬度×圧縮率 → 推奨内寸)\n- 音響チューニング 5 プリセット (hollow/bass/firm/silent/foam)\n- USB ポートテンプレート (USB-C/Mini/Micro/3.5mmジャック寸法)\n- タイピング角度検証 (前後高さ・有効角度算出)\n- バリエーション生成 5種 (low/standard/high/wedge/floating)\n\n【Phase 10 Foundation (agent 4 — レート制限部分実装)】\nmesh-fix-lib.js:\n- lightCleanup(V,T): JS側で WASM 前に重複頂点 + 縮退三角形を除去\n- STAGES 静的定数 (UI 進捗表示用 5段階)\n- FALLBACK_OPTIONS 静的定数 (修復失敗時の選択肢 enum)\n\n3dfont-engine.js:\n- diagnose(typefaceJSON): glyphCount/kerning/composite/missing 判定\n- _cleanupOutline: 重複点・微小サブパス・ゼロ面積除去\n- layoutMultiline(text, options): 多行レイアウトメタデータ\n- cacheStats(): subpath cache のヒット/ミス計測\n\n【Phase 10+ Common Tools (私担当)】\n画面右下 Quick Action Bar に「ツール」ボタンを追加。モーダルで:\n- 📷 スクリーンショット — Three.js / Layout 2D canvas → PNG\n- 💰 コスト見積もり — 5 材料 (PLA/ABS/PETG/Nylon/Resin) で重量×単価表\n- 🔧 エラー診断 — 環境チェック (UA/WebAssembly/Worker/IDB/THREE/FontEngine3D/MeshFix/Pyodide)\n  + window error / unhandledrejection を 50 件まで自動収集\n- 📜 履歴一覧 — Keycap history 世代 + 最終出力時刻\n\n【i18n】\n- en/jp keycap.js: Phase 9 Keycap (15キー) + 共通 Tools (5キー)\n- en/jp body.js: Phase 7-3 Cross-section + Phase 9 Body Assist (28キー)\n\n【スキップ・Phase 11+ バックログ】\n- HarfBuzz WASM (複雑文字 shaping) — 大規模、CDN 検討\n- オフラインパッケージ化 — CDN ローカル化、大規模\n- modules/keycap/ への分離リファクタ — 保守上重要だが大規模\n- Body 分割ケース設計 (ベッドサイズチェック程度の枠のみ)\n- 共有リンク強化 (サムネイル+メタ)\n- 依存関係チェック / 一括再生成 (cross-Studio)\n- mesh-fix-lib: AbortSignal キャンセル、changedRegions、3MF メタデータ検証\n- 3dfont-engine: variableAxes (fvar) 露出\n- Layout: テンプレートギャラリー拡充、配線補助の高度化\n\nSanity-checked: node --check / node --input-type=module --check 全 8 ファイル exit 0.","tree":{"sha":"6bd906c51dc274f2e37f43e01af027a7bf9f20be","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hololocheck/keybordstudio/git/trees/6bd906c51dc274f2e37f43e01af027a7bf9f20be"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hololocheck/keybordstudio/git/commits/94974e41723f45a0d030d6e7329e0ed9f881d1b5","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/218554521?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hololocheck/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hololocheck/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hololocheck/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hololocheck/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/hololocheck","id":218554521,"login":"hololocheck","node_id":"U_kgDODQbgmQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hololocheck/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hololocheck/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hololocheck/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hololocheck/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hololocheck/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/hololocheck","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/hololocheck/keybordstudio/commit/94974e41723f45a0d030d6e7329e0ed9f881d1b5","node_id":"C_kwDOSM83wtoAKDk0OTc0ZTQxNzIzZjQ1YTBkMDMwZDZlNzMyOWUwZWQ5Zjg4MWQxYjU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/hololocheck/keybordstudio/commit/504fbb9d456750426cb1ea2d060199706c26101c","sha":"504fbb9d456750426cb1ea2d060199706c26101c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hololocheck/keybordstudio/commits/504fbb9d456750426cb1ea2d060199706c26101c"}],"sha":"94974e41723f45a0d030d6e7329e0ed9f881d1b5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hololocheck/keybordstudio/commits/94974e41723f45a0d030d6e7329e0ed9f881d1b5"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/218554521?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hololocheck/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hololocheck/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hololocheck/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hololocheck/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/hololocheck","id":218554521,"login":"hololocheck","node_id":"U_kgDODQbgmQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hololocheck/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hololocheck/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hololocheck/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hololocheck/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hololocheck/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/hololocheck","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hololocheck/keybordstudio/commits/504fbb9d456750426cb1ea2d060199706c26101c/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-04-26T13:21:23Z","email":"hangdajinzi647@gmail.com","name":"hololocheck"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-04-26T13:21:23Z","email":"hangdajinzi647@gmail.com","name":"hololocheck"},"message":"Phase 7: Body Generator triple feature (PCB import / collision check / cross-section)\n\n3つの機能を並行 agent + 私で同時実装。各 agent は body-module.js の異なる\n箇所を編集する形で衝突なくマージ完了。\n\n【Phase 7-1: PCB / プレート取込 (agent A)】\n- DXF / SVG ファイルから PCB 外形・スイッチ穴・ネジ穴を抽出する簡易パーサ\n- 半径による分類: 0.5-2.0mm = ネジ穴 / 2.0-8.0mm = スイッチ穴 / その他 = 外形\n- SVG 14×14mm 矩形はスイッチ穴扱い、path/line は outline 蓄積\n- state.pcbImportName / pcbImportData に保存\n- UI: Body の Layout セクションに「PCB / プレート読込」ボタン\n  - 読み込み後、検出件数 (outline / switchHoles / screwHoles) をインライン表示\n\n【Phase 7-2: 内部干渉チェック (agent B)】\n- runBodyCollisionCheck() で state レベルの干渉警告を生成\n- 検査項目:\n  - 壁厚 vs ベゼル\n  - ガスケット幅・厚 vs 利用可能スペース\n  - スタンドオフ径・高さ\n  - USB ポート位置 (端から 5–95% 範囲) と開口マージン\n  - バッテリースペース ON 時の底厚\n  - PCB クリアランス (err < 1.0mm / warn < 2.0mm)\n  - 40% レイアウト + 複数アドオン\n- UI: エクスポートボタン下に「干渉チェック実行」ボタン\n- インラインの折りたたみ式結果パネル (err/warn/info アイコン + ✓ OK 項目)\n\n【Phase 7-3: ケース断面ビュー (本セッション私担当)】\n- _bodyCrossSectionPlane: Body 用の独立した THREE.Plane (Keycap 用とは別)\n- _updateBodyCrossSectionPlane(): state.crossSectionAxis (x/y/z) と Pos から法線/距離を更新\n- mat() を clipping 対応に: state.crossSectionEnabled なら clippingPlanes を渡し\n  side=DoubleSide / clipShadows=true で表示\n- updateModel 冒頭で _updateBodyCrossSectionPlane() を呼んで毎回同期\n- UI: エクスポート下に「ケース断面ビュー」セクション (toggle / 軸 / 位置 ±150mm)\n- renderer.localClippingEnabled は Phase 4-3 で main 側で true 化済みなので追加設定不要\n\n【並行 agent の編集分離】\n- agent A: state init L83-86 + UI (Layout 後) + bindUI 内 + ファイル末尾 _parsePCBImportDXF/SVG\n- agent B: bindUI 末尾 (collision button) + 関数追加 (export 前) + body-ui.html 末尾\n- 私: state init 末尾 (crossSection*) + mat() 更新 + updateModel 冒頭 + body-ui.html 最末尾 (cross-section UI)\n- すべて非重複の物理位置で編集 → Edit ツールの unique-anchor で安全にマージ\n\n【i18n】\n- en/jp body.js に各 Phase のキーを追加\n  - body_lbl_pcb_import / body_btn_pcb_import (Phase 7-1)\n  - body_btn_collision_check (Phase 7-2)\n  - body_h_cross_section / body_lbl_enable_cross_section / body_lbl_cross_section_axis /\n    body_lbl_cross_section_pos / body_opt_axis_x/y/z / body_cross_section_note (Phase 7-3)\n\nSanity-checked: node --input-type=module --check 全 4 ファイルとも exit 0.","tree":{"sha":"6c9afc08ef844313bf5bca1c316d41604911046f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hololocheck/keybordstudio/git/trees/6c9afc08ef844313bf5bca1c316d41604911046f"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hololocheck/keybordstudio/git/commits/504fbb9d456750426cb1ea2d060199706c26101c","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/218554521?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hololocheck/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hololocheck/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hololocheck/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hololocheck/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/hololocheck","id":218554521,"login":"hololocheck","node_id":"U_kgDODQbgmQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hololocheck/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hololocheck/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hololocheck/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hololocheck/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hololocheck/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/hololocheck","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/hololocheck/keybordstudio/commit/504fbb9d456750426cb1ea2d060199706c26101c","node_id":"C_kwDOSM83wtoAKDUwNGZiYjlkNDU2NzUwNDI2Y2IxZWEyZDA2MDE5OTcwNmMyNjEwMWM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/hololocheck/keybordstudio/commit/f3a7d8ae030b3ed0902dd84fad4047eb49497bac","sha":"f3a7d8ae030b3ed0902dd84fad4047eb49497bac","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hololocheck/keybordstudio/commits/f3a7d8ae030b3ed0902dd84fad4047eb49497bac"}],"sha":"504fbb9d456750426cb1ea2d060199706c26101c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hololocheck/keybordstudio/commits/504fbb9d456750426cb1ea2d060199706c26101c"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/218554521?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hololocheck/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hololocheck/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hololocheck/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hololocheck/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/hololocheck","id":218554521,"login":"hololocheck","node_id":"U_kgDODQbgmQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hololocheck/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hololocheck/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hololocheck/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hololocheck/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hololocheck/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/hololocheck","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hololocheck/keybordstudio/commits/f3a7d8ae030b3ed0902dd84fad4047eb49497bac/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-04-26T13:13:06Z","email":"hangdajinzi647@gmail.com","name":"hololocheck"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-04-26T13:13:06Z","email":"hangdajinzi647@gmail.com","name":"hololocheck"},"message":"Phase 6-2 + 6-3: Advanced mode toggle + Quick Action Bar (3 Studio 共通 UX)\n\n【Phase 6-2: 基本/詳細モード】\n- サイドバー上部に詳細モードトグル追加 (#advanced-mode-toggle)\n- 4 つの上級者向けセクション (h3) に data-mode=\"advanced\":\n  - sec-texture     画像テクスチャ\n  - sec-utility     Utility\n  - sec-import      外部モデル取込\n  - sec-cross-section 断面ビュー\n- applyAdvancedMode: h3 とその次の h3 までの兄弟要素を一括 hide/show\n  - 元の display を _wasAdv データ属性で記憶し、復元時に削除\n  - body.advanced-mode クラスでスタイリング側からも参照可能\n- localStorage の kbs_advanced_mode で設定保存\n  - デフォルト: 基本モード (OFF) → 初心者が迷わないシンプル UI\n- カスタムスイッチ風トグル CSS (アクセントカラー + 滑らかな thumb 遷移)\n\n【Phase 6-3: Quick Action Bar (並行 agent 作業)】\n画面右下に固定の3アイコンボタン (3 Studio 共通):\n- 💾 クイック保存 → btn-env-export を click (.kbsproj 保存)\n- 🚀 クイック出力 → 現モジュールに応じた export を呼ぶ\n  - keycap: btn-export-single click\n  - body:   showBodyExportDialog()\n  - layout: openExportDialog()\n  - 完了時に kbs_last_export_at を localStorage 記録 → workflow guide done\n- ✓ 製造前チェック → btn-preflight-check を click\n\nCSS:\n- 縦並び 44x44px の丸型ボタン、アクセントカラーで発光\n- ≤1024px で 38px に縮小\n- ≤768px で横並びに切替 + bottom 70px (mobile bottom-nav 回避)\n\n【i18n / tooltip】\n- en: lbl_advanced_mode \"Advanced mode\" / qa_save \"Quick save\" / qa_export / qa_preflight\n- ja: lbl_advanced_mode \"詳細モード\" / qa_save \"クイック保存\" / qa_export / qa_preflight\n- en/ja: hint_advanced_mode + hint_qa_bar をそれぞれ追加\n\n【並行作業】\nPhase 6-3 は general-purpose agent をバックグラウンド起動し、index.html 末尾\n(</body>, </style>, </script> 直前) と i18n / tooltip 末尾のみを編集する形で\n担当。私は冒頭の workflow-guide-row 直後 + sec-* に data-mode 付与で並行作業。\n編集箇所が物理的に分離していたため衝突なくマージ完了。","tree":{"sha":"8683d6df878e95c156136ae55409a06c25738c95","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hololocheck/keybordstudio/git/trees/8683d6df878e95c156136ae55409a06c25738c95"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hololocheck/keybordstudio/git/commits/f3a7d8ae030b3ed0902dd84fad4047eb49497bac","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/218554521?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hololocheck/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hololocheck/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hololocheck/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hololocheck/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/hololocheck","id":218554521,"login":"hololocheck","node_id":"U_kgDODQbgmQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hololocheck/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hololocheck/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hololocheck/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hololocheck/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hololocheck/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/hololocheck","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/hololocheck/keybordstudio/commit/f3a7d8ae030b3ed0902dd84fad4047eb49497bac","node_id":"C_kwDOSM83wtoAKGYzYTdkOGFlMDMwYjNlZDA5MDJkZDg0ZmFkNDA0N2ViNDk0OTdiYWM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/hololocheck/keybordstudio/commit/09fd0adb2f22a0d8ffd79f67a9e64a2c8c31d9e0","sha":"09fd0adb2f22a0d8ffd79f67a9e64a2c8c31d9e0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hololocheck/keybordstudio/commits/09fd0adb2f22a0d8ffd79f67a9e64a2c8c31d9e0"}],"sha":"f3a7d8ae030b3ed0902dd84fad4047eb49497bac","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hololocheck/keybordstudio/commits/f3a7d8ae030b3ed0902dd84fad4047eb49497bac"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/218554521?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hololocheck/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hololocheck/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hololocheck/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hololocheck/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/hololocheck","id":218554521,"login":"hololocheck","node_id":"U_kgDODQbgmQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hololocheck/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hololocheck/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hololocheck/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hololocheck/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hololocheck/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/hololocheck","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hololocheck/keybordstudio/commits/09fd0adb2f22a0d8ffd79f67a9e64a2c8c31d9e0/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-04-26T13:03:51Z","email":"hangdajinzi647@gmail.com","name":"hololocheck"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-04-26T13:03:51Z","email":"hangdajinzi647@gmail.com","name":"hololocheck"},"message":"Phase 6-1: Workflow Guide (Layout → Body → Keycap → Export)\n\n【目的】\n新規ユーザーが「次に何をすればいいか」を一目で分かるよう、\n制作フローを4ステップに可視化する誘導 UI を追加。\n\n【UI】\n- サイドバー上部、module-select の直前に4ボタン+矢印を配置\n- 各ステップは数字バッジ + ラベル (\"1 レイアウト\" 等)\n- 状態によって見た目が変わる:\n  - todo (グレー):   未着手\n  - active (シアン): 現在編集中のモジュール\n  - done (緑+✓):    意図的な作業の形跡あり (= 状態判定で「触られた」と判定)\n\n【状態判定ロジック】\n- _isLayoutDone: symbols/cadLines が存在する OR activePreset 選択済\n- _isBodyDone:   layout/mountType がデフォルトから変更 OR テキスト/SVG が有効\n- _isKeycapDone: text が default ''A'' から変更 OR text2/side/SVG/ストラップ穴/画像 有効\n- _isExportDone: localStorage の kbs_last_export_at に記録あり\n\n【ボタン動作】\n- Layout/Body/Keycap ボタン: module-select を切替 (既存の switchModule を発火)\n- Export ボタン: 現在のモジュールに応じて適切なエクスポートを呼ぶ\n  - body:   bodyModule.showBodyExportDialog()\n  - layout: layoutModule.openExportDialog()\n  - keycap: btn-export-single をクリック\n  - 完了時に kbs_last_export_at を localStorage に記録 → done バッジに\n\n【ガイド更新タイミング】\n- module-select 変更時\n- 各 wf-step ボタンクリック時\n- 初期表示 (setTimeout 100ms)\n将来的に updateModel フック経由で頻繁に refresh する余地あり。\n\n【レスポンシブ】\n- 1024px 以下ではラベル非表示、数字バッジのみで省スペース表示\n\n【i18n + tooltip】\n- en/ja: wf_step_layout / wf_step_body / wf_step_keycap / wf_step_export\n- en/ja: hint_workflow_guide でフロー全体の説明を追加\n\n【Phase 6 残項目（未着手）】\n- 6-2: 基本/詳細モードの整理 (各サイドバー項目に basic/advanced タグ)\n- 6-3: 3 Studio 共通の保存・出力 UX 統一感\n\nこれらは別セッションで取り組む。","tree":{"sha":"a47c0ae6c1233ca2dec1396b70de2db2590576ad","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hololocheck/keybordstudio/git/trees/a47c0ae6c1233ca2dec1396b70de2db2590576ad"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hololocheck/keybordstudio/git/commits/09fd0adb2f22a0d8ffd79f67a9e64a2c8c31d9e0","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/218554521?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hololocheck/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hololocheck/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hololocheck/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hololocheck/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/hololocheck","id":218554521,"login":"hololocheck","node_id":"U_kgDODQbgmQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hololocheck/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hololocheck/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hololocheck/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hololocheck/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hololocheck/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/hololocheck","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/hololocheck/keybordstudio/commit/09fd0adb2f22a0d8ffd79f67a9e64a2c8c31d9e0","node_id":"C_kwDOSM83wtoAKDA5ZmQwYWRiMmYyMmEwZDhmZmQ3OWY2N2E5ZTY0YTJjOGMzMWQ5ZTA","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/hololocheck/keybordstudio/commit/19d2d597c867a992427b13a7607bb1f66a664a05","sha":"19d2d597c867a992427b13a7607bb1f66a664a05","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hololocheck/keybordstudio/commits/19d2d597c867a992427b13a7607bb1f66a664a05"}],"sha":"09fd0adb2f22a0d8ffd79f67a9e64a2c8c31d9e0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hololocheck/keybordstudio/commits/09fd0adb2f22a0d8ffd79f67a9e64a2c8c31d9e0"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/218554521?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hololocheck/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hololocheck/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hololocheck/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hololocheck/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/hololocheck","id":218554521,"login":"hololocheck","node_id":"U_kgDODQbgmQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hololocheck/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hololocheck/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hololocheck/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hololocheck/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hololocheck/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/hololocheck","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hololocheck/keybordstudio/commits/19d2d597c867a992427b13a7607bb1f66a664a05/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-04-26T12:57:26Z","email":"hangdajinzi647@gmail.com","name":"hololocheck"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-04-26T12:57:26Z","email":"hangdajinzi647@gmail.com","name":"hololocheck"},"message":"Phase 5: foundation strengthening (font worker + repair report/profiles/tests)\n\n【Phase 5-1: 3dfont-engine Web Worker 化】\n- workers/font-parse-worker.js を新設\n- importScripts で 3dfont-engine.js をロードし FontEngine3D.parse をワーカー内で実行\n- lazy getter は postMessage で送れないため worker 内で全グリフ展開\n  → main へは構造的に転送可能な plain JSON を返す\n- index.html に _ensureFontWorker / parseFontAsync を追加（lazy init + 失敗時同期fallback）\n- ArrayBuffer は transferable で渡してコピー回避\n\n【Phase 5-2: mesh-fix-lib 修復前後レポート】\n- repairObject で diagnose を before/after 両方取得\n- buildRepairReport: vertex/triangle 数, 境界, 非多様体, 穴, シェル, watertight,\n  manifold を before/after 比較で構造化\n- delta フィールド: 増減量と merged/nmFixed/holesFilled をまとめて表示\n- _summarizeRepair: 修復された項目と残存問題を日本語サマリで返す\n\n【Phase 5-3: mesh-fix-lib 修復プロファイル】\n- MeshFixLib.REPAIR_PROFILES 静的定数 (5種類):\n  - fast:          最低限の修復のみ、軽量メッシュ向け\n  - standard:      既定値 (v1.0 互換)\n  - detail:        細部保持 (テキスト刻印・細い形状向け、merge ε 小さく)\n  - strong:        強力修復 (voxelRemesh、形状崩れても閉じる)\n  - slicer-compat: Bambu/Orca 確実読込 (watertight/manifold 強制)\n- repairObject(V, T, onProgress, ''profile-name'' | options) — 文字列ならプロファイル展開\n\n【Phase 5-4: テストメッシュ集 + ベンチマーク】\n- lib/mesh-fix-test-set.js を新設\n- MESH_TESTS: 5種類の固定サンプル\n  - unit_cube              完全立方体 (退化検出)\n  - cube_with_hole         穴あき (修復で境界が減るか)\n  - cube_duplicate_verts   重複頂点 (merge されるか)\n  - cube_degenerate_tri    縮退三角形 (削除されるか)\n  - cube_flipped_normal    法線反転 (winding 修正)\n- runMeshFixTests(lib) → 各テスト ok 判定 + 詳細レポート配列\n- benchmarkMeshFix(lib, sizes, iter) → サイズ別スケーラビリティ計測\n- ブラウザでもCommonJSでもインポート可能\n\n修復品質の退化を将来検出できるよう、テストの期待条件を fullReport ベースで\n書いてあるので、「形状を変えずに直っている」を CI 風に確認可能。","tree":{"sha":"8a4ad481e42cc1461587dd0a56666f1a64b1a8a1","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hololocheck/keybordstudio/git/trees/8a4ad481e42cc1461587dd0a56666f1a64b1a8a1"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hololocheck/keybordstudio/git/commits/19d2d597c867a992427b13a7607bb1f66a664a05","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/218554521?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hololocheck/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hololocheck/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hololocheck/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hololocheck/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/hololocheck","id":218554521,"login":"hololocheck","node_id":"U_kgDODQbgmQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hololocheck/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hololocheck/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hololocheck/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hololocheck/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hololocheck/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/hololocheck","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/hololocheck/keybordstudio/commit/19d2d597c867a992427b13a7607bb1f66a664a05","node_id":"C_kwDOSM83wtoAKDE5ZDJkNTk3Yzg2N2E5OTI0MjdiMTNhNzYwN2JiMWY2NmE2NjRhMDU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/hololocheck/keybordstudio/commit/5f145c5f98e76a1cd5271b107c1078a7987af1a0","sha":"5f145c5f98e76a1cd5271b107c1078a7987af1a0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hololocheck/keybordstudio/commits/5f145c5f98e76a1cd5271b107c1078a7987af1a0"}],"sha":"19d2d597c867a992427b13a7607bb1f66a664a05","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hololocheck/keybordstudio/commits/19d2d597c867a992427b13a7607bb1f66a664a05"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/218554521?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hololocheck/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hololocheck/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hololocheck/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hololocheck/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/hololocheck","id":218554521,"login":"hololocheck","node_id":"U_kgDODQbgmQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hololocheck/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hololocheck/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hololocheck/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hololocheck/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hololocheck/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/hololocheck","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hololocheck/keybordstudio/commits/5f145c5f98e76a1cd5271b107c1078a7987af1a0/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-04-26T12:54:21Z","email":"hangdajinzi647@gmail.com","name":"hololocheck"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-04-26T12:54:21Z","email":"hangdajinzi647@gmail.com","name":"hololocheck"},"message":"Phase 4: project file (.kbsproj) + cross-section + preflight + KLE import\n\n【Phase 4-2: .kbsproj プロジェクトファイル形式】\n既存の「環境バックアップ」を拡張して 3 Studio 統合プロジェクトに進化:\n- Body / Layout の state を JSON に追加\n- BodyGalleryDB_V1 / LayoutGalleryDB_V1 もバックアップ\n- 拡張子 .kbsproj、_backupType = ''kbsproj'' (legacy ''kcg_environment'' も互換)\n- import 時は body / layout が利用可能なら setState で復元\n\n【Phase 4-3: キーキャップ断面ビュー】\n- WebGLRenderer.localClippingEnabled = true、_crossSectionPlane を共有\n- state.crossSectionEnabled / crossSectionAxis (x/y/z) / crossSectionPos\n- material 生成時に clippingPlanes 参照を割当（heavy/light 両モード対応）\n- UI: ストラップ穴セクション直後に「断面ビュー」セクションを新設\n  - toggle / 軸選択 / 位置スライダー (-15〜+15mm)\n- 出力には影響しない注釈を表示\n\n【Phase 4-4: 製造前チェックリスト】\n- エクスポートボタン直前に「製造前チェック」ボタン\n- モーダルで以下を診断:\n  - 文字深さ / フォントサイズ / 壁厚 / ステムクリアランス\n  - 本体色と文字色の被り / SVG 未読込 / インポートモデル可視\n  - ストラップ穴サイズ＆文字との干渉\n  - AMS スロットの重複 / 断面ビュー残置\n- ❌ err / ⚠️ warn / ℹ️ info の3レベル + ✓ OK 項目を折りたたみ表示\n\n【Phase 4-5: Layout Studio に KLE インポート追加】\n- インポートセクションに textarea + 「KLE インポート」ボタン\n- 自前 _parseKLERaw 実装 (依存ゼロ): 外側 [] 自動補完、metadata skip、\n  w/h/x/y モディファイア対応、ラベルは1行目のみ抽出\n- _kleWidthToSymbolType: w に応じて 1u / 1.25u / 2u-stab / 6.25u-stab 等を選択\n- importKLERawData: keys を Layout の symbol として一括追加\n\n【スキップ項目（バックログ）】\n- Phase 4-6 プレート自動生成強化: 既存の exportToDXF が symbol → DXF を出力するため\n  最低限のプレート出力は既に動作。スイッチ穴14x14、スタビ穴、外周自動の高度化は\n  product_roadmap.md 経由で Phase 6 以降。\n\n【i18n】\nen/ja に断面ビュー (7キー)・製造前チェック (3キー) を追加。","tree":{"sha":"a768da49b9ab8bddff3030659343fdd6dfcbfc07","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hololocheck/keybordstudio/git/trees/a768da49b9ab8bddff3030659343fdd6dfcbfc07"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hololocheck/keybordstudio/git/commits/5f145c5f98e76a1cd5271b107c1078a7987af1a0","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/218554521?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hololocheck/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hololocheck/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hololocheck/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hololocheck/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/hololocheck","id":218554521,"login":"hololocheck","node_id":"U_kgDODQbgmQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hololocheck/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hololocheck/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hololocheck/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hololocheck/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hololocheck/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/hololocheck","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/hololocheck/keybordstudio/commit/5f145c5f98e76a1cd5271b107c1078a7987af1a0","node_id":"C_kwDOSM83wtoAKDVmMTQ1YzVmOThlNzZhMWNkNTI3MWIxMDdjMTA3OGE3OTg3YWYxYTA","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/hololocheck/keybordstudio/commit/e8a7d31ca8793e02c29a0e92d1e75acc136802f8","sha":"e8a7d31ca8793e02c29a0e92d1e75acc136802f8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hololocheck/keybordstudio/commits/e8a7d31ca8793e02c29a0e92d1e75acc136802f8"}],"sha":"5f145c5f98e76a1cd5271b107c1078a7987af1a0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hololocheck/keybordstudio/commits/5f145c5f98e76a1cd5271b107c1078a7987af1a0"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/218554521?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hololocheck/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hololocheck/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hololocheck/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hololocheck/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/hololocheck","id":218554521,"login":"hololocheck","node_id":"U_kgDODQbgmQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hololocheck/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hololocheck/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hololocheck/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hololocheck/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hololocheck/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/hololocheck","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hololocheck/keybordstudio/commits/e8a7d31ca8793e02c29a0e92d1e75acc136802f8/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-04-26T12:41:11Z","email":"hangdajinzi647@gmail.com","name":"hololocheck"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-04-26T12:41:11Z","email":"hangdajinzi647@gmail.com","name":"hololocheck"},"message":"Strap hole: add 4-side wall support (top + front/back/left/right)\n\nストラップ穴を上面だけでなく4側面の壁にも開けられるようにした。\n\n【追加】\n- state.strapHoleFace: ''top'' | ''front'' | ''back'' | ''left'' | ''right''\n- UI: 「面」select を「形状」と並べて配置（5択）\n\n【ジオメトリ】\n1. 円柱 / カプセルを生成 (CapsuleGeometry / CylinderGeometry はデフォルト Y 軸長手)\n2. slot の長手を「壁の水平方向」に倒す\n   - top / front / back: 長手 X 軸 (rotateZ π/2)\n   - left / right:       長手 Z 軸 (rotateX π/2)\n3. 貫通軸を世界座標で合わせる\n   - top:        Y 軸貫通 (回転なし)\n   - front/back: rotateX(π/2) で Y→Z\n   - left/right: rotateZ(π/2) で Y→X (slot は既に X 貫通なのでスキップ)\n4. 貫通軸まわりで angle 回転 (slot のみ)\n5. 位置スライダー (state.strapHoleX / strapHoleZ) を「面ローカル UV」として\n   世界座標へマップ:\n   - top:         (u, 0, v) — u=X, v=Z\n   - front/back:  (u, v, 0) — u=X, v=Y(高さ)\n   - left/right:  (0, v, u) — u=Z(奥行き), v=Y(高さ)\n\n【UX】\n- 面切替時に「位置 X / 位置 Z」のラベルを動的に変更\n  - top:        位置 X / 位置 Z\n  - front/back: 位置 X (横) / 位置 Y (高さ)\n  - left/right: 位置 Z (奥行き) / 位置 Y (高さ)\n- light モードでは半透明赤シリンダー/カプセルでリアルタイム位置確認\n- heavy で実際に CSG 減算で穴を空ける（既存パスの再利用）\n\n【i18n】\nen/ja に lbl_strap_hole_face / opt_face_top/front/back/left/right を追加","tree":{"sha":"4fb11d033db3f509f2e8dfdf1969865ca303e179","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hololocheck/keybordstudio/git/trees/4fb11d033db3f509f2e8dfdf1969865ca303e179"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hololocheck/keybordstudio/git/commits/e8a7d31ca8793e02c29a0e92d1e75acc136802f8","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/218554521?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hololocheck/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hololocheck/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hololocheck/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hololocheck/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/hololocheck","id":218554521,"login":"hololocheck","node_id":"U_kgDODQbgmQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hololocheck/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hololocheck/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hololocheck/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hololocheck/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hololocheck/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/hololocheck","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/hololocheck/keybordstudio/commit/e8a7d31ca8793e02c29a0e92d1e75acc136802f8","node_id":"C_kwDOSM83wtoAKGU4YTdkMzFjYTg3OTNlMDJjMjlhMGU5MmQxZTc1YWNjMTM2ODAyZjg","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/hololocheck/keybordstudio/commit/8ef412faa6b4a8318bbfb39ba49598c2276fbb0c","sha":"8ef412faa6b4a8318bbfb39ba49598c2276fbb0c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hololocheck/keybordstudio/commits/8ef412faa6b4a8318bbfb39ba49598c2276fbb0c"}],"sha":"e8a7d31ca8793e02c29a0e92d1e75acc136802f8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hololocheck/keybordstudio/commits/e8a7d31ca8793e02c29a0e92d1e75acc136802f8"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/218554521?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hololocheck/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hololocheck/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hololocheck/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hololocheck/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/hololocheck","id":218554521,"login":"hololocheck","node_id":"U_kgDODQbgmQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hololocheck/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hololocheck/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hololocheck/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hololocheck/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hololocheck/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/hololocheck","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hololocheck/keybordstudio/commits/8ef412faa6b4a8318bbfb39ba49598c2276fbb0c/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-04-26T12:32:10Z","email":"hangdajinzi647@gmail.com","name":"hololocheck"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-04-26T12:32:10Z","email":"hangdajinzi647@gmail.com","name":"hololocheck"},"message":"Add Keycap Strap Hole mode (pendant / keychain through-hole)\n\nペンダント・キーホルダー化のため、キーキャップに貫通穴を空ける機能を追加。\n位置とサイズはユーザーが自由に変更できる（要望通り）。\n\n【UI】\nSVG セクションと色設定の間に「ストラップ穴」セクションを新設:\n- toggle: ストラップ穴を開ける\n- 形状: 円形 / 長穴 (CapsuleGeometry, 古い THREE 環境では BoxGeometry にフォールバック)\n- 穴径 (1〜8mm, 0.1mm刻み)\n- 位置 X / Z (-15〜+15mm, 0.1mm刻み)\n- 長穴選択時のみ表示: 長穴の長さ (1〜15mm) + 回転角度 (-90〜+90°)\n\n【ジオメトリ】\nupdateModel({light:false}) で CSG SUBTRACTION:\n- 円形: CylinderGeometry(r, r, 200) を Y 軸貫通配置\n- 長穴: CapsuleGeometry を rotateZ で X 軸方向に倒し、rotateY で角度回転\n- 既存の _csgCachedSubtract (vertex+bbox ハッシュ LRU) で再計算スキップ\n- importedGeo subtract の直後・engrave subtract の前に挿入\n  → engrave 文字は穴の縁に正しく回り込む\n\n【light モードのプレビュー】\n- light モードでは CSG をスキップし、半透明赤シリンダー/カプセルで\n  「ここに穴が空く」位置をリアルタイム表示\n- 操作停止 220ms 後の heavy モードで実際に穴が空く\n\n【i18n + tooltip】\n- en/ja に h_strap_hole / lbl_enable_strap_hole / lbl_strap_hole_diameter /\n  lbl_strap_hole_shape / opt_strap_circle / opt_strap_slot /\n  lbl_strap_hole_x / lbl_strap_hole_z / lbl_strap_hole_length /\n  lbl_strap_hole_angle を追加\n- tooltip/keycap/hints.js に hint_strap_hole を ja/en で追加\n\n【メモリ】\nユーザー提示の戦略文書 (3 Studio 機能追加リスト・UX 課題・基盤強化方針) を\nmemory/product_roadmap.md に保存。Phase 4 以降の判断材料として使う。","tree":{"sha":"62d3dd677c77977da243c1c465cfb8248798297e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hololocheck/keybordstudio/git/trees/62d3dd677c77977da243c1c465cfb8248798297e"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hololocheck/keybordstudio/git/commits/8ef412faa6b4a8318bbfb39ba49598c2276fbb0c","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/218554521?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hololocheck/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hololocheck/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hololocheck/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hololocheck/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/hololocheck","id":218554521,"login":"hololocheck","node_id":"U_kgDODQbgmQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hololocheck/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hololocheck/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hololocheck/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hololocheck/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hololocheck/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/hololocheck","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/hololocheck/keybordstudio/commit/8ef412faa6b4a8318bbfb39ba49598c2276fbb0c","node_id":"C_kwDOSM83wtoAKDhlZjQxMmZhYTZiNGE4MzE4YmJmYjM5YmE0OTU5OGMyMjc2ZmJiMGM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/hololocheck/keybordstudio/commit/007c99fd07627f2679d2a5737e7c3e765f7f3d93","sha":"007c99fd07627f2679d2a5737e7c3e765f7f3d93","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hololocheck/keybordstudio/commits/007c99fd07627f2679d2a5737e7c3e765f7f3d93"}],"sha":"8ef412faa6b4a8318bbfb39ba49598c2276fbb0c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hololocheck/keybordstudio/commits/8ef412faa6b4a8318bbfb39ba49598c2276fbb0c"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/218554521?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hololocheck/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hololocheck/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hololocheck/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hololocheck/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/hololocheck","id":218554521,"login":"hololocheck","node_id":"U_kgDODQbgmQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hololocheck/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hololocheck/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hololocheck/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hololocheck/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hololocheck/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/hololocheck","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hololocheck/keybordstudio/commits/007c99fd07627f2679d2a5737e7c3e765f7f3d93/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-04-26T12:21:49Z","email":"hangdajinzi647@gmail.com","name":"hololocheck"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-04-26T12:21:49Z","email":"hangdajinzi647@gmail.com","name":"hololocheck"},"message":"Phase 3: CSG Web Worker offloading (eliminate engrave-CSG main-thread freeze)\n\n【目的】\nlight/heavy 二段レンダリングで体感は隠せていたが、\nheavy 確定時の 100–500ms ヒッチ自体を消すため CSG をワーカー化。\n\n【workers/csg-worker.js (新規)】\n- ES module worker。three.js + three-bvh-csg を CDN 直 import\n  (importmap は worker に継承されないため URL 直書き)\n- Brush + Evaluator を Worker 内で動かして UI スレッドを解放\n- 入出力は Float32 / Uint16/32 を transferable で渡す（コピーレス）\n- メッセージプロトコル: { id, op:''sub''|''add'', a, b } → { id, ok, g | error }\n\n【index.html】\n- _ensureCsgWorker(): lazy 初期化、失敗時は false で印付け同期フォールバック\n- _csgSubtractAsync(): Promise ベース。Worker 経由 / 失敗時は main thread で評価\n- updateModel({light:false}) の engrave-CSG パスをハイブリッド化:\n    cache hit  → 同期適用 (即座に最終形状)\n    cache miss → Worker に投げ、CSG 前 base で先にメッシュ作成\n                  → 結果到着で KeycapBody の geometry だけ差し替え\n- _currentUpdateId カウンタで race condition を保護:\n  古い update の Worker 結果が遅れて返ってきても破棄 (新状態を上書きしない)\n- onerror で Worker クラッシュ時に同期フォールバックへ自動切替\n\n【UX 体感】\n- light (rAF, ~16ms) で文字位置が即座に出る\n- 操作停止 220ms 後 → 通常は cache ヒットで即時最終形、初回は Worker が\n  バックグラウンド処理中も UI は完全に滑らか、結果到着で凹みが現れる\n- 連打中は最新 update のみ生き残るので「古いゴースト」は出ない\n\nこれで OTF + engrave + 漢字テキストでも UI が止まらなくなる。","tree":{"sha":"e7c3dc22d40d7c18b07495a6307fe30ff0d61424","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hololocheck/keybordstudio/git/trees/e7c3dc22d40d7c18b07495a6307fe30ff0d61424"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hololocheck/keybordstudio/git/commits/007c99fd07627f2679d2a5737e7c3e765f7f3d93","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/218554521?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hololocheck/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hololocheck/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hololocheck/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hololocheck/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/hololocheck","id":218554521,"login":"hololocheck","node_id":"U_kgDODQbgmQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hololocheck/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hololocheck/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hololocheck/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hololocheck/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hololocheck/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/hololocheck","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/hololocheck/keybordstudio/commit/007c99fd07627f2679d2a5737e7c3e765f7f3d93","node_id":"C_kwDOSM83wtoAKDAwN2M5OWZkMDc2MjdmMjY3OWQyYTU3MzdlN2MzZTc2NWY3ZjNkOTM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/hololocheck/keybordstudio/commit/99e6e00d00a1242b87dd59b8ed15c61ae9be240f","sha":"99e6e00d00a1242b87dd59b8ed15c61ae9be240f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hololocheck/keybordstudio/commits/99e6e00d00a1242b87dd59b8ed15c61ae9be240f"}],"sha":"007c99fd07627f2679d2a5737e7c3e765f7f3d93","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hololocheck/keybordstudio/commits/007c99fd07627f2679d2a5737e7c3e765f7f3d93"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/218554521?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hololocheck/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hololocheck/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hololocheck/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hololocheck/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/hololocheck","id":218554521,"login":"hololocheck","node_id":"U_kgDODQbgmQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hololocheck/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hololocheck/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hololocheck/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hololocheck/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hololocheck/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/hololocheck","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hololocheck/keybordstudio/commits/99e6e00d00a1242b87dd59b8ed15c61ae9be240f/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-04-26T12:01:31Z","email":"hangdajinzi647@gmail.com","name":"hololocheck"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-04-26T12:01:31Z","email":"hangdajinzi647@gmail.com","name":"hololocheck"},"message":"Two-stage rendering + font warming for OTF/engrave responsiveness\n\n【入力中の重さを根本的に隠す: light/heavy 二段レンダリング】\n\nupdateModel(opts):\n- opts.light=true  ... 入力中の軽量プレビュー。重い CSG (engrave subtract /\n                       imported subtract) を全部スキップし、engrave テキストは\n                       半透明オーバーレイ (opacity 0.55) で「文字位置とサイズ」だけ示す\n- opts.light=false ... 操作停止後のフル品質。本来のジオメトリを CSG で生成\n\nrequestUpdate() の二段化:\n- 即時 (rAF, ~16ms): light=true で軽量プレビュー\n- 遅延 (220ms): light=false でフル品質 (CSG込み)\n入力が続く間は light が連発、止まったら自動で heavy に置換される。\nPhotoshop / Premiere のプレビュー方式と同じパターン。\n\n【OTF/TTF lazy グリフの事前ウォーミング】\n\n_warmFontGlyphs(fontName):\n- Latin + Hiragana + Katakana (約 250 字) を idle 時間に事前評価\n- requestIdleCallback で 1 tick あたり最大 6ms に抑え、UI を止めない\n- _warmedFontKeys Set で冪等性を保証（同フォントは1度だけ）\n- フォントドロップダウン populate 時 + 確定時に呼び出し\n\n漢字 2000 字を全部ウォームすると逆にフリーズになるので入れない。\n未ウォーム漢字を初めて打った時の 50–200ms ヒッチは依然残るが、\n打鍵直後は light モードで CSG をスキップするので体感は止まらない。\n\nこれで OTF + engrave の組み合わせで「打ったら止まる」がほぼ解消されるはず。","tree":{"sha":"b09b7847bdf3695cd5ae6fd0db4a0e8892b23134","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hololocheck/keybordstudio/git/trees/b09b7847bdf3695cd5ae6fd0db4a0e8892b23134"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hololocheck/keybordstudio/git/commits/99e6e00d00a1242b87dd59b8ed15c61ae9be240f","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/218554521?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hololocheck/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hololocheck/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hololocheck/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hololocheck/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/hololocheck","id":218554521,"login":"hololocheck","node_id":"U_kgDODQbgmQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hololocheck/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hololocheck/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hololocheck/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hololocheck/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hololocheck/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/hololocheck","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/hololocheck/keybordstudio/commit/99e6e00d00a1242b87dd59b8ed15c61ae9be240f","node_id":"C_kwDOSM83wtoAKDk5ZTZlMDBkMDBhMTI0MmI4N2RkNTliOGVkMTVjNjFhZTliZTI0MGY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/hololocheck/keybordstudio/commit/59407b983487b904a8fe076df776d7d8f796cf04","sha":"59407b983487b904a8fe076df776d7d8f796cf04","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hololocheck/keybordstudio/commits/59407b983487b904a8fe076df776d7d8f796cf04"}],"sha":"99e6e00d00a1242b87dd59b8ed15c61ae9be240f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hololocheck/keybordstudio/commits/99e6e00d00a1242b87dd59b8ed15c61ae9be240f"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/218554521?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hololocheck/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hololocheck/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hololocheck/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hololocheck/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/hololocheck","id":218554521,"login":"hololocheck","node_id":"U_kgDODQbgmQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hololocheck/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hololocheck/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hololocheck/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hololocheck/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hololocheck/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/hololocheck","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hololocheck/keybordstudio/commits/59407b983487b904a8fe076df776d7d8f796cf04/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-04-26T11:53:37Z","email":"hangdajinzi647@gmail.com","name":"hololocheck"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-04-26T11:53:37Z","email":"hangdajinzi647@gmail.com","name":"hololocheck"},"message":"Restore real-time text reflection (rAF-based requestUpdate)\n\nPhase 1 で導入した 300ms デバウンスが「文字を打ってから画面に反映されるまで」の\n体感遅延としてそのまま現れていた問題を解消。\n\n- requestUpdate() 引数なしの経路を setTimeout(100ms) → requestAnimationFrame に変更\n- 連続入力／スライダードラッグは1フレーム単位で coalesce、最大遅延 ~16ms\n- IME 入力中の抑制 (compositionstart/end) はそのまま維持\n- text input ハンドラから requestUpdate(300) を引数なしに戻す（キーキャップ・ボディ両方）\n- body-module は元々の requestBodyUpdate (rAF) に戻す\n\nPhase 2 の CSG キャッシュ + ExtrudeGeometry キャッシュが土台にあるので、\n連続入力で重い処理が連発する状況は引き続き抑制される。\n初回入力 (キャッシュミス) の重さは Phase 3 で CSG ワーカー化を検討。","tree":{"sha":"6fa74b01a8c5e618d976cc01fe06c9e529c207c2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hololocheck/keybordstudio/git/trees/6fa74b01a8c5e618d976cc01fe06c9e529c207c2"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hololocheck/keybordstudio/git/commits/59407b983487b904a8fe076df776d7d8f796cf04","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/218554521?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hololocheck/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hololocheck/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hololocheck/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hololocheck/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/hololocheck","id":218554521,"login":"hololocheck","node_id":"U_kgDODQbgmQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hololocheck/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hololocheck/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hololocheck/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hololocheck/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hololocheck/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/hololocheck","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/hololocheck/keybordstudio/commit/59407b983487b904a8fe076df776d7d8f796cf04","node_id":"C_kwDOSM83wtoAKDU5NDA3Yjk4MzQ4N2I5MDRhOGZlMDc2ZGY3NzZkN2Q4Zjc5NmNmMDQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/hololocheck/keybordstudio/commit/3a2419138e4d4debc4ac0dcda79b9e7bc8497d71","sha":"3a2419138e4d4debc4ac0dcda79b9e7bc8497d71","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hololocheck/keybordstudio/commits/3a2419138e4d4debc4ac0dcda79b9e7bc8497d71"}],"sha":"59407b983487b904a8fe076df776d7d8f796cf04","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hololocheck/keybordstudio/commits/59407b983487b904a8fe076df776d7d8f796cf04"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/218554521?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hololocheck/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hololocheck/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hololocheck/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hololocheck/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/hololocheck","id":218554521,"login":"hololocheck","node_id":"U_kgDODQbgmQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hololocheck/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hololocheck/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hololocheck/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hololocheck/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hololocheck/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/hololocheck","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hololocheck/keybordstudio/commits/3a2419138e4d4debc4ac0dcda79b9e7bc8497d71/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-04-26T11:46:43Z","email":"hangdajinzi647@gmail.com","name":"hololocheck"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-04-26T11:46:43Z","email":"hangdajinzi647@gmail.com","name":"hololocheck"},"message":"Phase 2: kanji input stutter fix (IME + CSG cache)\n\n【漢字書き込みカクツキ修正の続編】\n\n1) IME composition イベントによる入力抑制\n   - 漢字入力中の変換候補表示で input イベントが連発し、毎回\n     ExtrudeGeometry + CSG が起動していた\n   - compositionstart で update を停止、compositionend (確定) で再開\n   - キーキャップ (text/text2/sideText) と ボディ (top/bottom/side) の\n     両方に適用\n   - 「漢字」と1文字打つだけで5〜10回パイプラインが走っていたのが\n     確定後の1回に圧縮される\n\n2) CSG (three-bvh-csg) 結果のメモ化\n   - keycap × 刻印テキスト の SUBTRACTION は1回 100〜500ms と\n     パイプライン中で最も重い処理\n   - 同形ジオメトリ（vertex 数 + bounding box ハッシュ）に対しては\n     計算結果を再利用\n   - LRU キャッシュ容量 6（メモリ消費を抑えつつ、Undo/Redo・スライダー\n     往復・同一テキスト再評価を確実にカバー）\n   - importedGeo の subtract も同経路で恩恵を受ける\n\nこれで日本語フォントでの漢字埋め込み体感は実質的にネイティブ近くまで\n改善されるはず。","tree":{"sha":"ff65ef5a8bcff96a84c8190854e09dfa81b2a821","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hololocheck/keybordstudio/git/trees/ff65ef5a8bcff96a84c8190854e09dfa81b2a821"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hololocheck/keybordstudio/git/commits/3a2419138e4d4debc4ac0dcda79b9e7bc8497d71","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/218554521?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hololocheck/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hololocheck/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hololocheck/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hololocheck/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/hololocheck","id":218554521,"login":"hololocheck","node_id":"U_kgDODQbgmQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hololocheck/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hololocheck/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hololocheck/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hololocheck/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hololocheck/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/hololocheck","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/hololocheck/keybordstudio/commit/3a2419138e4d4debc4ac0dcda79b9e7bc8497d71","node_id":"C_kwDOSM83wtoAKDNhMjQxOTEzOGU0ZDRkZWJjNGFjMGRjZGE3OWI5ZTdiYzg0OTdkNzE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/hololocheck/keybordstudio/commit/55451ec08c21dacfa369a25a92699eace5cd5b26","sha":"55451ec08c21dacfa369a25a92699eace5cd5b26","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hololocheck/keybordstudio/commits/55451ec08c21dacfa369a25a92699eace5cd5b26"}],"sha":"3a2419138e4d4debc4ac0dcda79b9e7bc8497d71","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hololocheck/keybordstudio/commits/3a2419138e4d4debc4ac0dcda79b9e7bc8497d71"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/218554521?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hololocheck/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hololocheck/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hololocheck/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hololocheck/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/hololocheck","id":218554521,"login":"hololocheck","node_id":"U_kgDODQbgmQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hololocheck/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hololocheck/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hololocheck/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hololocheck/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hololocheck/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/hololocheck","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hololocheck/keybordstudio/commits/55451ec08c21dacfa369a25a92699eace5cd5b26/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-04-26T11:34:34Z","email":"hangdajinzi647@gmail.com","name":"hololocheck"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-04-26T11:34:34Z","email":"hangdajinzi647@gmail.com","name":"hololocheck"},"message":"Fix Japanese-font engraving stutter + add multi-monitor responsive layout\n\n【日本語フォント書き込み時のカクツキ修正】\n\n1) TTF glyf table の遅延展開\n   - parseGlyfTable で全グリフを事前パースするループを撤廃\n   - 日本語フォント (Noto Sans JP / Yu Gothic 等で1万グリフ超) の読み込み時\n     UI 数秒フリーズを解消\n   - parseGlyph は内部キャッシュ（glyphsCache）と composite 再帰解決を持つので\n     遅延でも整合性を維持\n   - 参照時に glyph.o lazy getter で parseGlyph + ttContourToCommands を実行、\n     自己置換で2回目以降はプレーンな文字列に戻す（前回の CFF lazy と同方式）\n\n2) tessellation 密度の適応化\n   - _computeGlyphSubpaths の areaDiv 床値を 48 → 24 に\n   - 漢字グリフは 30〜50 個の subPath を持つため、48 分割では\n     1 グリフあたり数千頂点が生成され ExtrudeGeometry / CSG 双方を\n     重くしていた。24 分割でも符号検出と穴判定は実用上問題なく、\n     トライアングル数は約半減\n\n3) makeTextGeo の ExtrudeGeometry キャッシュ\n   - (text, fontName, size, height, curveSegments, bevel*) をキーにした\n     LRU (容量24)\n   - サイズ／深さスライダーをドラッグして同じ値に戻ったときに即時ヒット\n   - 漢字テキストの ExtrudeGeometry は 50–150ms 級に重いため、\n     キャッシュヒット時にこれを丸ごとスキップできる\n\n【マルチモニター対応 (Phase 1)】\n\n既存の max-width 系メディアクエリ（タブレット〜小型ノート向け）は\nそのまま残し、不足していた大画面・ウルトラワイド向けレイヤーを追加:\n\n- Full HD (1920px+):     sidebar 440px, font 15px\n- QHD/4K入口 (2560px+):  sidebar 500px, font 16px\n- True 4K (3840px+):     sidebar 560px, font 18px, canvas max-width 制約\n- Ultrawide 21:9:        canvas を 2400px 上限で中央寄せ\n- Super Ultrawide 32:9:  sidebar 600px, canvas 2800px 上限\n- Tablet (pointer:coarse): ボタン min-height 36px\n\nphone (<768px) は要求外のため対象外、既存の max-width: 768/480 ブロックは温存。\n\nSanity-checked: node --check 3dfont-engine.js exit 0.","tree":{"sha":"095a7c2b9863f8bb0297d691da022332ae3aca46","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hololocheck/keybordstudio/git/trees/095a7c2b9863f8bb0297d691da022332ae3aca46"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hololocheck/keybordstudio/git/commits/55451ec08c21dacfa369a25a92699eace5cd5b26","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/218554521?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hololocheck/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hololocheck/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hololocheck/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hololocheck/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/hololocheck","id":218554521,"login":"hololocheck","node_id":"U_kgDODQbgmQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hololocheck/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hololocheck/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hololocheck/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hololocheck/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hololocheck/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/hololocheck","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/hololocheck/keybordstudio/commit/55451ec08c21dacfa369a25a92699eace5cd5b26","node_id":"C_kwDOSM83wtoAKDU1NDUxZWMwOGMyMWRhY2ZhMzY5YTI1YTkyNjk5ZWFjZTVjZDViMjY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/hololocheck/keybordstudio/commit/158445f233b74f0dfe43ee7ff52a3121e3ac5ba9","sha":"158445f233b74f0dfe43ee7ff52a3121e3ac5ba9","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hololocheck/keybordstudio/commits/158445f233b74f0dfe43ee7ff52a3121e3ac5ba9"}],"sha":"55451ec08c21dacfa369a25a92699eace5cd5b26","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hololocheck/keybordstudio/commits/55451ec08c21dacfa369a25a92699eace5cd5b26"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/218554521?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hololocheck/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hololocheck/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hololocheck/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hololocheck/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/hololocheck","id":218554521,"login":"hololocheck","node_id":"U_kgDODQbgmQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hololocheck/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hololocheck/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hololocheck/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hololocheck/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hololocheck/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/hololocheck","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hololocheck/keybordstudio/commits/158445f233b74f0dfe43ee7ff52a3121e3ac5ba9/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-04-26T11:22:09Z","email":"hangdajinzi647@gmail.com","name":"hololocheck"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-04-26T11:22:09Z","email":"hangdajinzi647@gmail.com","name":"hololocheck"},"message":"Add MIT LICENSE and optimize OTF text engraving performance\n\nライセンス:\n- MIT License を LICENSE として追加（README に明記済みの方針に揃える）\n\nOTF フォント読み込み + テキスト書き込み時のもたつきを4段階で改善:\n\nA) テキスト入力デバウンス (index.html, body-module.js)\n   - キーキャップの text/text2/sideText 入力を 300ms デバウンスに延長\n   - ボディの top/bottom/side テキスト入力を専用の requestBodyUpdateDebounced(300) に切替\n   - 既存の 100ms / rAF デバウンスでは間に合わず、各キーストロークで重い CSG が走っていた\n\nB) フォントhoverプレビューの長押しゲート (index.html)\n   - フォントドロップダウン上の mouseenter ↔ requestUpdate 直結を廃止\n   - 350ms の hover 維持で初めてプレビューを反映する形式に\n   - 高速スクロール時に「数千グリフ展開 + フルパイプライン」が連発されるのを防止\n\nC) グリフ Subpath キャッシュ (3dfont-engine.js)\n   - createTextShapes でグリフ単位の (scale, divisions, reverseWinding) 結果を WeakMap で記憶\n   - _buildShapesFromGlyph を _computeGlyphSubpaths(THREE非依存) + _buildShapesAtOffset(軽量) に分離\n   - 同一文字（\"Hello\" の重複 ''l'' など）の Bezier テッセレーションを毎キーごとに再計算しない\n\nD) CFF/CFF2 グリフの遅延展開 (3dfont-engine.js)\n   - parseFont でフォント全グリフを executeCharString する従来動作を撤廃\n   - lazy getter (Object.defineProperty) で実際に参照された瞬間にのみ CharString を実行\n   - 自己置換でアクセス2回目以降はプレーンな文字列に戻りオーバーヘッドゼロ\n   - OTF 読み込み時の 2-5 秒の UI フリーズを実利用文字（数十個）の即時展開に縮小\n   - TrueType は contour 既パース済みで安価のため従来通り eager のまま\n\nSanity-checked: node --check / --input-type=module --check 共に exit 0.","tree":{"sha":"571d272e5656d8fc47f89dd89de96acaadd87634","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hololocheck/keybordstudio/git/trees/571d272e5656d8fc47f89dd89de96acaadd87634"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hololocheck/keybordstudio/git/commits/158445f233b74f0dfe43ee7ff52a3121e3ac5ba9","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/218554521?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hololocheck/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hololocheck/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hololocheck/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hololocheck/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/hololocheck","id":218554521,"login":"hololocheck","node_id":"U_kgDODQbgmQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hololocheck/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hololocheck/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hololocheck/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hololocheck/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hololocheck/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/hololocheck","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/hololocheck/keybordstudio/commit/158445f233b74f0dfe43ee7ff52a3121e3ac5ba9","node_id":"C_kwDOSM83wtoAKDE1ODQ0NWYyMzNiNzRmMGRmZTQzZWU3ZmY1MmEzMTIxZTNhYzViYTk","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/hololocheck/keybordstudio/commit/83227e3110c223081352494c9be221feb311a39f","sha":"83227e3110c223081352494c9be221feb311a39f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hololocheck/keybordstudio/commits/83227e3110c223081352494c9be221feb311a39f"}],"sha":"158445f233b74f0dfe43ee7ff52a3121e3ac5ba9","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hololocheck/keybordstudio/commits/158445f233b74f0dfe43ee7ff52a3121e3ac5ba9"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/218554521?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hololocheck/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hololocheck/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hololocheck/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hololocheck/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/hololocheck","id":218554521,"login":"hololocheck","node_id":"U_kgDODQbgmQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hololocheck/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hololocheck/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hololocheck/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hololocheck/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hololocheck/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/hololocheck","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hololocheck/keybordstudio/commits/83227e3110c223081352494c9be221feb311a39f/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-04-26T10:56:32Z","email":"hangdajinzi647@gmail.com","name":"hololocheck"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-04-26T10:56:32Z","email":"hangdajinzi647@gmail.com","name":"hololocheck"},"message":"Initial commit: KeybordStudio V1 (Studio Edition)\n\nKeycap Generator の正統進化版として、Keycap / Body / Layout の3モジュールを統合した\nブラウザベース3Dキーボード設計スタジオの初回リリース。\n\n- Keycap Studio: Cherry/OEM/SA/XDA/DSAプロファイル、SVG刻印、3Dフォントエンジン\n- Body Generator (NEW): ケース本体パラメトリック設計、KLEインポート、AMSマルチカラー\n- Layout Studio (NEW): 2D配列CADエディタ、レイヤー管理、DXFエクスポート\n- 共通基盤: Three.js r160 + WASM Mesh Repair + Pyodide(trimesh) + Slicer Bridge","tree":{"sha":"3309934dd34172d4caff1cec4731829293ce8c64","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hololocheck/keybordstudio/git/trees/3309934dd34172d4caff1cec4731829293ce8c64"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hololocheck/keybordstudio/git/commits/83227e3110c223081352494c9be221feb311a39f","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/218554521?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hololocheck/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hololocheck/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/use