e at module load (oxlint react/purity) and gets its co-located test.","tree":{"sha":"e6c678294048e92493b1f991b70d07655a28ba55","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Vadymk95/template-spa-pwa/git/trees/e6c678294048e92493b1f991b70d07655a28ba55"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Vadymk95/template-spa-pwa/git/commits/d23a5ffc39920c638183937cd67edda66bc31c40","verification":{"payload":"tree e6c678294048e92493b1f991b70d07655a28ba55\nparent 77fdf7b5762d7d6e0088a91f10d1589d04c170d2\nauthor Vadym Kononenko <70842045+Vadymk95@users.noreply.github.com> 1791442056 +0300\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1791442056 +0300\n\nchore(deps): newest compatible versions; holds and the cooldown bypass recorded (#74)\n\nPackages younger than the 3-day cooldown were taken on purpose; DECISIONS lists each\nwith its publish date and provenance. Holds stay only for measured incompatibilities:\nmsw 3 (vitest''s mocker peers msw 2 and imports a path msw 3 removed), TypeScript 7\n(typescript-eslint peer), vitest 5 (Stryker runs zero tests per mutant), @types/node 26.\ntypescript-eslint 8.71 false-fires no-unsafe-enum-assignment on createSelectors\n(upstream #12966): off for that one file until the fix ships.\nDead overrides removed; js-yaml security floors keyed by major; the MSW worker is\nregenerated for the installed msw. Vite config imports carry .ts extensions and use\nimport.meta.dirname, so the native config loader no longer warns. The footer reads the\nyear once at module load (oxlint react/purity) and gets its co-located test.","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqxzyICRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAd1sQAGuey3UWO+PvbDaV5dlI4MGJ\nb5e0iVtt2gSxiiH+Xd9DuF9BYJEq4mkDr7/dIm/B60QR2uMWzMEHp3I1+sPFwtMd\nr2JByPlM9/jGYptrSHRqnUcPDsxxbUWRsRXXlQQHEvtoO6bYP6qUz1/qgqiLWpnZ\nNqkroX5JLuewwhn9BWFRrwq4zgFvQphBu2sTRt5f3ajwCLk+K4EiBZlzAa+6gDgN\nbwVpG+UTQvestKnQRIucGH9WtOycVn+o//FnLqJULcQnl/2weGZMP4Ke0c2Ffx6W\nWK6xC5qEzZeixD2ztdiMEplxpq97wVjshGWnRdsHPWSPSgGsFfXLUGP+iw3LN70N\nh