"message":"feat(gate): trace every gate run, and make check-hooks answer for its own repo\n\nPorted from the sibling template: gate-trace.mjs wraps the verify chain and\ntest:e2e (exit codes pass through untouched, logging best-effort, GIT_*\nstripped, macOS runs ride caffeinate so a sleeping machine stops reading as a\ncode failure); gate-tiers.json holds moments, budgets and classes as DATA;\ntrace-report.mjs turns rows into findings and names no stage itself.\ncheck-hooks strips GIT_* from its own git call - inherited from a hook it\nanswers for a different repo - and gains the six-case test it never had.\nbench-verify follows the tracer wrapper to the inner script.","tree":{"sha":"4661c13104beabd1cbfc890be562157a1cd4e6ed","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Vadymk95/template-spa-pwa/git/trees/4661c13104beabd1cbfc890be562157a1cd4e6ed"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Vadymk95/template-spa-pwa/git/commits/0730e54b2cd4694fc30ee56af08ae8ad62b143c4","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/70842045?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vadymk95/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vadymk95/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vadymk95/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vadymk95/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Vadymk95","id":70842045,"login":"Vadymk95","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcwODQyMDQ1","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vadymk95/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vadymk95/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vadymk95/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vadymk95/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vadymk95/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vadymk95","user_vi