e":"style(gate): drop a useless initializer the strictest sibling flags\n\ntemplate-rn''s ESLint 10 runs no-useless-assignment and rejects the ported\ncheck-hooks; the file stays byte-identical across the family so the next port\ncannot re-diverge it.","tree":{"sha":"13919fe4ce57b2c946acc2d38f82324108c8d308","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Vadymk95/template-spa-pwa/git/trees/13919fe4ce57b2c946acc2d38f82324108c8d308"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Vadymk95/template-spa-pwa/git/commits/71851c9ee41b97946f2f6430426694791185c893","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/70842045?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vadymk95/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vadymk95/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vadymk95/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vadymk95/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Vadymk95","id":70842045,"login":"Vadymk95","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcwODQyMDQ1","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vadymk95/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vadymk95/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vadymk95/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vadymk95/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vadymk95/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vadymk95","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Vadymk95/template-spa-pwa/commit/71851c9ee41b97946f2f6430426694791185c893","node_id":"C_kwDOSM_tFtoAKDcxODUxYzllZTQxYjk3OTQ2ZjJmNjQzMDQyNjY5NDc5MTE4NWM4OTM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Vadymk95/template-spa-pwa/commit/06b02c70736a9728948605ebc5332aef94dbf09c","sha":"06b02c70736a9728948605ebc5332aef94dbf09c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Vadymk95/template-spa-pwa/commits/06b02c70736a9728948605ebc5332aef94dbf09c"}],"sha":"71851c9ee41b97946f2f6430426694791185c893","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Vadymk95/template-spa-pwa/commits/71851c9ee41b97946f2f6430426694791185c893"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/70842045?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vadymk95/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vadymk95/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vadymk95/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vadymk95/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Vadymk95","id":70842045,"login":"Vadymk95","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcwODQyMDQ1","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vadymk95/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vadymk95/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vadymk95/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vadymk95/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vadymk95/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vadymk95","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Vadymk95/template-spa-pwa/commits/06b02c70736a9728948605ebc5332aef94dbf09c/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-25T14:13:22Z","email":"70842045+Vadymk95@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Vadym Kononenko"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-25T14:13:22Z","email":"70842045+Vadymk95@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Vadym Kononenko"},"message":"fix(gate): check-hooks refuses a hooksPath that points elsewhere\n\nA sibling template carried an absolute core.hooksPath left over from a repo move, so\ngit skipped every hook silently - no pre-commit, no commit-msg, no pre-push - while\nthis check stayed green: it only tested that .husky/_ exists on disk. The check now\nresolves core.hooksPath and fails closed with the one-line fix when it does not land\non this repo''s own .husky/_; proved in both directions on the affected sibling. This\nrepo''s local config is also normalized to the relative .husky/_ so a future repo\nmove cannot re-create the silence.","tree":{"sha":"1c4bf476af2eed84de9c04467388b63885b40ce0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Vadymk95/template-spa-pwa/git/trees/1c4bf476af2eed84de9c04467388b63885b40ce0"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Vadymk95/template-spa-pwa/git/commits/06b02c70736a9728948605ebc5332aef94dbf09c","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/70842045?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vadymk95/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vadymk95/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vadymk95/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vadymk95/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Vadymk95","id":70842045,"login":"Vadymk95","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcwODQyMDQ1","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vadymk95/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vadymk95/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vadymk95/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vadymk95/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vadymk95/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vadymk95","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Vadymk95/template-spa-pwa/commit/06b02c70736a9728948605ebc5332aef94dbf09c","node_id":"C_kwDOSM_tFtoAKDA2YjAyYzcwNzM2YTk3Mjg5NDg2MDVlYmM1MzMyYWVmOTRkYmYwOWM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Vadymk95/template-spa-pwa/commit/c787c14a0ad7bda5cd6cb457eb01f77e81a9c67e","sha":"c787c14a0ad7bda5cd6cb457eb01f77e81a9c67e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Vadymk95/template-spa-pwa/commits/c787c14a0ad7bda5cd6cb457eb01f77e81a9c67e"}],"sha":"06b02c70736a9728948605ebc5332aef94dbf09c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Vadymk95/template-spa-pwa/commits/06b02c70736a9728948605ebc5332aef94dbf09c"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/70842045?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vadymk95/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vadymk95/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vadymk95/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vadymk95/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Vadymk95","id":70842045,"login":"Vadymk95","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcwODQyMDQ1","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vadymk95/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vadymk95/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vadymk95/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vadymk95/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vadymk95/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vadymk95","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Vadymk95/template-spa-pwa/commits/c787c14a0ad7bda5cd6cb457eb01f77e81a9c67e/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-25T14:01:57Z","email":"70842045+Vadymk95@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Vadym Kononenko"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-25T14:01:57Z","email":"70842045+Vadymk95@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Vadym Kononenko"},"message":"feat(gate): the commit hook checks types, measured within the budget\n\nA type error reached a commit on the reference repo because the hook checked lint and\nformat but never types; this repo had the same blindness. Incremental tsc measures in\nseconds here and the whole hook stays under the ~15s pre-commit budget, so the check\nis admitted by its measured cost. Proved by refusal: a staged real type error blocks\nthe commit; restored green. Operator lifted the earlier hold on this section.","tree":{"sha":"e259301aa7cea85d10d8ff63f275b532ff0cb702","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Vadymk95/template-spa-pwa/git/trees/e259301aa7cea85d10d8ff63f275b532ff0cb702"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Vadymk95/template-spa-pwa/git/commits/c787c14a0ad7bda5cd6cb457eb01f77e81a9c67e","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/70842045?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vadymk95/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vadymk95/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vadymk95/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vadymk95/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Vadymk95","id":70842045,"login":"Vadymk95","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcwODQyMDQ1","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vadymk95/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vadymk95/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vadymk95/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vadymk95/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vadymk95/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vadymk95","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Vadymk95/template-spa-pwa/commit/c787c14a0ad7bda5cd6cb457eb01f77e81a9c67e","node_id":"C_kwDOSM_tFtoAKGM3ODdjMTRhMGFkN2JkYTVjZDZjYjQ1N2ViMDFmNzdlODFhOWM2N2U","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Vadymk95/template-spa-pwa/commit/a92ce92605ace3f167a845fea4e2354584f11e97","sha":"a92ce92605ace3f167a845fea4e2354584f11e97","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Vadymk95/template-spa-pwa/commits/a92ce92605ace3f167a845fea4e2354584f11e97"}],"sha":"c787c14a0ad7bda5cd6cb457eb01f77e81a9c67e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Vadymk95/template-spa-pwa/commits/c787c14a0ad7bda5cd6cb457eb01f77e81a9c67e"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/70842045?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vadymk95/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vadymk95/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vadymk95/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vadymk95/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Vadymk95","id":70842045,"login":"Vadymk95","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcwODQyMDQ1","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vadymk95/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vadymk95/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vadymk95/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vadymk95/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vadymk95/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vadymk95","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Vadymk95/template-spa-pwa/commits/a92ce92605ace3f167a845fea4e2354584f11e97/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-25T10:32:53Z","email":"70842045+Vadymk95@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Vadym Kononenko"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-25T10:32:53Z","email":"70842045+Vadymk95@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Vadym Kononenko"},"message":"docs(gate): a copy-only change routes to the cheap tier, not the pipeline\n\nA one-word i18n value edit was either unrouted or (next-seo) routed by the word\n\"i18n\" into verify:full, the heaviest rung. The check tables now split copy from\ninfrastructure: value edits in the locale JSON run format:check only; key changes\nstay a code-class change; the i18n routing/locale-set surface keeps the full rung.\nWrapping for new copy lengths belongs to the content-variance tier by design.","tree":{"sha":"3fd479e1bacc65d9266db36f4ae1b8790a2fa854","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Vadymk95/template-spa-pwa/git/trees/3fd479e1bacc65d9266db36f4ae1b8790a2fa854"}