adymk95/template-spa-pwa/commits/8d792aba14bc5f41adf51a45f7db0ba33174b3f9/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-25T09:43:17Z","email":"70842045+Vadymk95@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Vadym Kononenko"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-25T09:43:17Z","email":"70842045+Vadymk95@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Vadym Kononenko"},"message":"feat(gate): a preflight that prints the fix, and cheap stages move up\n\ncheck-gate-env.mjs refuses a run whose preview port (4173, strictPort) is already held\nand prints the exact lsof command that frees it, probing ALL interfaces because\n127.0.0.1 alone reports a held port free. One check on purpose: this build validates\nno required env, and a check that cannot fail would only claim coverage. Proved: held\nport exits 1 with the remedy, free port exits 0, plus a two-case vitest file. The\nchain also runs cheap independent stages first: oxlint -> format -> typecheck -> lint.","tree":{"sha":"a7369cdcaf593ab9160e06381853aae161f328c3","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Vadymk95/template-spa-pwa/git/trees/a7369cdcaf593ab9160e06381853aae161f328c3"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Vadymk95/template-spa-pwa/git/commits/8d792aba14bc5f41adf51a45f7db0ba33174b3f9","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/70842045?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vadymk95/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vadymk95/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vadymk95/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vadymk95/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Vadymk95","id":70842045,"login":"Vadymk95","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcwODQyMDQ1","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vadymk95/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vadymk95/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.