s.noreply.github.com","name":"Vadym Kononenko"},"message":"chore(gate): add weekly Stryker mutation gate; cap aged override floors\n\nMutation: StrykerJS 9.6.1 + vitest runner, baseline score 45.20% (719 mutants, 2m54s).\nthresholds.break=40 is a floor-of-record; weekly mutation.yml + dispatch; sandbox ignores .env*.\nDeliberately NOT in verify: full run costs minutes; scope mirrors the coverage excludes.\nOverrides: js-yaml >=4.3.1 <5 (cosmiconfig) and >=3.15.1 <4 (@lhci/utils), undici >=7.29.0 <8,\nnanoid >=5.1.16 <6 (estimo) and >=3.3.17 <4 (postcss), ip-address >=10.3.1 <11 (socks).\nbrace-expansion and fast-uri floors were uncapped and aged into the vulnerable ranges, now\n>=5.0.9 <6 and >=4.1.2 <5; the five other uncapped floors got major caps in the same pass.\nDocs: AGENTS.md, README, DECISIONS.md.","tree":{"sha":"aa244352544654f47f2e05c38e478fda18243056","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Vadymk95/template-spa-pwa/git/trees/aa244352544654f47f2e05c38e478fda18243056"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Vadymk95/template-spa-pwa/git/commits/7bdf539af81266ac6a6a42a7d54b62deba339e2d","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/70842045?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vadymk95/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vadymk95/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vadymk95/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vadymk95/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Vadymk95","id":70842045,"login":"Vadymk95","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcwODQyMDQ1","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vadymk95/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vadymk95/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vadymk95/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vadymk95/starred{/owner}{/repo}","s