/sahassakhare/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sahassakhare/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sahassakhare/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/sahassakhare","id":21344002,"login":"sahassakhare","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIxMzQ0MDAy","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sahassakhare/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sahassakhare/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sahassakhare/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sahassakhare/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sahassakhare/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/sahassakhare","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sahassakhare/agentic-ui/commits/503e9d4ac3b59931c2ea573a765639adcdcaeaf0/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-13T17:58:32Z","email":"shapitsahas@gmail.com","name":"Sahas Sakhare"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-13T17:58:32Z","email":"shapitsahas@gmail.com","name":"Sahas Sakhare"},"message":"docs(observability): correct the README claim; mark library-hardening L2 done\n\nAssessing L2 (observability emit wiring) found it already implemented since the\nplan was written: the orchestrator emits the turn + tool-call lifecycle,\nregistries + the experience planner emit, 70+ distinct agentic.* event names,\ntelemetry test fixtures assert sequences, demo-monolith wires\nprovideAgenticTelemetry(Console), and docs/cookbook/observability.md exists. So\nno re-implementation was needed — only two accuracy fixes:\n- README:137 overclaimed ''W3C trace context propagation across SSE''; that is NOT\n  shipped (a planned ADR-001 follow-up). Reworded to state what IS wired (emit +\n  console/OTel sinks) and flag the SSE propagation as not-yet-shipped.\n- Marked library-hardening-plan L2 as DONE with the real provider name\n  (provideAgenticTelemetry, not the sketch''s provideOtelTelemetry).\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"d3687e08c4b2489557cb137cc47fddc48677a048","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sahassakhare/agentic-ui/git/trees/d3687e08c4b2489557cb137cc47fddc48677a048"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sahassakhare/agentic-ui/git/commits/503e9d4ac3b59931c2ea573a765639adcdcaeaf0","verification":{"payload":"tree d3687e08c4b2489557cb137cc47fddc48677a048\nparent 76a98696fcc78c8969adba60f0ea5e4750757296\nauthor Sahas Sakhare <shapitsahas@gmail.com> 1789322312 +0530\ncommitter Sahas Sakhare <shapitsahas@gmail.com> 1789322312 +0530\n\ndocs(observability): correct the README claim; mark library-hardening L2 done\n\nAssessing L2 (observability emit wiring) found it already implemented since the\nplan was written: the orchestrator emits the turn + tool-call lifecycle,\nregistries + the experience planner emit, 70+ distinct agentic.* event names,\ntelemetry test fixtures assert sequences, demo-monolith wires\nprovideAgenticTelemetry(Console), and docs/cookbook/observability.md exists. So\nno re-implementation was needed — only two accuracy fixes:\n- README:137 overclaimed ''W3C trace context propagation across SSE''; that is NOT\n  shipped (a planned ADR-001 follow-up). Reworded to state what IS wired (emit +\n  console/OTel sinks) and flag the SSE propagation as not-yet-shipped.\n- Marked library-hardening-plan L2 as DONE with the real provider name\n  (provideAgenticTelemetry, not the sketch''s provideOtelTelemetry).\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\niQGzBAABCAAdFiEE1eujchKuJhYER67YWqdl9Lsba5AFAmqm5EgACgkQWqdl9Lsb\na5Cndwv/Td25SiztbW0dBykHHxqtssHKwM5iHwXM7b7d7UzyqwZYos81rDNoWs7K\n4KkpdJFN5xFPHYoyJZsWDIvAmtMjNTPtqYVguq0KGJ/l+8xgM2nOd5idkJmBXDca\n81C9oH5nYW+sGNvw2IqaGCzyC1+NazQ97bNmVDV/HjXUPenrvkh5xndlj78JlAUW\neuTEbG5XDGFIeoVfDEqZfkMZ01knl2zTwMgxl70vJQRstmZXUs3ibL2AP2uMe