vatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/21344002?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sahassakhare/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sahassakhare/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sahassakhare/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sahassakhare/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/sahassakhare","id":21344002,"login":"sahassakhare","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIxMzQ0MDAy","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sahassakhare/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sahassakhare/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sahassakhare/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sahassakhare/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sahassakhare/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/sahassakhare","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sahassakhare/agentic-ui/commits/76a98696fcc78c8969adba60f0ea5e4750757296/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-13T17:47:55Z","email":"shapitsahas@gmail.com","name":"Sahas Sakhare"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-13T17:47:55Z","email":"shapitsahas@gmail.com","name":"Sahas Sakhare"},"message":"test(catalog): cover the surface host — the Hub''s render dispatch + access gate\n\nThe Hub renders governed surfaces through CatalogSurfaceHostComponent (the Hub\napp is a thin shell; the render logic is here), previously untested. Adds specs\nfor: kind dispatch (experience/dashboard → experience path, else not); the\naccess-gated plan (the viewer''s persona + permissions from CATALOG_AUTH flow\ninto ExperiencePlanner.plan); and the lazy federated-component resolution states\n(ready when already registered, resolves via CatalogComponentSource, ''missing''\nfor a non-federated name or when no source is wired). Template overridden so the\nchild renderers aren''t needed. agentic-ui suite: 1168 green.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"1ee9e6733495bc7319d83df5984b8602b38c8a11","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sahassakhare/agentic-ui/git/trees/1ee9e6733495bc7319d83df5984b8602b38c8a11"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sahassakhare/agentic-ui/git/commits/76a98696fcc78c8969adba60f0ea5e4750757296","verification":{"payload":"tree 1ee9e6733495bc7319d83df5984b8602b38c8a11\nparent 18522253e77d8b59d99e01cfe2bc579190060148\nauthor Sahas Sakhare <shapitsahas@gmail.com> 1789321675 +0530\ncommitter Sahas Sakhare <shapitsahas@gmail.com> 1789321675 +0530\n\ntest(catalog): cover the surface host — the Hub''s render dispatch + access gate\n\nThe Hub renders governed surfaces through CatalogSurfaceHostComponent (the Hub\napp is a thin shell; the render logic is here), previously untested. Adds specs\nfor: kind dispatch (experience/dashboard → experience path, else not); the\naccess-gated plan (the viewer''s persona + permissions from CATALOG_AUTH flow\ninto ExperiencePlanner.plan); and the lazy federated-component resolution states\n(ready when already registered, resolves via CatalogComponentSource, ''missing''\nfor a non-federated name or when no source is wired). Template overridden so the\nchild renderers aren''t needed. agentic-ui suite: 1168 green.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\niQGzBAABCAAdFiEE1eujchKuJhYER67YWqdl9Lsba5AFAmqm4cwACgkQWqdl9Lsb\na5Dy5gv+O0LUsf41d7FKErZzDDCAnQ9VeqCMo8pw6JnNL5rdx7GgFQGevsn5eS6z\nogrolx+LvA5nBUoS+Ytsd/sr6uOh3hXSn/zxr/Z04gWEj6GntSF8s2EXF08mh2rY\nld5DvVbf51XcYor9YulzuSHp8ybiDY/qcFsVP6McTUW4S/wp/Y0IBU2AAUhG5BWL\nSC3PuRBTf/u+LF8vLsmCtWeMwGoW8tblhp6b/swhOXSkIW4ysS38tJ2fdIqv65zx\nT1irz4RDKSDBwHa7XMSfM6PQzVKmOUd7a0KN8E72HlDLKutJPTXmLFsbsLG2MEMP\n/vfRD5BaUiZHXsk6uSKyHM5qWl3lXhQcDGYoR8nfyFukqBTrqVIjhp6BIfHRBEVD\nHs+/zmeCXaWf/P47jilQT172eZ+I7Q0R9xsLn1fuW/gtJBKiXyAVBA1CJf