://api.github.com/repos/sahassakhare/agentic-ui/git/trees/d5219eead1431a3440e3ba6eb63690398441793d"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sahassakhare/agentic-ui/git/commits/94bdf1be4271672b3e1998bcfc99023ca1e8fee2","verification":{"payload":"tree d5219eead1431a3440e3ba6eb63690398441793d\nparent a6586e31d6992aa1fcf38736a8c2ad465b972e6e\nauthor Sahas Sakhare <shapitsahas@gmail.com> 1789320392 +0530\ncommitter Sahas Sakhare <shapitsahas@gmail.com> 1789320392 +0530\n\ntest(studio): cover the copilot rail bridge wiring\n\nAdds a TestBed spec for CopilotRailComponent''s bridge closures — the most-changed\ncopilot surface this cycle, previously only covered at the tools→bridge boundary.\nVerifies: capability drafts go to the catalog (ai-assisted) and navigate to the\ndesigner; experiences route to the SEPARATE store with title/goal split from the\nbody and open /experiences/:id; list/get/updateDraft branch correctly per store;\nupdateDraft merge + version semantics; and getActive URL parsing (design + detail\nroutes, list routes → null). Template blanked in the harness so only the\nconstructor runs. Studio suite: 95 green (was 87).\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\niQGzBAABCAAdFiEE1eujchKuJhYER67YWqdl9Lsba5AFAmqm3MkACgkQWqdl9Lsb\na5AY0Qv/ZSLA2ANkp2BqcxbN22qDBT3S++DL6glJidV2hE+aJHGmFzGvoHcNFt4e\nh1Dj/KXgOCNnNQvNkss3EgsX4Y1HQaFQlj4pGeTtOPZa41KVeX6cdzQ3dbF7DbQk\nmvJF63H04i7qi/RkPspJKPWcbuUc078mO96vEuSr/XMPkLleq6XP0fdvaH12tEyK\n8Hsa1mmdSVdOqppNO4+xqCoKL7phnGFk13/W3E1sS2sScyFSWMymI+/tsUBko6Z7\nuA+LqbWENB/GrBFI2BhGPLy6qIV1YYMLKxhnbgVJbU9kHP8XbDgSVRhz6hWRShvF\nsd6Cvi2zc5j+j/37Y231ykOTgZT9yc2C9PCGVLECyMmPc24KYjqKYQNKWyrbAp2I\nJ97dzpEFmwnyh8w+92U2eE7dYHj9ePqDW/3C/l15qg7MwPkEvk8aUXJ/yy2wz5Y5\n47NQnatQafYoX1ZLT9qqNAuMTVbRaRI7qcxJQ7n8FphOmtSyGfj9IlNv421v5wvP\nDEn8nmMx\n=JXK2\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-09-13T17:26:36Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://av