","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sahassakhare/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sahassakhare/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sahassakhare/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sahassakhare/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/sahassakhare","id":21344002,"login":"sahassakhare","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIxMzQ0MDAy","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sahassakhare/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sahassakhare/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sahassakhare/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sahassakhare/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sahassakhare/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/sahassakhare","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sahassakhare/agentic-ui/commits/844f20852a35cdec5ed0af6f55d05432aa991535/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-13T17:09:19Z","email":"shapitsahas@gmail.com","name":"Sahas Sakhare"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-13T17:09:19Z","email":"shapitsahas@gmail.com","name":"Sahas Sakhare"},"message":"docs(plan): catalog backend consolidation proposal (Node vs Java)\n\nDecision-ready plan for the platform review''s #1 opportunity: the repo ships two\ncatalog backends (published/tested Node agentic-catalog-server vs the running-\nbut-untested Java agentic-catalog-service on :8081), and the kind-on-events\nchange had to be written to both. Recommends making Node canonical (superset of\nroutes, 32 tests, published, same stack) with a slice-by-slice migration + the\ncontract test suite the running backend lacks; frames the JVM-requirement\ndecision that would invert it. Awaiting the user''s call — nothing deleted.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"57acfb111819e43be9ff162605177055d8f78aad","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sahassakhare/agentic-ui/git/trees/57acfb111819e43be9ff162605177055d8f78aad"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sahassakhare/agentic-ui/git/commits/844f20852a35cdec5ed0af6f55d05432aa991535","verification":{"payload":"tree 57acfb111819e43be9ff162605177055d8f78aad\nparent 7abb77ef7192bbd5fd242c25dba0b0fab8ba1022\nauthor Sahas Sakhare <shapitsahas@gmail.com> 1789319359 +0530\ncommitter Sahas Sakhare <shapitsahas@gmail.com> 1789319359 +0530\n\ndocs(plan): catalog backend consolidation proposal (Node vs Java)\n\nDecision-ready plan for the platform review''s #1 opportunity: the repo ships two\ncatalog backends (published/tested Node agentic-catalog-server vs the running-\nbut-untested Java agentic-catalog-service on :8081), and the kind-on-events\nchange had to be written to both. Recommends making Node canonical (superset of\nroutes, 32 tests, published, same stack) with a slice-by-slice migration + the\ncontract test suite the running backend lacks; frames the JVM-requirement\ndecision that would invert it. Awaiting the user''s call — nothing deleted.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\niQGzBAABCAAdFiEE1eujchKuJhYER67YWqdl9Lsba5AFAmqm2L8ACgkQWqdl9Lsb\na5DxPgv/ROma34vrkeYLlMIWnH0ZsJJw+BV0YD0F5xQx73v1VRyrequqfecemfCd\nkV9wId5gup5sa+d3w7pvvuYYDxvDvHFdZYqajuSyQ1WJDDh8I/yV7bRmyOBexjqy\nR5XjJVLPq2d3asNVQziVQLzvzR0mgm/lpT3yLCe27H7KqdEBEDEA5qF8NdLQUZhq\nKlKCCQYIPBEXxUeZYBT1cTMnxGAoYbeKPobXMTWpN++Lmo9s3HpHTLulEc5Lh2/U\narg50V9AQBZ/g57TLyM7npyN+rmuWy9PK3+amHLXRZKiCJQsBRBxbqiYszI6VhMB\n4AeKN23Mnko9KiUutb//dFVviC7oqwi8SYHlRhCINzANeKUFQ+nUxkpDE176T+8L\nIONvLD5OPq1vCq8G62E8Kb7OXif0hCxpT8w4B1fhSBWqRlzE7EYX2rjxvXm6MBmc\nAadYBB7slNn0lFfdRXcXpyYXs9l3GW4IesifngH2C+l8mhQrF6RZmuucbAdubN/I\noE+k7idg\n=soKJ\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-09-13T17:09:23Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.co