1344002,"login":"sahassakhare","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIxMzQ0MDAy","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sahassakhare/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sahassakhare/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sahassakhare/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sahassakhare/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sahassakhare/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/sahassakhare","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sahassakhare/agentic-ui/commits/7abb77ef7192bbd5fd242c25dba0b0fab8ba1022/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-13T16:12:05Z","email":"shapitsahas@gmail.com","name":"Sahas Sakhare"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-13T16:12:05Z","email":"shapitsahas@gmail.com","name":"Sahas Sakhare"},"message":"ci: publish all packages via a single NPM_TOKEN instead of per-package OIDC\n\nSwitch the three release workflows (publish.yml, schematics-release.yml,\nexamples-schematics-release.yml) from per-package Trusted Publishing (OIDC) to\none shared npm Automation token: job-level NODE_AUTH_TOKEN from secrets.NPM_TOKEN\n+ setup-node registry-url writing the .npmrc. One secret authorizes every\npackage — no per-package config — and a token can create the brand-new\nexamples-schematics package on first publish. Updated the prerequisite comments\naccordingly.\n\nPrereq: add repo secret NPM_TOKEN = an npm Automation token (bypasses 2FA).\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"de150c005fbe588977dc9b8b376e145a1547d4a0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sahassakhare/agentic-ui/git/trees/de150c005fbe588977dc9b8b376e145a1547d4a0"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sahassakhare/agentic-ui/git/commits/7abb77ef7192bbd5fd242c25dba0b0fab8ba1022","verification":{"payload":"tree de150c005fbe588977dc9b8b376e145a1547d4a0\nparent ddceb2086bcf59f8b9bccb1857bc135fe8f02fe1\nauthor Sahas Sakhare <shapitsahas@gmail.com> 1789315925 +0530\ncommitter Sahas Sakhare <shapitsahas@gmail.com> 1789315925 +0530\n\nci: publish all packages via a single NPM_TOKEN instead of per-package OIDC\n\nSwitch the three release workflows (publish.yml, schematics-release.yml,\nexamples-schematics-release.yml) from per-package Trusted Publishing (OIDC) to\none shared npm Automation token: job-level NODE_AUTH_TOKEN from secrets.NPM_TOKEN\n+ setup-node registry-url writing the .npmrc. One secret authorizes every\npackage — no per-package config — and a token can create the brand-new\nexamples-schematics package on first publish. Updated the prerequisite comments\naccordingly.\n\nPrereq: add repo secret NPM_TOKEN = an npm Automation token (bypasses 2FA).\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\niQGzBAABCAAdFiEE1eujchKuJhYER67YWqdl9Lsba5AFAmqmy1YACgkQWqdl9Lsb\na5BjfAv9HWheZJlYWbkONEfZTP6mGW5vMkHMNW7bsMPVQxfFTh8Z7u7qrl0al+8k\nWje8qq4KNuQDpln/zitSxR5e/HYSvqdT0iCDSXnDRS5+oF4VRBngAMWClzsAzBPY\n3D7XJCInLJPR16mprd4UZoJMJROQWcRcubsomDA9meQoSJiL1KfLT71H0rIGFBcV\nE4sfmynVQ2KLTc0keTjrHCg3GBr18PbWz5BTut/sp3FcfGp3knHCzJRLwJ5AF5BT\nOi6Cw6pc1Ni5spSEtqWVFzM0Ej4Ed4WFphrrERSSXFZ3lFVrIezq/EgghTcC7AUQ\nudg/jQUwMbzz10gbG1Riw3xSwAwS/hfnDUA4iTX77V+84kmvDKAV3ZyVEh6/gT7Q\nhmB2CpoTARBKqO6e69d4PXuxXdxuL9GGsX5tioau9LuJbwEJORJZPVlT/6OGzbbR\nps6F4UsmsgCn6tMtw5mMfoBsqdxLn770WI0W9YLLMqvh3Y5Qq1UxslJDE7j8UdQd\nVI925CaR\n=bEFF\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-09-13T16:12:09Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/21344002?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sahassakhare/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sahassakhare/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sahassakhare/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sahassakhare/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html