/sahassakhare/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sahassakhare/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/sahassakhare","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sahassakhare/agentic-ui/commits/ddceb2086bcf59f8b9bccb1857bc135fe8f02fe1/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-13T16:03:07Z","email":"shapitsahas@gmail.com","name":"Sahas Sakhare"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-13T16:03:07Z","email":"shapitsahas@gmail.com","name":"Sahas Sakhare"},"message":"chore(catalog-server): bump 0.1.0 → 0.1.1 to ship the kind-on-events change\n\ncommit 83f7053 added kind to the Node catalog-server''s SSE mutation events but\nleft the version at 0.1.0, so publish.yml (which skips versions already on npm)\nwould never release it. Bump to 0.1.1 so the change ships.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"e785fb5c79e9d56174fa03d0eaaccde1d49cbe40","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sahassakhare/agentic-ui/git/trees/e785fb5c79e9d56174fa03d0eaaccde1d49cbe40"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sahassakhare/agentic-ui/git/commits/ddceb2086bcf59f8b9bccb1857bc135fe8f02fe1","verification":{"payload":"tree e785fb5c79e9d56174fa03d0eaaccde1d49cbe40\nparent 6667062c8faf41c4ecffbcde8f13d619de64e919\nauthor Sahas Sakhare <shapitsahas@gmail.com> 1789315387 +0530\ncommitter Sahas Sakhare <shapitsahas@gmail.com> 1789315387 +0530\n\nchore(catalog-server): bump 0.1.0 → 0.1.1 to ship the kind-on-events change\n\ncommit 83f7053 added kind to the Node catalog-server''s SSE mutation events but\nleft the version at 0.1.0, so publish.yml (which skips versions already on npm)\nwould never release it. Bump to 0.1.1 so the change ships.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\niQGzBAABCAAdFiEE1eujchKuJhYER67YWqdl9Lsba5AFAmqmyT0ACgkQWqdl9Lsb\na5DgqAv6At63MkJfWreCvr8/JD7nmO9wSki3Kj45UU