i/commits/f5cab9b428cfa9f8d975ec05cdbe1bc76d89a746/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-13T06:44:01Z","email":"shapitsahas@gmail.com","name":"Sahas Sakhare"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-13T06:44:01Z","email":"shapitsahas@gmail.com","name":"Sahas Sakhare"},"message":"ci: make lib-version guard self-heal a missing base ref\n\nThe lib-version-guard job failed with ''Cannot resolve base ref origin/main'' —\nthe runner''s checkout (actions/checkout bumped to v7 by dependabot) didn''t leave\nan origin/main remote-tracking ref, and the script errored instead of fetching\nit. resolveBase now tries origin/<base>, then the bare branch, then fetches it\nfrom origin (FETCH_HEAD) before giving up; clearer messages distinguish an\nunresolvable ref from a missing merge-base (shallow clone). Verified locally:\nauto-resolve and an explicit ref both pass.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"4c21202601fe4712ad592123aee8a255ed11da7c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sahassakhare/agentic-ui/git/trees/4c21202601fe4712ad592123aee8a255ed11da7c"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sahassakhare/agentic-ui/git/commits/f5cab9b428cfa9f8d975ec05cdbe1bc76d89a746","verification":{"payload":"tree 4c21202601fe4712ad592123aee8a255ed11da7c\nparent 265e724365b20845098d7e93dfb3a2f103978bb4\nauthor Sahas Sakhare <shapitsahas@gmail.com> 1789281841 +0530\ncommitter Sahas Sakhare <shapitsahas@gmail.com> 1789281841 +0530\n\nci: make lib-version guard self-heal a missing base ref\n\nThe lib-version-guard job failed with ''Cannot resolve base ref origin/main'' —\nthe runner''s checkout (actions/checkout bumped to v7 by dependabot) didn''t leave\nan origin/main remote-tracking ref, and the script errored instead of fetching\nit. resolveBase now tries origin/<base>, then the bare branch, then fetches it\nfrom origin (FETCH_HEAD) before giving up; clearer messages distinguish an\nunresolvable ref from a missing merge-base (shallow clone). Veri