845098d7e93dfb3a2f103978bb4","node_id":"C_kwDOSNG7mtoAKDI2NWU3MjQzNjViMjA4NDUwOThkN2U5M2RmYjNhMmYxMDM5NzhiYjQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/sahassakhare/agentic-ui/commit/5e3a234cb84a47eec38777136af8754b4710ed3f","sha":"5e3a234cb84a47eec38777136af8754b4710ed3f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sahassakhare/agentic-ui/commits/5e3a234cb84a47eec38777136af8754b4710ed3f"},{"html_url":"https://github.com/sahassakhare/agentic-ui/commit/47d1463ee099a8033f4d722cce569873d09726f4","sha":"47d1463ee099a8033f4d722cce569873d09726f4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sahassakhare/agentic-ui/commits/47d1463ee099a8033f4d722cce569873d09726f4"}],"sha":"265e724365b20845098d7e93dfb3a2f103978bb4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sahassakhare/agentic-ui/commits/265e724365b20845098d7e93dfb3a2f103978bb4"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/21344002?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sahassakhare/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sahassakhare/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sahassakhare/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sahassakhare/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/sahassakhare","id":21344002,"login":"sahassakhare","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIxMzQ0MDAy","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sahassakhare/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sahassakhare/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sahassakhare/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sahassakhare/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sahassakhare/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/sahassakhare","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sahassakhare/agentic-ui/commits/5e3a234cb84a47eec38777136af8754b4710ed3f/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-04T20:36:35Z","email":"shapitsahas@gmail.com","name":"Sahas Sakhare"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-04T20:36:35Z","email":"shapitsahas@gmail.com","name":"Sahas Sakhare"},"message":"feat(studio): copilot can refine experiences too (consistent with create)\n\nThe previous commit let the copilot CREATE experiences but get/updateDraft still\nrouted to /capabilities, so refining one failed. Route get + updateDraft to the\nexperiences store for kind===''experience'': get returns { title, goal, …body }\n(title/goal are top-level, intents/requires are the body), and update splits the\npatch back into the top-level fields vs the ExperienceBody. Adds a\nresolveExperience helper (by id or name). getActiveCapability already resolves\nthe /experiences/:id route, so ''add X to this experience'' works too.\n\nVerified live (Gemini): refining probe-refine-exp added expense-form to its\nrequires alongside the existing customer-intake. Studio typechecks; specs green.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"9642773cad923781509d88224ce3673d4fcc491f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sahassakhare/agentic-ui/git/trees/9642773cad923781509d88224ce3673d4fcc491f"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sahassakhare/agentic-ui/git/commits/5e3a234cb84a47eec38777136af8754b4710ed3f","verification":{"payload":"tree 9642773cad923781509d88224ce3673d4fcc491f\nparent cb2fe3f3999ddb103563c45faae0183a5a5e469f\nauthor Sahas Sakhare <shapitsahas@gmail.com> 1788554195 +0530\ncommitter Sahas Sakhare <shapitsahas@gmail.com> 1788554195 +0530\n\nfeat(studio): copilot can refine experiences too (consistent with create)\n\nThe previous commit let the copilot CREATE experiences but get/updateDraft still\nrouted to /capabilities, so refining one failed. Route get + updateDraft to the\nexperiences store for kind===''experience'': get returns { title, goal, …body }\n(title/goal are top-level, intents/requires are the body), and update splits the\npatch back into the top-level fields vs the ExperienceBody. Adds a\nresolveExperience helper (by id or name). getActiveCapability already resolves\nthe /experiences/:id route, so ''add X to this experience'' works too.\n\nVerified live (Gemini): refining probe-refine-exp added expense-form to its\nrequires alongside the existing customer-intake. Studio typechecks; specs green.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\niQGzBAABCAAdFiEE1eujchKuJhYER67YWqdl9Lsba5AFAmqbK9MACgkQWqdl9Lsb\na5A6TgwApRtoBwaNc/YAQyuFPh8Ee+RFovmUg2cY1xDpU8l9mCxC5jIM0oQDU9OU\nvpxqj/a8MT/dw0yyPz/2KIvYsiJ/UZqUqob8iY4f3if2R6Q09jnuvXBpvCTLdc3j\nyyDQEfiRzuA5PSfbMkugTDl554ZVxyUVtP1hxIXhFQerNvYW+MOSf9Tbue3h0IlB\nS1/j6VHNk13yhEQ47knBFOi8qer893l30C7PgRjEL6FvHav8612uQLrIjHFDxIMS\ncG+pa5kUPt8xE9d36jMqAUgoVOYVz820c2DdBQuJ8BzixT2kSkpI0GFd3jU45TZc\nWYOr5Z6lyVn+Fy9n+V2+PibKs8qz0cyER7JJqLf+eR8n7V34c3U0s07Dso2dPOpO\nVxH9oDqQCvDqMpEEGg/kfdSh2iYgobZOpXImG/1CJYPumyKR2VguisRt5O3+CwQW\nAV3W1/YA+JHoEYa9XVpOPJtsUictdUuE2cZnEywOkBPumfw9xC0zwCLXRUKc+NhW\n0CitjfJq\n=Ec8V\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-09-04T20:36:39Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/21344002?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sahassakhare/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sahassakhare/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sahassakhare/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sahassakhare/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/sahassakhare","id":21344002,"login":"sahassakhare","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIxMzQ0MDAy","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sahassakhare/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sahassakhare/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sahassakhare/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sahassakhare/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sahassakhare/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/sahassakhare","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/sahassakhare/agentic-ui/commit/5e3a234cb84a47eec38777136af8754b4710ed3f","node_id":"C_kwDOSNG7mtoAKDVlM2EyMzRjYjg0YTQ3ZWVjMzg3NzcxMzZhZjg3NTRiNDcxMGVkM2Y","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/sahassakhare/agentic-ui/commit/cb2fe3f3999ddb103563c45faae0183a5a5e469f","sha":"cb2fe3f3999ddb103563c45faae0183a5a5e469f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sahassakhare/agentic-ui/commits/cb2fe3f3999ddb103563c45faae0183a5a5e469f"}],"sha":"5e3a234cb84a47eec38777136af8754b4710ed3f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sahassakhare/agentic-ui/commits/5e3a234cb84a47eec38777136af8754b4710ed3f"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/21344002?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sahassakhare/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sahassakhare/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sahassakhare/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sahassakhare/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/sahassakhare","id":21344002,"login":"sahassakhare","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIxMzQ0MDAy","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sahassakhare/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sahassakhare/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sahassakhare/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sahassakhare/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sahassakhare/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/sahassakhare","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sahassakhare/agentic-ui/commits/cb2fe3f3999ddb103563c45faae0183a5a5e469f/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-04T20:00:54Z","email":"shapitsahas@gmail.com","name":"Sahas Sakhare"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-04T20:00:54Z","email":"shapitsahas@gmail.com","name":"Sahas Sakhare"},"message":"feat(studio): copilot can draft experiences (separate store) — completes kind coverage\n\nExperiences live in /experiences (ExperienceCatalogService), not /capabilities,\nso the copilot''s createDraft/list bridge now routes kind===''experience'' there:\ncreate splits title+goal (top-level) from the ExperienceBody (intents/requires),\nand list reads the experiences store. designerPathFor sends experiences to their\n/experiences/:id detail page. A new experience draft contract composes existing\ncapabilities via requires:[{kind,name}].\n\nVerified live (Gemini): ''draft an experience … that requires the customer-intake\nform'' created it in the experiences store with goal + requires:[form:\ncustomer-intake] and navigated to its detail page.\n\nWith this the copilot drafts every meaningful kind: form, decision, page,\nworkflow, datasource, tool, prompt, skill, and experience.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"d327e59c0e88e1bdba678c9dad64054e9da0ed98","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sahassakhare/agentic-ui/git/trees/d327e59c0e88e1bdba678c9dad64054e9da0ed98"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sahassakhare/agentic-ui/git/commits/cb2fe3f3999ddb103563c45faae0183a5a5e469f","verification":{"payload":"tree d327e59c0e88e1bdba678c9dad64054e9da0ed98\nparent 4da503a7dc8e0a0034a37040025e4efc33914c43\nauthor Sahas Sakhare <shapitsahas@gmail.com> 1788552054 +0530\ncommitter Sahas Sakhare <shapitsahas@gmail.com> 1788552054 +0530\n\nfeat(studio): copilot can draft experiences (separate store) — completes kind coverage\n\nExperiences live in /experiences (ExperienceCatalogService), not /capabilities,\nso the copilot''s createDraft/list bridge now routes kind===''experience'' there:\ncreate splits title+goal (top-level) from the ExperienceBody (intents/requires),\nand list reads the experiences store. designerPathFor sends experiences to their\n/experiences/:id detail page. A new experience draft contract composes existing\ncapabilities via requires:[{kind,name}].\n\nVerified live (Gemini): ''draft an experience … that requires the customer-intake\nform'' created it in the experiences store with goal + requires:[form:\ncustomer-intake] and navigated to its detail page.\n\nWith this the copilot drafts every meaningful kind: form, decision, page,\nworkflow, datasource, tool, prompt, skill, and experience.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\niQGzBAABCAAdFiEE1eujchKuJhYER67YWqdl9Lsba5AFAmqbI3YACgkQWqdl9Lsb\na5CVEgv/YnWXchG5XK4fShzyiGG1neJAg4uFS7JA6ZWIHiw2gcMquvFJQ1rHrzsd\nsxc2BLzXD/dO1drwXe+YFE0a8WJNIoDpsbNSa0xYbqxn09q4FCt7nhpvYnwbJO8k\nqLEsSKDGiVA+ChebXQBiyjD+kKB3QoG/Xielv6JgFlFVxvrLMouAnenP3RQYh+9H\na+bE3CKKvBZMtv1zqe82ubVdLkuYRXQcDGmQOmaPCcEX8t5qpY7oE4MkhOwVCASc\n5mKqhBsB0P6bi73agApWOJCASgmoYhCbGIZCcOToZjWv2Nj3i4rELnlzMDbBGbs3\nicoFxCmk+nVtqgS0zoYEV6G53uf8BybIyOk7gKlA1RQbGCn6MXHlAVvTev3IBogJ\npWeZbl+Jqj395gX4YrVtfv79uEZ/bfSimXPpmug7M6TMerPaDs+j1sC6kdAbQ5NR\nccuM/UcYl+PQTb0l3eNCOqHZRyceUvaKhEh2bHr+n9rFRu0SG8vmH5cG6w6EL8YV\nTGtpJurC\n=r4VK\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-09-04T20:00:57Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/21344002?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sahassakhare/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sahassakhare/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sahassakhare/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sahassakhare/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/sahassakhare","id":21344002,"login":"sahassakhare","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIxMzQ0MDAy","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sahassakhare/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sahassakhare/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sahassakhare/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sahassakhare/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sahassakhare/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/sahassakhare","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/sahassakhare/agentic-ui/commit/cb2fe3f3999ddb103563c45faae0183a5a5e469f","node_id":"C_kwDOSNG7mtoAKGNiMmZlM2YzOTk5ZGRiMTAzNTYzYzQ1ZmFhZTAxODNhNWE1ZTQ2OWY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/sahassakhare/agentic-ui/commit/4da503a7dc8e0a0034a37040025e4efc33914c43","sha":"4da503a7dc8e0a0034a37040025e4efc33914c43","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sahassakhare/agentic-ui/commits/4da503a7dc8e0a0034a37040025e4efc33914c43"}],"sha":"cb2fe3f3999ddb103563c45faae0183a5a5e469f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sahassakhare/agentic-ui/commits/cb2fe3f3999ddb103563c45faae0183a5a5e469f"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/21344002?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sahassakhare/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sahassakhare/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sahassakhare/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sahassakhare/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/sahassakhare","id":21344002,"login":"sahassakhare","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIxMzQ0MDAy","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sahassakhare/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sahassakhare/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sahassakhare/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sahassakhare/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sahassakhare/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/sahassakhare","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sahassakhare/agentic-ui/commits/4da503a7dc8e0a0034a37040025e4efc33914c43/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-04T19:46:05Z","email":"shapitsahas@gmail.com","name":"Sahas Sakhare"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-04T19:46:05Z","email":"shapitsahas@gmail.com","name":"Sahas Sakhare"},"message":"feat(studio): copilot draft contracts for datasource, tool, prompt & skill\n\nClose part of the coverage gap: these kinds previously had no body contract, so\nthe copilot guessed their shape. Add explicit contracts to createDraftCapability\nmatching the real catalog bodies:\n- datasource: { kind:''rest'', endpoint, method?, headers? } — secrets as ${NAME}\n- tool: { dataSource, method, path:''/r/{arg}'', inputs:[…], body? } — {arg} templating\n- prompt: { description, template:''…{{var}}…'', model? }\n- skill: { description, tools:[…], prompt? }\n\nVerified live (Gemini): ''draft a datasource at httpbin POST'' then ''a tool that\ncalls it GET on /get with input q'' produced correctly-shaped bodies, with the\ntool bound to the just-created datasource. Studio typechecks; specs green.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"f8f50ba5bebdd7225b6ddf62b13ee43c59c0b4fd","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sahassakhare/agentic-ui/git/trees/f8f50ba5bebdd7225b6ddf62b13ee43c59c0b4fd"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sahassakhare/agentic-ui/git/commits/4da503a7dc8e0a0034a37040025e4efc33914c43","verification":{"payload":"tree f8f50ba5bebdd7225b6ddf62b13ee43c59c0b4fd\nparent a9ff828041211a1df5322643701e6065bd7f6bf7\nauthor Sahas Sakhare <shapitsahas@gmail.com> 1788551165 +0530\ncommitter Sahas Sakhare <shapitsahas@gmail.com> 1788551165 +0530\n\nfeat(studio): copilot draft contracts for datasource, tool, prompt & skill\n\nClose part of the coverage gap: these kinds previously had no body contract, so\nthe copilot guessed their shape. Add explicit contracts to createDraftCapability\nmatching the real catalog bodies:\n- datasource: { kind:''rest'', endpoint, method?, headers? } — secrets as ${NAME}\n- tool: { dataSource, method, path:''/r/{arg}'', inputs:[…], body? } — {arg} templating\n- prompt: { description, template:''…{{var}}…'', model? }\n- skill: { description, tools:[…], prompt? }\n\nVerified live (Gemini): ''draft a datasource at httpbin POST'' then ''a tool that\ncalls it GET on /get with input q'' produced correctly-shaped bodies, with the\ntool bound to the just-created datasource. Studio typechecks; specs green.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\niQGzBAABCAAdFiEE1eujchKuJhYER67YWqdl9Lsba5AFAmqbH/0ACgkQWqdl9Lsb\na5As8QwAsT898QHC0OWt7YfzkoaTYihYDsE0bUxp7LVSf7W/etuqjyND17bb+oWj\nhwvL+nLz/pWNxa1RU4LdjdR/bK8q9u0y4ZIYcDYKYqHC9UHw/zLqwaRlWAgMYjJM\nHtp1dAw868EmVrABc6vJoWS3e8DEi6tONgz4M3qMCCt2SjiOAAUDz0XTqpHZhZUE\nOUACPE6KIjPj7dTwU/ps8UMRjQ0hdqalpRliMGk6xrR6/JD/jNjSOF5BbDFVG1Z5\nlKjhgE1AuBXcZHY+VbAr7ysVNcKrABcT74M+Mni+3tiE9n07kyJP5QCMrh36n7I4\noovgj0ZMLVjhqtVfSswP2rDTFSMC5RtB0BCPFiYc+VPOnwZyS9iUVo7eHpZy3hTv\nnDZEAodOJqf2RKT96cuOVlu7xlibBBd7RgNRtdWhIir1YUVIY1ImMeIy/Gt56TYR\nepCtzF4xTwR1PX0UdpR6i0jwTHh9rLO9Dir4T6OGUr/0gaiBchKVYI+MuB93MYJu\nLFo/YM9h\n=gEvH\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-09-04T19:46:09Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/21344002?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sahassakhare/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sahassakhare/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sahassakhare/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sahassakhare/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/sahassakhare","id":21344002,"login":"sahassakhare","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIxMzQ0MDAy","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sahassakhare/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sahassakhare/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sahassakhare/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sahassakhare/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sahassakhare/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/sahassakhare","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/sahassakhare/agentic-ui/commit/4da503a7dc8e0a0034a37040025e4efc33914c43","node_id":"C_kwDOSNG7mtoAKDRkYTUwM2E3ZGM4ZTBhMDAzNGEzNzA0MDAyNWU0ZWZjMzM5MTRjNDM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/sahassakhare/agentic-ui/commit/a9ff828041211a1df5322643701e6065bd7f6bf7","sha":"a9ff828041211a1df5322643701e6065bd7f6bf7","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sahassakhare/agentic-ui/commits/a9ff828041211a1df5322643701e6065bd7f6bf7"}],"sha":"4da503a7dc8e0a0034a37040025e4efc33914c43","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sahassakhare/agentic-ui/commits/4da503a7dc8e0a0034a37040025e4efc33914c43"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/21344002?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sahassakhare/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sahassakhare/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sahassakhare/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sahassakhare/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/sahassakhare","id":21344002,"login":"sahassakhare","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIxMzQ0MDAy","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sahassakhare/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sahassakhare/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sahassakhare/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sahassakhare/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sahassakhare/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/sahassakhare","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sahassakhare/agentic-ui/commits/a9ff828041211a1df5322643701e6065bd7f6bf7/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-04T18:58:27Z","email":"shapitsahas@gmail.com","name":"Sahas Sakhare"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-04T18:58:27Z","email":"shapitsahas@gmail.com","name":"Sahas Sakhare"},"message":"feat(catalog-service): emit capability kind on SSE mutation events\n\nPort the kind-on-events change to the Java catalog-service — the backend the\nStudio/Hub actually run on (:8081, H2). The earlier commit added this to the\nNode agentic-catalog-server, which isn''t the running backend, so the client''s\ntargeted re-hydrate always fell back to a per-event lookup.\n\nCatalogEvents.publish gains a kind-aware overload (kind omitted when null, for\nnon-capability entities); CapabilityController passes c.kind on create/update/\ndelete. The lib CatalogClient already reads m.kind (skips its lookup when\npresent and targets deletes), so this is purely additive.\n\nVerified live: after rebuild + restart, the /stream events for a form\ncreate→update→delete all carry kind=form.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"3a06562643fbad5e111204339e7cc8af316ff7c9","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sahassakhare/agentic-ui/git/trees/3a06562643fbad5e111204339e7cc8af316ff7c9"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sahassakhare/agentic-ui/git/commits/a9ff828041211a1df5322643701e6065bd7f6bf7","verification":{"payload":"tree 3a06562643fbad5e111204339e7cc8af316ff7c9\nparent a6879e5f0e71ae5bcecbdaa9bf9bb9a2d525d5b9\nauthor Sahas Sakhare <shapitsahas@gmail.com> 1788548307 +0530\ncommitter Sahas Sakhare <shapitsahas@gmail.com> 1788548307 +0530\n\nfeat(catalog-service): emit capability kind on SSE mutation events\n\nPort the kind-on-events change to the Java catalog-service — the backend the\nStudio/Hub actually run on (:8081, H2). The earlier commit added this to the\nNode agentic-catalog-server, which isn''t the running backend, so the client''s\ntargeted re-hydrate always fell back to a per-event lookup.\n\nCatalogEvents.publish gains a kind-aware overload (kind omitted when null, for\nnon-capability entities); CapabilityController passes c.kind on create/update/\ndelete. The lib CatalogClient already reads m.kind (skips its lookup when\npresent and targets deletes), so this is purely additive.\n\nVerified live: after rebuild + restart, the /stream events for a form\ncreate→update→delete all carry kind=form.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\niQGzBAABCAAdFiEE1eujchKuJhYER67YWqdl9Lsba5AFAmqbFNMACgkQWqdl9Lsb\na5BJDAv+L7WhzWKgFghfOavO74jZZoDlTPpQMbqFlXqu8W3yPFPwdpMx90lobVDj\nCQyCWY3z+oT1SWYv1rH1NlcCY7L8MmtZqs5DufMl7e+S+lbpq4iASQZ7o3eXo5bq\na0rvVzNJkNAKb+15tB8hFJMVe9raHF2kO0HXBRj1anXDd/G69QDW5GsUYXU59xum\nvWQ0EqtO+vbNvmkYiSv5Kzuj92pjlem2WxTumA6x4PNcC84M4TKOkSmKCl4EYcAK\nx/bXMy0MlhVJM8Myg5J9yyozDoVur+5sK2iMzGj3B74+PbIjOqhIzvQJ7sWLGyR2\nkPZTnEWORLnjyH0uKAl+YnTJvVaVBUNzwqhbx0dlA6Vr8SozWbj9mv8LIw8ePDq/\nwCCNuyckvC0zhSpm8XqG+7ZmgIVBlbDZU7OUiQzuhfvjIK8r/JAvqxXIXdXlOGBY\nLduzCSVnkYsr0ABakfNw8RDy+XFoxsPCRitHRTeurU10z3WfSOAqz1wLeSctqkwH\nnQR62Lfd\n=qI/N\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-09-04T18:58:31Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/21344002?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sahassakhare/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sahassakhare/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sahassakhare/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sahassakhare/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/sahassakhare","id":21344002,"login":"sahassakhare","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIxMzQ0MDAy","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sahassakhare/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sahassakhare/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sahassakhare/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sahassakhare/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sahassakhare/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/sahassakhare","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/sahassakhare/agentic-ui/commit/a9ff828041211a1df5322643701e6065bd7f6bf7","node_id":"C_kwDOSNG7mtoAKGE5ZmY4MjgwNDEyMTFhMWRmNTMyMjY0MzcwMWU2MDY1YmQ3ZjZiZjc","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/sahassakhare/agentic-ui/commit/a6879e5f0e71ae5bcecbdaa9bf9bb9a2d525d5b9","sha":"a6879e5f0e71ae5bcecbdaa9bf9bb9a2d525d5b9","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sahassakhare/agentic-ui/commits/a6879e5f0e71ae5bcecbdaa9bf9bb9a2d525d5b9"}],"sha":"a9ff828041211a1df5322643701e6065bd7f6bf7","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sahassakhare/agentic-ui/commits/a9ff828041211a1df5322643701e6065bd7f6bf7"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/21344002?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sahassakhare/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sahassakhare/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sahassakhare/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sahassakhare/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/sahassakhare","id":21344002,"login":"sahassakhare","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIxMzQ0MDAy","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sahassakhare/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sahassakhare/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sahassakhare/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sahassakhare/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sahassakhare/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/sahassakhare","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sahassakhare/agentic-ui/commits/a6879e5f0e71ae5bcecbdaa9bf9bb9a2d525d5b9/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-02T17:38:46Z","email":"shapitsahas@gmail.com","name":"Sahas Sakhare"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-02T17:38:46Z","email":"shapitsahas@gmail.com","name":"Sahas Sakhare"},"message":"feat(studio): make app membership transitive through experiences\n\nExperiences live in a separate store, so the dependency graph didn''t hold them\nas nodes — a page→experience ref was a dead leaf and the capabilities an\nexperience pulls in (its requires) were never attributed to the application.\n\nLoad experiences via ExperienceCatalogService alongside the capability kinds,\nfold them in as experience: nodes, and extract their requires as edges. Now the\nforward closure runs application → page → experience → its components/forms/\nworkflows/…, so the filter and membership chips include everything an app\ncomposes through an experience.\n\nVerified live: expense-form and the category-picker component (used only via the\nexpense-claim experience embedded in acme-workspace''s expense-page) now carry\nthe ◆ acme-workspace chip, and Forms @acme-workspace went 1 → 3. Studio typechecks.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"1e2dee89a4f16fc80acbcd202a560c438c84f4e1","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sahassakhare/agentic-ui/git/trees/1e2dee89a4f16fc80acbcd202a560c438c84f4e1"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sahassakhare/agentic-ui/git/commits/a6879e5f0e71ae5bcecbdaa9bf9bb9a2d525d5b9","verification":{"payload":"tree 1e2dee89a4f16fc80acbcd202a560c438c84f4e1\nparent 2826f057f37afca6d37b03b2a4ba560dd6adc765\nauthor Sahas Sakhare <shapitsahas@gmail.com> 1788370726 +0530\ncommitter Sahas Sakhare <shapitsahas@gmail.com> 1788370726 +0530\n\nfeat(studio): make app membership transitive through experiences\n\nExperiences live in a separate store, so the dependency graph didn''t hold them\nas nodes — a page→experience ref was a dead leaf and the capabilities an\nexperience pulls in (its requires) were never attributed to the application.\n\nLoad experiences via ExperienceCatalogService alongside the capability kinds,\nfold them in as experience: nodes, and extract their requires as edges. Now the\nforward closure runs application → page → experience → its components/forms/\nworkflows/…, so the filter and membership chips include everything an app\ncomposes through an experience.\n\nVerified live: expense-form and the category-picker component (used only via the\nexpense-claim experience embedded in acme-workspace''s expense-page) now carry\nthe ◆ acme-workspace chip, and Forms @acme-workspace went 1 → 3. Studio typechecks.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\niQGzBAABCAAdFiEE1eujchKuJhYER67YWqdl9Lsba5AFAmqYXyYACgkQWqdl9Lsb\na5Ab5wwAkiNehHXEqW1+c16+Fh7dyPOxMhpwE1YTQppJqCl7JVj46uPrAB+YwxFF\n0vMLGpLu7kFVjZ7UTttdj145m6JE4XKeLQqP962hVNAhO58g4rXGgOtn8/XCGue8\n3TKwwHzg//uhU8OEmcN5rbvie1QMDRN6ShKgv4D2BNjozQlPhbc5YlDlNDpKWMPn\n6JqRicMUlp92zdttUWQGeOh40MESVSoWbNeY8p4tpl4j8x+Rk7mfFBLcYiPk87IF\nX7XIkKS19oADAbgsqiwHaC/BM76ON6+SqLjcgeETEeuUoolDpaKiUJq7nrhv88VI\nKWlxDeBYL/lYLVDB+/7Zq89KjZ2wZFe7WTkHqpjOCiHNy/MMki1H8sxyq1XSR5Cm\nVS+e6QsoadsT8mm/E5GNcRhXmGjcY2s7/lbdubhQrLUL8QkyxWSBV7cpStOJkjP6\nBY99d2nUJ9E3p5ap31+2FOdJSmvJHHrhGifnMFuHloZosmQMHr06VHHJ1EnvU59+\n6ubAYids\n=lt8n\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-09-02T17:38:50Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/21344002?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sahassakhare/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sahassakhare/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sahassakhare/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sahassakhare/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/sahassakhare","id":21344002,"login":"sahassakhare","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIxMzQ0MDAy","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sahassakhare/orgs","r