/repos/sahassakhare/agentic-ui/commits/4250c0b0cb198358bbbcfd48b87a9e7eed2dbc06/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-02T17:16:49Z","email":"shapitsahas@gmail.com","name":"Sahas Sakhare"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-02T17:16:49Z","email":"shapitsahas@gmail.com","name":"Sahas Sakhare"},"message":"feat(studio): show application-membership chips on capability rows\n\nComplements the application filter with an at-a-glance indicator: each row in a\ncategory list shows which application(s) transitively use that capability as a\n◆ chip, and clicking a chip sets the top-bar application filter to that app.\n\n- CapabilityGraphService.appsUsing(cap): reverse of membersOf — the app names\n  whose composition graph reaches this capability (tracks application names at\n  build time).\n- capability-studio renders the chips after the lifecycle badge; click →\n  appFilter.selected.set(app).\n\nVerified live: the Pages list tags each page with its app(s); clicking\n◆ acme-workspace scoped Pages to 7 of 14. Studio typechecks.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"62a5dd84305dbbea09e5dbaece251a62ab9bc6cd","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sahassakhare/agentic-ui/git/trees/62a5dd84305dbbea09e5dbaece251a62ab9bc6cd"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sahassakhare/agentic-ui/git/commits/4250c0b0cb198358bbbcfd48b87a9e7eed2dbc06","verification":{"payload":"tree 62a5dd84305dbbea09e5dbaece251a62ab9bc6cd\nparent d23c0114234010edeae5dcc29dc81ea0ac8737f6\nauthor Sahas Sakhare <shapitsahas@gmail.com> 1788369409 +0530\ncommitter Sahas Sakhare <shapitsahas@gmail.com> 1788369409 +0530\n\nfeat(studio): show application-membership chips on capability rows\n\nComplements the application filter with an at-a-glance indicator: each row in a\ncategory list shows which application(s) transitively use that capability as a\n◆ chip, and clicking a chip sets the top-bar application filter to that app.\n\n- CapabilityGraphService.appsUsing(cap): reverse of membersOf — the app names\n  whose composition graph reaches this capability (tracks application names at\n  build time).\n- capability-studio renders the chips after the lifecycle badge; click →\n  appFilter.selected.set(app).\n\nVerified live: the Pages list tags each page with its app(s); clicking\n◆ acme-workspace scoped Pages to 7 of 14. Studio typechecks.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\niQGzBAABCAAdFiEE1eujchKuJhYER67YWqdl9Lsba5AFAmqYWgEACgkQWqdl9Lsb\na5BOJAwAyS8SrfYRkfUg8ufYtAixCN+si9fkIC/rVxuiL1Smpjfdz253ETXxLq3m\n7Z9cBzvkpLUhuxXAE785f2dow9fxt23M7jC9eydmvHvINyt6KtWheIlD43hofxCd\nePITMwYOAvA+f1OmK+26IfMRSGjoFEBZ0EQVW9sqdEWgFJdSG3WRVeE4Ht2VBVVX\n9MoNCASPrxgO2amvAcLPKRV3Z9XsMl0SU3oODhrRrxWkQ5VSEloAro+/BCe71ecO\nWpGVi5/uhCYv/c+FWg/tqcR8JrZPB7HRxcxa2c+yMcIRN8HD2YYk/IkmbtQZAW4h\nyuExhcgzBJx786YgnRmPn0cmoPDdTP3OjaVIu4mV6MoxCYlMIY9M2p5twrLgOd2h\nZe/JfLH8FFWHv5Cw8NuVdUNNpxKO+unwYsIlGURjjrI+/QwZ7TxpeHJiYjAQX/mk\nnrV0fIDPhWdjxeAD/Rdes0CSzbh0WKgkDPr7Pbe7R8JBVo3fqTkLrQ0oyhMalKJC\n/75Sw0Cb\n=80ml\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-09-02T17:16:54Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/21344002?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sahassakhare/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sahassakhare/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sahassakhare/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sahassakhare/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/sahassakhare","id":21344002,"login":"sahassakhare","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIxMzQ0MDAy","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sahassakhare/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sahassakhare/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sahassakhare/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sahassakhare/sta