has@gmail.com","name":"Sahas Sakhare"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-02T17:12:31Z","email":"shapitsahas@gmail.com","name":"Sahas Sakhare"},"message":"feat(studio): Studio-wide ''filter by application'' across category lists\n\nA top-bar application selector scopes every category list to just the\ncapabilities the chosen application composes. Membership is the transitive\nforward closure of the existing dependency graph (application → pages →\nsurfaces → their forms/components/tools/validators/decisions/…), so it is\naccurate and needs no new field on capabilities.\n\n- CapabilityGraphService.membersOf(app): memoized reachable-set of kind:name.\n- AppFilterService (root): the shared selected app + the app list, refreshed\n  once authenticated (the service is created pre-login, when a tenant-scoped\n  fetch would be empty).\n- app.component: a compact top-bar <select> (All applications / each app),\n  highlighted when active; the selection persists across in-app navigation.\n- Wired into the generic list (capability-studio → forms, pages, decisions,\n  themes, prompts, navigation, skills, knowledge, memory, components,\n  applications) and the bespoke workflow + experiences lists.\n\nVerified live: acme-workspace scopes Forms 18→1 and the filter persists across\nWorkflows/Decisions/Prompts with correct per-kind membership. Studio typechecks.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"bf2769452bbf3968373c6bdd1c52866eb460242e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sahassakhare/agentic-ui/git/trees/bf2769452bbf3968373c6bdd1c52866eb460242e"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sahassakhare/agentic-ui/git/commits/d23c0114234010edeae5dcc29dc81ea0ac8737f6","verification":{"payload":"tree bf2769452bbf3968373c6bdd1c52866eb460242e\nparent af2aa30e21f727e2c01dd546a6bc53b7bd7db6dc\nauthor Sahas Sakhare <shapitsahas@gmail.com> 1788369151 +0530\ncommitter Sahas Sakhare <shapitsahas@gmail.com> 1788369151 +0530\n\nfeat(studio): Studio-wide ''filter by application'' across category lists\n\nA top-bar application selector scopes every category list to just the\ncapabilities the chosen application composes. Membership is the transitive\nforward closure of the existing dependency graph (application → pages →\nsurfaces → their forms/components/tools/validators/decisions/…), so it is\naccurate and needs no new field on capabilities.\n\n- CapabilityGraphService.membersOf(app): memoized reachable-set of kind:name.\n- AppFilterService (root): the shared selected app + the app list, refreshed\n  once authenticated (the service is created pre-login, when a tenant-scoped\n  fetch would be empty).\n- app.component: a compact top-bar <select> (All applications / each app),\n  highlighted when active; the selection persists across in-app navigation.\n- Wired into the generic list (capability-studio → forms, pages, decisions,\n  themes, prompts, navigation, skills, knowledge, memory, components,\n  applications) and the bespoke workflow + experiences lists.\n\nVerified live: acme-workspace scopes Forms 18→1 and the filter persists across\nWorkflows/Decisions/Prompts with correct per-kind membership. Studio typechecks.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\niQGzBAABCAAdFiEE1eujchKuJhYER67YWqdl9Lsba5AFAmqYWP8ACgkQWqdl9Lsb\na5Aerwv/cO6zO+O91cj5A7085ile6AO4HMOXkPytzNNiZRt0mV4JY4Z1mpvjCPYQ\np9wCCQM5TgfLYxRH5DenD8Smx0eZxUIRB8iK3MvlbMlJfvGmHEmGAGmyNYqjUE/3\nVpMW1WABcpw3+DO3UxYVVYTdgiz9StcpNSlv7BHZsnJ31Mvve5EVMKSYng2Zrmdg\nvU0MT1IzdbY1ZjND3Q6j7gd+hsG2EpflyAu2pDE1m4LaDkYRlN7svRe/VHpmr2EY\nh4wY1PXVFKU5PwxfIFOgIumPNoND/EQWVnx88GHo7PRSQ9sDrl/8LjSc8ynV+GYZ\nE6E2N9JKVf6i2rYhef4HZWm/wTl9pIzXad5V6dbkfzTtc/Wh9MwhQYvY3GJP/lZ4\nWFn0G5Ki12lQQLbmetxtDc7HioNvQy/BE2TeQefF2djQ5fOBAZIUNrAZ9y1JFoAa\nyrK7/mVU2h94iNI60Qpy/wtL3zgwSBUQg5szJj1GQnDg/NbWHIIZxuwVNLAx/Ya3\nZiKm1gh4\n=mj4y\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-09-02T17:1