d}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/sahassakhare","id":21344002,"login":"sahassakhare","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIxMzQ0MDAy","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sahassakhare/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sahassakhare/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sahassakhare/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sahassakhare/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sahassakhare/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/sahassakhare","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sahassakhare/agentic-ui/commits/af2aa30e21f727e2c01dd546a6bc53b7bd7db6dc/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-02T16:53:14Z","email":"shapitsahas@gmail.com","name":"Sahas Sakhare"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-02T16:53:14Z","email":"shapitsahas@gmail.com","name":"Sahas Sakhare"},"message":"feat(studio): undo/redo in the decision, application & theme designers\n\nForm, workflow and page had undo/redo; decision, application and theme had\nnone — and none of those three could undo an edit at all, let alone after a\nsave. Add a reusable createHistory() helper (effect-based snapshot undo/redo\nwith built-in ⌘Z / ⌘⇧Z, ignored while typing) and wire it into all three:\n\n- decision: inputs + outputs + rules + hit-policy\n- application: title + description + assistant + master + nav\n- theme: the token set\n\nHistory is cleared only on reload (a fresh component), so it SURVIVES a save —\nthe explicit ask. Each designer gets ↶/↷ toolbar buttons (disabled when there''s\nnothing to undo/redo).\n\nVerified live on the theme designer: edit → undo → redo correct; undo stayed\navailable AFTER Save; a post-save edit undid back to the saved state. Studio\ntypechecks.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"b8258f282c06de9bf5b51b38047c6c7a7bcda97b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sahassakhare/agentic-ui/git/trees/b8258f282c06de9bf5b51b38047c6c7a7bcda97b"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sahassakhare/agentic-ui/git/commits/af2aa30e21f727e2c01dd546a6bc53b7bd7db6dc","verification":{"payload":"tree b8258f282c06de9bf5b51b38047c6c7a7bcda97b\nparent e91cf191fe8ff2915dab9a086d3c9880b8d9728b\nauthor Sahas Sakhare <shapitsahas@gmail.com> 1788367994 +0530\ncommitter Sahas Sakhare <shapitsahas@gmail.com> 1788367994 +0530\n\nfeat(studio): undo/redo in the decision, application & theme designers\n\nForm, workflow and page had undo/redo; decision, application and theme had\nnone — and none of those three could undo an edit at all, let alone after a\nsave. Add a reusable createHistory() helper (effect-based snapshot undo/redo\nwith built-in ⌘Z / ⌘⇧Z, ignored while typing) and wire it into all three:\n\n- decision: inputs + outputs + rules + hit-policy\n- application: title + description + assistant + master + nav\n- theme: the token set\n\nHistory is cleared only on reload (a fresh component), so it SURVIVES a save —\nthe explicit ask. Each designer gets ↶/↷ toolbar buttons (disabled when there''s\nnothing to undo/redo).\n\nVerified live on the theme designer: edit → undo → redo correct; undo stayed\navailable AFTER Save; a post-save edit undid back to the saved state. Studio\ntypechecks.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\niQGzBAABCAAdFiEE1eujchKuJhYER67YWqdl9Lsba5AFAmqYVHsACgkQWqdl9Lsb\na5CZHQwAuUsKaqHEAteLCBKPbuwBnp8osWf17MJK1ZXvjmYYCUPCJmHgffFGqqe5\nN206GRbijsgEJht4EnjsdQ+PrOeZk6JqFGsHomIV/80dQJFgnBFftE/jt0Ds8mVF\n/TDqUK/ulkgBgkBPwlepKRKwARfXBtkOeIPRcvgFQllLsvARt/zgc4PAYUnJsVmk\njDIxQF6P4RNCLOgG/NpsiU8Qzwqb2mrG53kKnsw6/GDy+r/WuGKU6YoThJiR4pfZ\nFnkonUIKM5wLqWl2tlkg1CVR5brIN+pOGQAdRYJtW+OVxDAnXK7VlEbPGlbi3p8G\nFL9H4uleIKExncMcyBYvExRms7ocf9yGy0XtGIir0Ww1D5AwkIlYhQ8iN2S+8unB\n3LQ8bW3gEEev1CPM/szK61LsQqbikABKk7eX6hIK7LgZ0zmRty7jcCPrFMUvxvQp\n4Xpll594OCzFq