"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sahassakhare/agentic-ui/commits/47d1463ee099a8033f4d722cce569873d09726f4/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-31T19:41:26Z","email":"shapitsahas@gmail.com","name":"sahassakhare"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-31T19:41:26Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"perf(experience): memoize ExperiencePlanner (plan §11 / ADR-051) (#86)\n\nMemoizes ExperiencePlanner.plan() — the deterministic pre-plan that resolves a\nbusiness goal into a concrete capability bundle (ADR-051 Seam D). Repeated plans\nfor the same resolved experience + caller skip the access-gate + graph traversal\nand return a cached result; telemetry still emits on every call so the\naccess-decision audit trail stays complete.\n\nCache keyed on (resolvedExperience, persona, permissions, allowUnapproved) with\nsynchronous, signal-based invalidation via a computed epoch over every source\nregistry plus ExperienceRegistry.approved(). +5 memoization specs. Bumps\nagentic-ui 1.6.0 -> 1.6.1 (+ CHANGELOG) so publish.yml releases the change.","tree":{"sha":"837157654bba5fb2fbe2d5de3126780818ac81a1","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sahassakhare/agentic-ui/git/trees/837157654bba5fb2fbe2d5de3126780818ac81a1"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sahassakhare/agentic-ui/git/commits/47d1463ee099a8033f4d722cce569873d09726f4","verification":{"payload":"tree 837157654bba5fb2fbe2d5de3126780818ac81a1\nparent f2f23db6888360cdfcef375350e260169fcf5ff8\nauthor sahassakhare <shapitsahas@gmail.com> 1788205286 +0530\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1788205286 +0530\n\nperf(experience): memoize ExperiencePlanner (plan §11 / ADR-051) (#86)\n\nMemoizes ExperiencePlanner.plan() — the deterministic pre-plan that resolves a\nbusiness goal into a concrete capability bundle (ADR-051 Seam D). Repeated plans\nfor the same resolved experience + caller skip the access-gate + graph traversal\nand return a cached result; telemetry still emits on every call so the\naccess-decision audit trail stays complete.\n\nCache keyed on (resolvedExperience, persona, permissions, allowUnapproved) with\nsynchronous, signal-based invalidation via a computed epoch over every source\nregistry plus ExperienceRegistry.approved(). +5 memoization specs. Bumps\nagentic-ui 1.6.0 -> 1.6.1 (+ CHANGELOG) so publish.yml releases the change.","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqldjmCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAut4QAE/GpNgbsYFL1Py+7ejfMwLG\n6urw9ll/MQt5J5ZRj5i+nzxdYWT5nxUdm6OOhJBcZiV6IK/W4i1F7/uD675d61ht\nfXHkJKjOf7PqCBtNXIXr8N+FbnqgNiTVJoXryzDJ73yhfJPWGSynnpWZO4xHq0n3\nM3wNo6p+dJYwVfem2uSLDGjxEJuCE3vQf14gWDkAOcFbyeO3nEJfdX7hx7FDBJbn\npdbGKL0rwGP2cEXJL0dJQ5eK5AyTtn90pjGozbr1w+j1ucRJ+5T5YTxY/exKutZ4\nMqN05/s1NV2XGMTzjiA8jdpMYcjdIRnMku/3h49I9LOsAKpQRWSi+1w1tpONagg+\nIOv7R1OLSdXNUtrRRzLZA4fNu9HRbBy97RqA4SzwdUYJRSp0bm51EO814r2FnJqT\nlml3FucI/RuxVLQJqldzAUWMRDMIvNbCrXa6J6KivAT6+nMX8kf0bnDPKHGEEnWq\ndcD4f3R+FF5ohP3x4fAQRwjHG85eRMwuhqVxVt+wLVhGqc+5vB0KGRvnUFctk3b8\nUnuf7Oypr0t/Yviv7A7H+zWUkSMI7CEDoLfToj5OZ2G0l/xpzB4iigJ/zfPGuK9y\nJLu6bUCRPJBnUKvQ0TI/LW/LuOPh6Bqio2oN9QOhKudRHNNj/nENtE6MJGpH+j08\nJeCc5kdhlAa/nSrxDNkj\n=HBis\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-08-31T19:41:26Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","id":19864447,"login":"web-flow","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":