te tickets by priority\" -> ticket-routing-ai\ndecision with 4 rules; \"a page showing the customer-intake form\" -> a page\nregion composing the real form. tsc clean; 85 Studio tests pass.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"bd5f779e7a1bbda275bf378b6d17cbc4bd8fc570","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sahassakhare/agentic-ui/git/trees/bd5f779e7a1bbda275bf378b6d17cbc4bd8fc570"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sahassakhare/agentic-ui/git/commits/eef78930d5ef08de235c7430c6f792fcaf8b13d1","verification":{"payload":"tree bd5f779e7a1bbda275bf378b6d17cbc4bd8fc570\nparent c15fb34fe538addc0efee0cac646b54268c3f83f\nauthor Sahas Sakhare <shapitsahas@gmail.com> 1788201193 +0530\ncommitter Sahas Sakhare <shapitsahas@gmail.com> 1788201193 +0530\n\nfeat(studio): copilot per-kind drafting — decisions & pages\n\nExtend createDraftCapability''s contract so the copilot drafts more than forms:\n- decision: a DMN table (inputs/outputs/rules with ops incl. an \"any\" catch-all).\n- page: composes EXISTING capabilities into layout regions — references real\n  names via listCapabilities and won''t invent surfaces.\nBackend prompt defers to the per-kind tool contracts.\n\nVerified live with Gemini: \"route tickets by priority\" -> ticket-routing-ai\ndecision with 4 rules; \"a page showing the customer-intake form\" -> a page\nregion composing the real form. tsc clean; 85 Studio tests pass.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\niQGzBAABCAAdFiEE1eujchKuJhYER67YWqdl9Lsba5AFAmqVyOoACgkQWqdl9Lsb\na5BABQv9EY8ZX8rPrrBHMODSDhtnOVC4ueGMmu0j7b/E4g60rh/++LCQCFkrqJXk\nzTkHclUAoGd0iNbEYR31BQCEYLCkAFYFzrPhKR1RO97+2suEBnfiNgzSfut13S1B\nXZ8PWkz46hFXLYecw5ndvC8GLzMfstqg2vquY0OTSqPRDssyUCQPO5NHJ5a1BnYB\n5p/yRdl9sJIT82aVOhjS3NE/jQX4cmBliwY1cdIoyxkGGRP0ota3Ac7acOqk8a9L\ngun0FyBcXp5wyVQw04Qp1vNfY/zoL4hLsL/MfMGZWW+Gn6JNgOErLSEsGrcOBD0W\n9ey+SFCjgcwQCD6dpMy3Sagyph+iwo3Tb0eBi5ePGfXHuKb