are/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sahassakhare/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sahassakhare/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sahassakhare/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/sahassakhare","id":21344002,"login":"sahassakhare","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIxMzQ0MDAy","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sahassakhare/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sahassakhare/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sahassakhare/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sahassakhare/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sahassakhare/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/sahassakhare","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sahassakhare/agentic-ui/commits/c15fb34fe538addc0efee0cac646b54268c3f83f/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-31T18:23:22Z","email":"shapitsahas@gmail.com","name":"Sahas Sakhare"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-31T18:23:22Z","email":"shapitsahas@gmail.com","name":"Sahas Sakhare"},"message":"feat(studio): copilot refine-in-place — edit existing drafts via chat\n\nAdd `updateDraftCapability` to the authoring copilot: getCapability to read a\ndraft, then shallow-merge a bodyPatch (If-Match versioned) so an author iterates\non a draft in the rail (\"add a phone field\", \"make email required\") without\nre-creating it. The rail resolves the capability by id or name+kind, merges,\nupdates, and redirects into the designer; the backend authoring prompt guides the\nread -> update flow.\n\nVerified live with Gemini: create a form [full-name, email] -> \"add a phone field\"\n-> [full-name, email, phone-number] (existing fields preserved). tsc clean; 85\nStudio tests pass (incl. the new updateDraftCapability test).\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"b988a4280c8f6894d05dd8f68835c1d44041ca30","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sahassakhare/agentic-ui/git/trees/b988a4280c8f6894d05dd8f68835c1d44041ca30"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sahassakhare/agentic-ui/git/commits/c15fb34fe538addc0efee0cac646b54268c3f83f","verification":{"payload":"tree b988a4280c8f6894d05dd8f68835c1d44041ca30\nparent 49d047dc66cc664b8eabd46768a2f28fe45f00ab\nauthor Sahas Sakhare <shapitsahas@gmail.com> 1788200602 +0530\ncommitter Sahas Sakhare <shapitsahas@gmail.com> 1788200602 +0530\n\nfeat(studio): copilot refine-in-place — edit existing drafts via chat\n\nAdd `updateDraftCapability` to the authoring copilot: getCapability to read a\ndraft, then shallow-merge a bodyPatch (If-Match versioned) so an author iterates\non a draft in the rail (\"add a phone field\", \"make email required\") without\nre-creating it. The rail resolves the capability by id or name+kind, merges,\nupdates, and redirects into the designer; the backend authoring prompt guides the\nread -> update flow.\n\nVerified live with Gemini: create a form [full-name, email] -> \"add a phone field\"\n-> [full-name, email, phone-number] (existing fields preserved). tsc clean; 85\nStudio tests pass (incl. the new updateDraftCapability test).\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\niQGzBAABCAAdFiEE1eujchKuJhYER67YWqdl9Lsba5AFAmqVxpoACgkQWqdl9Lsb\na5A5PgwAmb3UlXiv+Z/Y8430qFsCN+AmMOkUnN2rllJ2r/kDBHpO6hzP0Zp69cLM\nipgAmJ55tvro7QE7wLX8emA7DaP82fe7vIujy53rM0+8277d0vsTPLQz+Lr7yquW\nzaxYiiyAbUUIF9xDFadeBVhmI6shcno4NA1dAP502cjr9JsnAZXR1KfBLBNdIIll\nqATXXaSg/qWphCp+pBNqA2LF38nlxrwpTzM4dPGV8/CbW/HzHgMy7LKno+tzgw82\nOwif2Qic9bpc7ioK5JlQcDNSVZL3IzYKhuRu6PwDYmVtwis+IuhN0HhSFKLablAf\nIroctKol3vFuAg5qCmkXIZ9KWF6/FM65x4dDvj/ZkPkdUG0iqDuEzGO+XIdK5AxD\nwcLaqPeY8F34uP7haa0H4qB/8fxVYmWf39hp1UHVDCsaFORR9w4vOYSTLX82h7/2\n5oHE1s8IZdL9Miy6hrwgHAWwQA8itdiiNeJO5QS+knm94zYTQRypM/Iz9K2qr0qx\n1vd8