owing{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sahassakhare/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/sahassakhare","id":21344002,"login":"sahassakhare","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIxMzQ0MDAy","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sahassakhare/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sahassakhare/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sahassakhare/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sahassakhare/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sahassakhare/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/sahassakhare","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sahassakhare/agentic-ui/commits/49d047dc66cc664b8eabd46768a2f28fe45f00ab/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-31T18:01:25Z","email":"shapitsahas@gmail.com","name":"Sahas Sakhare"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-31T18:01:25Z","email":"shapitsahas@gmail.com","name":"Sahas Sakhare"},"message":"feat(studio): live Test panel for tools & data sources\n\nAdd a \"Test\" row action to the tool/datasource registries that opens a dialog to\ndry-run the HTTP call — the analogue of the Decision Designer''s evaluator panel.\nIt compiles the authored row with the SAME helpers the runtime uses\n(@infra-tools/agentic-ui/catalog: buildHttpAdapter/resolveHeaders/fillTemplate/\nfillDeep) and invokes it from the browser, so an author can verify an endpoint or\na tool''s {arg} templates + bound data source before publishing. Secrets for\n${NAME} header refs are supplied per-test (never stored); non-HTTP connectors show\na \"not callable\" notice. CORS applies (same constraint as runtime tool execution).\n\nVerified live: echo-crm datasource -> httpbin OK; create-customer tool with\ncustomerId=C-100 -> path/body templates filled, bound data source resolved, live\nresponse. tsc clean; 84 Studio tests pass.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"f5a1ef28e3bfff1d3b8d9120b1c86dec2dcc0286","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sahassakhare/agentic-ui/git/trees/f5a1ef28e3bfff1d3b8d9120b1c86dec2dcc0286"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sahassakhare/agentic-ui/git/commits/49d047dc66cc664b8eabd46768a2f28fe45f00ab","verification":{"payload":"tree f5a1ef28e3bfff1d3b8d9120b1c86dec2dcc0286\nparent 53378e94842f9eceae3ef8f1d7b08e8bb5f97fe6\nauthor Sahas Sakhare <shapitsahas@gmail.com> 1788199285 +0530\ncommitter Sahas Sakhare <shapitsahas@gmail.com> 1788199285 +0530\n\nfeat(studio): live Test panel for tools & data sources\n\nAdd a \"Test\" row action to the tool/datasource registries that opens a dialog to\ndry-run the HTTP call — the analogue of the Decision Designer''s evaluator panel.\nIt compiles the authored row with the SAME helpers the runtime uses\n(@infra-tools/agentic-ui/catalog: buildHttpAdapter/resolveHeaders/fillTemplate/\nfillDeep) and invokes it from the browser, so an author can verify an endpoint or\na tool''s {arg} templates + bound data source before publishing. Secrets for\n${NAME} header refs are supplied per-test (never stored); non-HTTP connectors show\na \"not callable\" notice. CORS applies (same constraint as runtime tool execution).\n\nVerified live: echo-crm datasource -> httpbin OK; create-customer tool with\ncustomerId=C-100 -> path/body templates filled, bound data source resolved, live\nresponse. tsc clean; 84 Studio tests pass.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\niQGzBAABCAAdFiEE1eujchKuJhYER67YWqdl9Lsba5AFAmqVwXYACgkQWqdl9Lsb\na5BprQv8D4hru7BcyJ6IkWt63tS/XLUI+0EL8DHSeNRveuZMIg8/RKuClCrGy7aY\noDtq25VLiuhG30e0Xq75bsA9adpR+hpZ7akJfCWGsr6ecZzE6tP/gA3YAkS9JGfH\nytwK3R7g6QX5xf5WU0bP87XsUx+vxoYbFe3D7DJiZkSaq2bDzVQsY6IzKoJoGUbK\nGvGA5Qx3BQTWdNfRj+wySk/1ekXbpCgQ/uHOaicAbOr+ovr2amsnuMNoFhOiwabe\n+gNkwik7EELupsaYJDZFrksCtSoybjMY/H8iWntYKXIVMzX6FFF+3esHlxW