","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sahassakhare/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sahassakhare/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sahassakhare/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sahassakhare/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/sahassakhare","id":21344002,"login":"sahassakhare","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIxMzQ0MDAy","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sahassakhare/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sahassakhare/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sahassakhare/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sahassakhare/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sahassakhare/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/sahassakhare","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sahassakhare/agentic-ui/commits/53378e94842f9eceae3ef8f1d7b08e8bb5f97fe6/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-31T17:35:58Z","email":"shapitsahas@gmail.com","name":"Sahas Sakhare"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-31T17:35:58Z","email":"shapitsahas@gmail.com","name":"Sahas Sakhare"},"message":"ci: auto-merge PRs when green + auto-publish on merge\n\n- auto-merge.yml: on any non-draft PR, enable GitHub auto-merge (squash) so a PR\n  merges itself once required checks pass — no watching for \"ready to merge\".\n  Auto-approves Dependabot PRs. Uses pull_request_target but never checks out PR\n  code (arms auto-merge only). Requires one-time repo settings: Allow auto-merge\n  + branch protection with required status checks (documented in the header).\n- publish.yml: add a `push: main` trigger so publishing fires on merge; the\n  existing per-package skip-guard keeps it idempotent (only bumped packages ship).\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"bd59dbb80d7dcc75b977f28a14ba4c8ae4f68af8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sahassakhare/agentic-ui/git/trees/bd59dbb80d7dcc75b977f28a14ba4c8ae4f68af8"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sahassakhare/agentic-ui/git/commits/53378e94842f9eceae3ef8f1d7b08e8bb5f97fe6","verification":{"payload":"tree bd59dbb80d7dcc75b977f28a14ba4c8ae4f68af8\nparent 13e18212a1284e776e841c321cfc8d2101f0e679\nauthor Sahas Sakhare <shapitsahas@gmail.com> 1788197758 +0530\ncommitter Sahas Sakhare <shapitsahas@gmail.com> 1788197758 +0530\n\nci: auto-merge PRs when green + auto-publish on merge\n\n- auto-merge.yml: on any non-draft PR, enable GitHub auto-merge (squash) so a PR\n  merges itself once required checks pass — no watching for \"ready to merge\".\n  Auto-approves Dependabot PRs. Uses pull_request_target but never checks out PR\n  code (arms auto-merge only). Requires one-time repo settings: Allow auto-merge\n  + branch protection with required status checks (documented in the header).\n- publish.yml: add a `push: main` trigger so publishing fires on merge; the\n  existing per-package skip-guard keeps it idempotent (only bumped packages ship).\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\niQGzBAABCAAdFiEE1eujchKuJhYER67YWqdl9Lsba5AFAmqVu34ACgkQWqdl9Lsb\na5Bdzgv+Mb+++qRljzPAkhlU/G8MoFGwTaVABECZyAFrfNkaI/AaWJZLwGxtCTD6\nuoPvCVSC15P1eLgOPIZ5eCaydkVof3f00C5hQVYVK3EuM98q149VMB9Lix7e7VKA\nobJkT7MInwSOJVudMeHTq2Zr+QEdQtuXZTZFX8kT8h6IGDabxyOL/wiX8CWab4Ni\nt026jLyTuVjY05ZcCew6IIst6q2zAIl+vDOqlOHRtMEsP3daivaBc8q0LbAbnQ17\nPL3UEa8ds+3R43DJDch+xLXd8NjgBKFuJSqZOExfP2Jfo3ecxImATdbBP/ob1NGD\nPyBMuJdqYnW+V62UE1upvTqX+TqEK5PezDFyJDYrOrTNLLcPhFii86K8lNQ+W+M7\n/nTBj/6hOBE7FLJByTPT3J5+WOHGUJCGSgLGZ/Vh5B92YBde0a900c3wUje4523S\np7uRd56yI6iPH6L9Me63Yil3JG/uLic32ZHw28Y3UsCI5gYl5xWRprwKqU2ofk5L\norrpIcpT\n=0ccD\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-08-31T17:36:12Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubuserconten