d":21344002,"login":"sahassakhare","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIxMzQ0MDAy","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sahassakhare/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sahassakhare/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sahassakhare/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sahassakhare/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sahassakhare/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/sahassakhare","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sahassakhare/agentic-ui/commits/13e18212a1284e776e841c321cfc8d2101f0e679/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-31T17:35:56Z","email":"shapitsahas@gmail.com","name":"Sahas Sakhare"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-31T17:35:56Z","email":"shapitsahas@gmail.com","name":"Sahas Sakhare"},"message":"chore(schematics): split platform + examples scaffolders, auto-publish on merge\n\nSplit the monolithic scaffolder into two published packages:\n- @infra-tools/agentic-platform-schematics — projects/ + platform/ + docs/ (the platform)\n- @infra-tools/agentic-examples-schematics — examples/ (companion, new package)\n\nThe security-aware repo snapshotter is factored into a shared\nscripts/snapshot-repo.mjs (single source of truth for the exclusion list, so a\nsecurity script can never leak into either scaffold). connect-studio''s\nincludeExamples flag is dropped (examples now ship separately).\n\nAuto-publish on merge: schematics-release.yml + examples-schematics-release.yml\npublish each package on every qualifying push to main (npm is the version-of-\nrecord: next = max(floor, npm-latest + patch); no commit-back, no manual bump).\nBoth are removed from the manual-bump guard (check-lib-versions.mjs) since\nthey''re auto-versioned. One-time npm Trusted Publisher config per package/workflow\nis required (documented in each workflow header).\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"dd9005f54af24edc5849a1aa9a6e36a85936afcf","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sahassakhare/agentic-ui/git/trees/dd9005f54af24edc5849a1aa9a6e36a85936afcf"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sahassakhare/agentic-ui/git/commits/13e18212a1284e776e841c321cfc8d2101f0e679","verification":{"payload":"tree dd9005f54af24edc5849a1aa9a6e36a85936afcf\nparent 5865c6f71e06aa112fdb8ae379d90e853690cfb0\nauthor Sahas Sakhare <shapitsahas@gmail.com> 1788197756 +0530\ncommitter Sahas Sakhare <shapitsahas@gmail.com> 1788197756 +0530\n\nchore(schematics): split platform + examples scaffolders, auto-publish on merge\n\nSplit the monolithic scaffolder into two published packages:\n- @infra-tools/agentic-platform-schematics — projects/ + platform/ + docs/ (the platform)\n- @infra-tools/agentic-examples-schematics — examples/ (companion, new package)\n\nThe security-aware repo snapshotter is factored into a shared\nscripts/snapshot-repo.mjs (single source of truth for the exclusion list, so a\nsecurity script can never leak into either scaffold). connect-studio''s\nincludeExamples flag is dropped (examples now ship separately).\n\nAuto-publish on merge: schematics-release.yml + examples-schematics-release.yml\npublish each package on every qualifying push to main (npm is the version-of-\nrecord: next = max(floor, npm-latest + patch); no commit-back, no manual bump).\nBoth are removed from the manual-bump guard (check-lib-versions.mjs) since\nthey''re auto-versioned. One-time npm Trusted Publisher config per package/workflow\nis required (documented in each workflow header).\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\niQGzBAABCAAdFiEE1eujchKuJhYER67YWqdl9Lsba5AFAmqVu3wACgkQWqdl9Lsb\na5Ax4wv/a7u7FZs5JSJ57Zj/aAvK7K21VagNP3fj5/TszBgsBMJeYvOIcmtfndir\nHAeXTQgfO0MVda+mxHMeyGGvhtSi+nYD26dN0uO92mpfy2PI1WYy8wrmqDgP7hCJ\nAg2BJ7cGhBv9VS4JUoiUcsgudOr4I1hfwgRYAFw/Zav6OOstsV+Oqu0OeJs