-ui/commits/13e18212a1284e776e841c321cfc8d2101f0e679"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/21344002?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sahassakhare/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sahassakhare/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sahassakhare/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sahassakhare/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/sahassakhare","id":21344002,"login":"sahassakhare","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIxMzQ0MDAy","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sahassakhare/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sahassakhare/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sahassakhare/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sahassakhare/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sahassakhare/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/sahassakhare","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sahassakhare/agentic-ui/commits/5865c6f71e06aa112fdb8ae379d90e853690cfb0/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-31T17:32:13Z","email":"shapitsahas@gmail.com","name":"Sahas Sakhare"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-31T17:32:13Z","email":"shapitsahas@gmail.com","name":"Sahas Sakhare"},"message":"feat(studio): in-Studio authoring copilot + enable/disable control\n\nEmbed the platform''s own agentic UI in Experience Studio to help authors design\ngoverned capabilities. A side rail (<mvk-chat-shell>) with client-side authoring\ntools drafts capabilities via the catalog as ai-assisted DRAFTS the author\nrefines in the existing designers; creation redirects straight into the matching\ndesigner. Gated by the existing aiAssistedAuthoring flag; a top-bar \"AI\nassistant\" toggle is the per-author opt-out (work without it).\n\n- copilot/authoring-tools.ts — createDraftCapability / listCapabilities /\n  getCapability (agenticTool; run host-side, no inject()).\n- copilot/authoring-bridge.ts — module singleton bridging tools → services\n  (mirrors the Hub''s shell-api pattern).\n- copilot/copilot-rail.component.ts — the rail; wires the bridge to\n  CapabilityCatalogService (authoredBy:''ai-assisted''), redirects to the designer\n  on create, showToolCalls=compact.\n- app.config.ts — provideAgenticUiPlatform + provideAgUiBackend(agentUrl).\n- app.component.ts — top-bar mat-slide-toggle (setAuthorOptOut) + the rail (auth-gated).\n- environment{,.prod}.ts — agentUrl + aiAssistedAuthoring default on.\n- demo-server — an ''authoring'' specialist at /agents/authoring/run.\n\nVerified: tsc clean; 84 Studio unit tests pass (incl. authoring-tools.spec);\nlive E2E with Gemini — \"draft a contact form\" -> tool call -> ai-assisted draft\ncreated -> redirect into the form designer, zero errors.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"b60d5221cd5dcf1c3a3598d3fe843ac0ca844169","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sahassakhare/agentic-ui/git/trees/b60d5221cd5dcf1c3a3598d3fe843ac0ca844169"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sahassakhare/agentic-ui/git/commits/5865c6f71e06aa112fdb8ae379d90e853690cfb0","verification":{"payload":"tree b60d5221cd5dcf1c3a3598d3fe843ac0ca844169\nparent 0bcb0c92bbae6cf5b4e7b8d13dd32a0e58e5838f\nauthor Sahas Sakhare <shapitsahas@gmail.com> 1788197533 +0530\ncommitter Sahas Sakhare <shapitsahas@gmail.com> 1788197533 +0530\n\nfeat(studio): in-Studio authoring copilot + enable/disable control\n\nEmbed the platform''s own agentic UI in Experience Studio to help authors design\ngoverned capabilities. A side rail (<mvk-chat-shell>) with client-side authoring\ntools drafts capabilities via the catalog as ai-assisted DRAFTS the author\nrefines in the existing designers; creation redirects straight into the matching\ndesigner. Gated by the existing aiAssistedAuthoring flag; a top-bar \"AI\nassistant\" toggle is the per-author opt-out (work without it).\n\n- copilot/authoring-tools.ts — createDraftCapability / listCapabilities /\n  getCapability (agenticTool; run host-side, no inject()).\n- copilot/authoring-bridge.ts — module singleton bridging tools → services\n  (mirrors the Hub''s shell-api pattern).\n- copilot/copilot-rail.component.ts — the rail; wires the bridge to\n  CapabilityCatalogService (authoredBy:''ai-assisted''), redirects to the designer\n  on create, showToolCalls=compact.\n- app.config.ts — provideAgenticUiPlatform + provideAgUiBackend(agentUrl).\n- app.component.ts — top-bar mat-slide-toggle (setAuthorOptOut) + the rail (auth-gated).\n- environment{,.prod}.ts — agentUrl + aiAssistedAuthoring default on.\n- demo-server — an ''authoring'' specialist at /agents/authoring/run.\n\nVerified: tsc clean; 84 Studio unit tests pass (incl. authoring-tools.spec);\nlive E2E with Gemini — \"draft a contact form\" -> tool call -> ai-assisted draft\ncreated -> redirect into the form designer, zero errors.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\niQGzBAABCAAdFiEE1eujchKuJhYER67YWqdl9Lsba5AFAmqVup4ACgkQWqdl9Lsb\na5B41QwAn3k3Qs6H92XgA7QdS5TLC4fkWXHgME2arpJfM2HS8noDkBLaBTXky2mg\n8xdqkg+1eZHuRWsxEDaW0T9tN6jzsSSbDeH3nQgHBGvVn3u3+0CRKePO8Q+/x0iq\naRahWw0TXEMvCoJhp8/yoBVeunem8RSbeW7eBl4PhFDDI2VtK6JJGyHMfMWBH7r6\n6ug4PZSt3Eqg5FsOXWiLrunxG3HnEUZR1dqkcXIRoG6Z5h/kutaU2jo30JO5IcO+\nlK11z/Y1IFqM02Sk3zsEUVL4LxHNXJwQvEkLDloeoyZN4Xac7Gp3MKzl4lMQk1/G\nfIyT8HuZRYeQf+0aRaabL41epgmF7WoUgcJIpmjO7CixySSA6tWqac1U3yKp6so8\nMJVHN+jPf6o7TcYTJ+qZYSxhYG4KYF8qs/bXZgJT8US4sQndRv5+TO76vU6hvB2N\ncbqnVqOKV5Ut3/aIwVMOQIkgJ1PqG1hXKrQROu8IrT/s9oiE0fptPOALDrE1wyNX\niyfF9e8x\n=P2uq\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-08-31T17:36:12Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/21344002?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sahassakhare/events{/privacy}","followe