hub.com/users/sahassakhare/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sahassakhare/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sahassakhare/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sahassakhare/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sahassakhare/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/sahassakhare","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sahassakhare/agentic-ui/commits/0bcb0c92bbae6cf5b4e7b8d13dd32a0e58e5838f/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-29T18:03:41Z","email":"shapitsahas@gmail.com","name":"Sahas Sakhare"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-29T18:03:41Z","email":"shapitsahas@gmail.com","name":"Sahas Sakhare"},"message":"feat(agentic-ui): Studio catalog consumption in the library + Hub dogfood (1.7.0)\n\nPromote the Hub''s proven catalog \"load half\" into the library as a\ntree-shakeable secondary entry `@infra-tools/agentic-ui/catalog` (ADR-0052 —\nkept off the primary FESM). One call wires it:\n\n  provideCatalogRuntime({ baseUrl, tenant }, { mode: ''registries'' | ''shell'' })\n\n- registries mode: compile all 13 governed kinds into the lib registries,\n  live over ONE shared SSE connection (fixes the 6-connection cap bug).\n- shell mode: also render the full catalog-driven app (routes + page/surface/\n  experience hosts + master-page shell + theme + MFE).\n- Decoupled via CATALOG_CONFIG + the CATALOG_AUTH seam. Fixed two gaps:\n  named validators now enforce, and applicationName is honored.\n\nconnect-studio is now a thin schematic (--mode/--shell); its app-local\ntemplates are removed.\n\nHub dogfood: the Experience Hub consumes the catalog entirely via\nprovideCatalogRuntime(shell) + a CATALOG_AUTH adapter; its ~24 app-local\ncatalog/render/shell files are deleted. Native-Federation hosts add the\nsubpath to `shared` (non-singleton). Verified: primary FESM unchanged\n(887 KB), catalog entry ~118 KB (CI guard 160 KB), 13+18 tests green, Hub\nrenders the shell from the library with zero errors.\n\nBumps @infra-tools/agentic-ui 1.6.0 -> 1.7.0.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"8aa8ed68bdd78a6ac34f58c29c8c7955c5809e48","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sahassakhare/agentic-ui/git/trees/8aa8ed68bdd78a6ac34f58c29c8c7955c5809e48"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sahassakhare/agentic-ui/git/commits/0bcb0c92bbae6cf5b4e7b8d13dd32a0e58e5838f","verification":{"payload":"tree 8aa8ed68bdd78a6ac34f58c29c8c7955c5809e48\nparent f2f23db6888360cdfcef375350e260169fcf5ff8\nauthor Sahas Sakhare <shapitsahas@gmail.com> 1788026621 +0530\ncommitter Sahas Sakhare <shapitsahas@gmail.com> 1788026621 +0530\n\nfeat(agentic-ui): Studio catalog consumption in the library + Hub dogfood (1.7.0)\n\nPromote the Hub''s proven catalog \"load half\" into the library as a\ntree-shakeable secondary entry `@infra-tools/agentic-ui/catalog` (ADR-0052 —\nkept off the primary FESM). One call wires it:\n\n  provideCatalogRuntime({ baseUrl, tenant }, { mode: ''registries'' | ''shell'' })\n\n- registries mode: compile all 13 governed kinds into the lib registries,\n  live over ONE shared SSE connection (fixes the 6-connection cap bug).\n- shell mode: also render the full catalog-driven app (routes + page/surface/\n  experience hosts + master-page shell + theme + MFE).\n- Decoupled via CATALOG_CONFIG + the CATALOG_AUTH seam. Fixed two gaps:\n  named validators now enforce, and applicationName is honored.\n\nconnect-studio is now a thin schematic (--mode/--shell); its app-local\ntemplates are removed.\n\nHub dogfood: the Experience Hub consumes the catalog entirely via\nprovideCatalogRuntime(shell) + a CATALOG_AUTH adapter; its ~24 app-local\ncatalog/render/shell files are deleted. Native-Federation hosts add the\nsubpath to `shared` (non-singleton). Verified: primary FESM unchanged\n(887 KB), catalog entry ~118 KB (CI guard 160 KB), 13+18 tests green, Hub\nrenders the shell from the library with zero errors.\n\nBumps @infra-tools/agentic-ui 1.6.0 -> 1.7.0.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\niQGzBAABCAAdFiEE1eujchKuJhYER67YWqdl9Lsba5AFAmqTHv4ACgkQWqdl9Lsb\na5DgoAwA3AhRimHAkhT1fb77x0x3dkWJzkT7wxjRy1/WeT5OTxx4fuyL6AmUD0oM\nHfOAX8tO+fz5l1OQSnCzls7siY3EwcQCs9jKrJ3faZBkygbIjotq2KBW1IEBKAA9\n4xUkfyCJ5C/XZazQvIXxLjrX+PlluNTf1ktUAXyx+ElrKxyUoDo6Vf0Jed+2fMyU\n6bcxf5eC2dqCJ8o4uvLKqs/2Dm9nAkUdjJjuvmfO/o7H1DWQbpqRIR4IB29E2NZW\nVtcqsJR+5Wg9iAMGRIJtSDwsPoPKqXXGbEdZ6uxG4nQIWHIWzqHv0z3vB0iU4Pzr\nMJEoO9ZNGl4SZtUDVKcaRMqhz7mx8D97HT9bE3GJLOUo1Gtk/tFAJBJ8Bw0m5rxi\n2nbNMkkPswVza+HU+jbXnWKgXmIq3c+QumUHT3O2BvJXVXF3W/4HICLRuqe/uLGd\n/R7hJ/vKknxYvbMeaITo0q0fWAYpiaH6eOSF0nhre7x7ZLBwRma2zic0rg16SIFV\nO98Bq2Z9\n=V8Bf\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-08-29T18:04:33Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/21344002?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sahassakhare/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sahassakhare/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sahassakhare/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sahassakhare/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/sahassakhare","id":21344002,"login":"sahassakhare","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIxMzQ0MDAy","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sahassakhare/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sahassakhare/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sahassakhare/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sahassakhare/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sahassakhare/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/sahassakhare","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/sahassakhare/agentic-ui/commit/0bcb0c92bbae