ard-grid pages) — pick\none and the Studio clones its body into a new draft capability (tagged ''starter'')\nand drops you into the matching designer to refine. Starters are scoped to\nself-contained kinds (forms, pages) so a clone is always valid with no unmet\ndeps. Reachable from the top-nav and the ⌘K palette. 2 unit tests (grouping +\nclone-and-navigate); full suite 64/64.\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"844c112a9bdd06df53783c38e605eb150e0c1e1f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sahassakhare/agentic-ui/git/trees/844c112a9bdd06df53783c38e605eb150e0c1e1f"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sahassakhare/agentic-ui/git/commits/c5293b428c77c3a43c92d35def76ac0a63cf7227","verification":{"payload":"tree 844c112a9bdd06df53783c38e605eb150e0c1e1f\nparent 4d20054823bb5fc607a86bd801660480ae700b76\nauthor sahassakhare <shapitsahas@gmail.com> 1787476268 +0530\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1787476268 +0530\n\nfeat(studio): templates & starter gallery (Phase 1) (#65)\n\nSolves the blank-canvas problem. A /templates gallery offers governed starters\n(contact/feedback/signup forms; two-column/sidebar/dashboard-grid pages) — pick\none and the Studio clones its body into a new draft capability (tagged ''starter'')\nand drops you into the matching designer to refine. Starters are scoped to\nself-contained kinds (forms, pages) so a clone is always valid with no unmet\ndeps. Reachable from the top-nav and the ⌘K palette. 2 unit tests (grouping +\nclone-and-navigate); full suite 64/64.\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqirksCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAUo8QAHCmtlXyGfEhR/LlOG0diWsW\n7HkmIXAX0p1UwqTjCaCK14gA2v/dBfp3wEDz9fkjZRTFVwftrs5NjRR7RS/Na5NA\nFsNlBN6pgQefFQ7J+nOzIpc6N1CpXXNkElLQbvvE7jpwJugMtg9MovXZb59Fg6Dn\n9bMyQQJTz9DQ5MgXNxNsL/5rDBAJWbCTMPC8oLk0Bhn3BKzpjZGWBvq5jHvYlnpz\nH9ZDjCbH2eKmhdNE3QYpjY/UH77r1J9i7GUxfkTZ20oupw0XmcgbN+I4INumPFZN\n