rl":"https://api.github.com/repos/sahassakhare/agentic-ui/commits/2f9948d250fb7b77a321a5be4a2f551748ae19cd"}],"sha":"dd897f13a4666d5e96396b57391cc3e6767b5df1","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sahassakhare/agentic-ui/commits/dd897f13a4666d5e96396b57391cc3e6767b5df1"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/21344002?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sahassakhare/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sahassakhare/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sahassakhare/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sahassakhare/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/sahassakhare","id":21344002,"login":"sahassakhare","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIxMzQ0MDAy","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sahassakhare/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sahassakhare/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sahassakhare/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sahassakhare/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sahassakhare/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/sahassakhare","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sahassakhare/agentic-ui/commits/2f9948d250fb7b77a321a5be4a2f551748ae19cd/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-22T12:04:32Z","email":"shapitsahas@gmail.com","name":"sahassakhare"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-22T12:04:32Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"ci(publish): drop setup-node registry-url so OIDC actually triggers (#56)\n\nThe prior OIDC switch still 404''d with no OIDC attempt in the logs: setup-node''s\nregistry-url writes an empty _authToken into .npmrc, which npm reads as\n''auth configured'' and so SKIPS the trusted-publishing OIDC exchange, sending an\nunauthenticated PUT (E404). npm''s trusted-publishing docs require removing all\nnpm auth config. Drop registry-url (default registry is npmjs.org anyway) so npm\nperforms the OIDC token exchange against the configured trusted publisher.\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"87751bd3ab76fb2911af9d7c5df7d821e11e4a25","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sahassakhare/agentic-ui/git/trees/87751bd3ab76fb2911af9d7c5df7d821e11e4a25"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sahassakhare/agentic-ui/git/commits/2f9948d250fb7b77a321a5be4a2f551748ae19cd","verification":{"payload":"tree 87751bd3ab76fb2911af9d7c5df7d821e11e4a25\nparent 9e78a3af1f5697454451409598db716681aee8b3\nauthor sahassakhare <shapitsahas@gmail.com> 1787400272 +0530\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1787400272 +0530\n\nci(publish): drop setup-node registry-url so OIDC actually triggers (#56)\n\nThe prior OIDC switch still 404''d with no OIDC attempt in the logs: setup-node''s\nregistry-url writes an empty _authToken into .npmrc, which npm reads as\n''auth configured'' and so SKIPS the trusted-publishing OIDC exchange, sending an\nunauthenticated PUT (E404). npm''s trusted-publishing docs require removing all\nnpm auth config. Drop registry-url (default registry is npmjs.org anyway) so npm\nperforms the OIDC token exchange against the configured trusted publisher.\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqiZBQCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAARNwQAANlHfTzP1V+9Nune7h0t8nc\nFPTHU7uIxAx9QKx/9uk54mBS8Hcvm/o0rn89Q5s/CZ/vb2eZmhckoCk04KUkamXN\ne3lG9ONjH3kMD1nkUDim+PLAMvBxKUMVhzquvY9jfp+GsExfEpb1j7SNkBmGUEDt\nKFQRFc1AijiYRWhBbEz1BBfqzzMrEFP32UQJnUJPcxrc18FSysnab2VxJf5jxZNI\nLGlaGLm1vO9SncAZ7doV+QvOwSpKXJXsH9OgMcdWwD3m8QQWGi2+5hzmVSO9sIV5\nLy2XngLe3QFZbFR38k/ZjVbi6lteiTRKv0mEy8iKZDNKD5sGOB607++P8NxWk8zA\nLSHidOkQuPsLhBkq7xIyiy8PCWTWxspvdW6ggoqVKjXqm4hNqrku3SAOWQsBA/Rg\n85BEFMFDSu5bPLRAU7XGnMX4vbvnNJPMZuaG414KwwcbYWMsZ8AzHpslI6ekmnOd\nvgn722Im3iuDBEwKDW9lnTncdgB5vlbDF8WPvmt