ply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"feat(studio): live wireframe preview in the Page Designer + responsive grid (#51)\n\nThe Page Designer had no preview (unlike the Form Designer). Add a third\n\"Preview\" column: a structural wireframe that arranges the page''s regions per the\nchosen layout (single / two-column / sidebar-* / stacked / grid, and the shell\nchrome for master pages) and shows each placed surface as a kind-coloured tile\n(shared kind taxonomy), so an author sees the composition + which kind sits where\nwithout needing the Hub''s renderers.\n\nAlso makes the designer grid responsive: 3 columns → palette+canvas (preview\nwraps full-width) under 1180px → single column under 820px, with the palette and\npreview un-sticky when stacked.","tree":{"sha":"a94f3cfb9014d3640e52be3751118bfd59876c8c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sahassakhare/agentic-ui/git/trees/a94f3cfb9014d3640e52be3751118bfd59876c8c"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sahassakhare/agentic-ui/git/commits/58eb03ca703fc4e2f2ee866b200284eead501419","verification":{"payload":"tree a94f3cfb9014d3640e52be3751118bfd59876c8c\nparent 4c3ad851d836dfda19ee04736ea0e7af6a09c8fb\nauthor sahassakhare <shapitsahas@gmail.com> 1787203562 +0530\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1787203562 +0530\n\nfeat(studio): live wireframe preview in the Page Designer + responsive grid (#51)\n\nThe Page Designer had no preview (unlike the Form Designer). Add a third\n\"Preview\" column: a structural wireframe that arranges the page''s regions per the\nchosen layout (single / two-column / sidebar-* / stacked / grid, and the shell\nchrome for master pages) and shows each placed surface as a kind-coloured tile\n(shared kind taxonomy), so an author sees the composition + which kind sits where\nwithout needing the Hub''s renderers.\n\nAlso makes the designer grid responsive: 3 columns → palette+canvas (preview\nwraps full-width) under 1180px → single column under 820px, with the palette and\npreview un-sticky 