mmits/04dd2bbaf3402b91a76c86b66e664361a7738a02"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/21344002?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sahassakhare/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sahassakhare/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sahassakhare/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sahassakhare/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/sahassakhare","id":21344002,"login":"sahassakhare","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIxMzQ0MDAy","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sahassakhare/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sahassakhare/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sahassakhare/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sahassakhare/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sahassakhare/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/sahassakhare","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sahassakhare/agentic-ui/commits/100d90580936a4b66a894df331b336cd3b1cfff2/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-18T18:24:05Z","email":"shapitsahas@gmail.com","name":"sahassakhare"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-18T18:24:05Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"feat(mfe): type-aware remote loader — Native Federation + Module Federation 1.0/2.0 (#47)\n\nOne registry can now mix remotes built with different federation runtimes.\n\nLibrary:\n- RemoteSpec gains an optional `type`: ''native-federation'' (default) |\n  ''module-federation'' (MF 2.0) | ''module-federation-1'' (webpack MF 1.0).\n  Optional + non-strict schema → all existing registry JSON still validates.\n- createRemoteLoader(remote, opts?) dispatches on type and returns the loader\n  loadRemoteCapabilities expects. Native Federation is handled directly (lazy\n  import of the runtime); Module Federation remotes use a host-provided loader,\n  so the library keeps its narrow dep graph (@module-federation/runtime stays an\n  optional peer). moduleFederationLoader(loadRemote) adapts the MF runtime\n  (which consumes both MF 2.0 and MF 1.0) into that loader.\n\nCritical fix folded in: the native loader now loads by the remote''s `remoteEntry`\nURL, so a remote discovered at runtime — e.g. one ingested after boot, not in the\nstatic federation.manifest.json — is fetched + registered on demand. Previously\nthe Hub called loadRemoteModule({remoteName}) only, so ingested remotes (PrimeNG)\nnever resolved.\n\nHub: boot loop uses createRemoteLoader(remote) — native works out of the box;\nModule Federation is enabled by installing @module-federation/runtime and passing\nmoduleFederation: moduleFederationLoader(loadRemote).\n\nIngest service: tags produced remotes type:''native-federation'' (+ carries it in\nregistry.json). FESM 858 KiB (under the 864 cap).\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"d69b15b98c6e6e946079fb5f85ffa9c35971f381","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sahassakhare/agentic-ui/git/trees/d69b15b98c6e6e946079fb5f85ffa9c35971f381"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sahassakhare/agentic-ui/git/commits/100d90580936a4b66a894df331b336cd3b1cfff2","verification":{"payload":"tree d69b15b98c6e6e946079fb5f85ffa9c35971f381\nparent 9085b843b66198a30d5f7cf0d8167254d77bccf5\nauthor sahassakhare <shapitsahas@gmail.com> 1787077445 +0530\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1787077445 +0530\n\nfeat(mfe): type-aware remote loader — Native Federation + Module Federation 1.0/2.0 (#47)\n\nOne registry can now mix remotes built with different federation runtimes.\n\nLibrary:\n- RemoteSpec gains an optional `type`: ''native-federation'' (default) |\n  ''module-federation'' (MF 2.0) | ''module-federation-1'' (webpack MF 1.0).\n  Optional + non-strict schema → all existing registry JSON still validates.\n- createRemoteLoader(remote, opts?) dispatches on type and returns the loader\n  loadRemoteCapabilities expects. Native Federation is handled directly (lazy\n  import of the runtime); Module Federation remotes use a host-provided loader,\n  so the library keeps its narrow dep graph (@module-federation/runtime stays an\n  optional peer). moduleFederationLoader(loadRemote) adapts the MF runtime\n  (which consumes both MF 2.0 and MF 1.0) into that loader.\n\nCritical fix folded in: the native loader now loads by the remote''s `remoteEntry`\nURL, so a remote discovered at runtime — e.g. one ingested after boot, not in the\nstatic federation.manifest.json — is fetched + registered on demand. Previously\nthe Hub called loadRemoteModule({remoteName}) only, so ingested remotes (PrimeNG)\nnever resolved.\n\nHub: boot loop uses createRemoteLoader(remote) — native works out of the box;\nModule Federation is enabled by installing @module-federation/runtime and passing\nmoduleFederation: moduleFederationLoader(loadRemote).\n\nIngest service: tags produced remotes type:''native-federation'' (+ carries it in\nregistry.json). FESM 858 KiB (under the 864 cap).\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqhKNFCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAz4wQAB42EcOKQaM6wFmVyL+3vpL0\n9ZNcAaF8Wjobt3qNhOQyL6RBKNtUaO2rpE4SUQvPzkDY64SEZIziMk1C7bmhE+Iv\nV/neoOyDBOHm05EdFKs69UltDnE+vBw80ZWKStDKFuev1ObVdqAn9xf/1Fim3R0w\n13rthbdQAQuMmlHPCXqV1wkYCCKEZDJERfjrtpF08OQlY/csRvKM8VeBR8pJrIyP\nCvVlJiBgnqodZyhYszxtJmW1v3FsIqfd/Im/asCz6c5r4tPCCGEri49kAkSfxBuP\ni1uTlhW+Y3tRBnGAdHaLR2VBTlQf3EPjKa7c3LuyAmBm+wpwmtWizNaHq6iDG5RA\naGxreJ5ATr1Pih/hnKLazZNaCuWPzKbZAxLdvfd5/pO9QTA/JeeYT66O+grp3X/X\nDClIobXKlLd5Lxz6ZttNrTcmZivvnj/ArspevQA9Bh9r+XP/vvTS1F/gmt4whY4l\nSEtuokfI/Ip7ZAQNukmktqxhOLYA0UxINUI7mWsPSb+q8B3R940oKPIPMnm7l7WT\n2T4gMUmMNE6H3FvJE8ykUWwrBBcIPHQ8L9rMYgq6A1DjLHdtOCMxmSGy2lU248p5\n14zwBYWP5XrfkiF834hWzuyTIeKG7F2VPIVvOz98QMrmOJvX7/L1PFZx12Gv6dj6\niGRjTg9q12y61ELMT1l0\n=ihR