thor":{"date":"2026-08-18T18:07:08Z","email":"shapitsahas@gmail.com","name":"sahassakhare"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-18T18:07:08Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"fix(hub): load federated remotes from the ingest service registry (dev) (#45)\n\nThe Hub''s dev mfeRegistryUrl pointed at the bundled mfes.json (only the\nmatter-management demo remote), so components ingested at runtime (e.g. an\nuploaded PrimeNG) never loaded — nothing rendered them in the consumer app.\n\nPoint the dev Hub at the component-ingest service''s /registry.json, so every\ningested (and seeded) remote loads with no host rebuild. Fall back to mfes.json\nif not running the ingest service (documented inline). Prod is unchanged.\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"3a806fdf25186d3d7ac626943224b74ca2707688","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sahassakhare/agentic-ui/git/trees/3a806fdf25186d3d7ac626943224b74ca2707688"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sahassakhare/agentic-ui/git/commits/66a5cb3ba5acc401cae361c3c19e2e6050eb0a0a","verification":{"payload":"tree 3a806fdf25186d3d7ac626943224b74ca2707688\nparent bffde871078feca6cfa6f2b8eee5d5a0570de2d9\nauthor sahassakhare <shapitsahas@gmail.com> 1787076428 +0530\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1787076428 +0530\n\nfix(hub): load federated remotes from the ingest service registry (dev) (#45)\n\nThe Hub''s dev mfeRegistryUrl pointed at the bundled mfes.json (only the\nmatter-management demo remote), so components ingested at runtime (e.g. an\nuploaded PrimeNG) never loaded — nothing rendered them in the consumer app.\n\nPoint the dev Hub at the component-ingest service''s /registry.json, so every\ningested (and seeded) remote loads with no host rebuild. Fall back to mfes.json\nif not running the ingest service (documented inline). Prod is unchanged.\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-