n\nand out of view. The palette had no height bound (unlike the Form Designer,\nwhich already scrolls its palette).\n\nWrap the palette items in a scrollable container (`max-height:46vh; overflow-y`),\nmake the left column sticky, and add `align-items:start` so the columns size\nindependently. The center design panel now stays in view while a long palette\nscrolls on its own.","tree":{"sha":"a8bba4c7d8f62b0e5402a63caed487c713336e0f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sahassakhare/agentic-ui/git/trees/a8bba4c7d8f62b0e5402a63caed487c713336e0f"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sahassakhare/agentic-ui/git/commits/bffde871078feca6cfa6f2b8eee5d5a0570de2d9","verification":{"payload":"tree a8bba4c7d8f62b0e5402a63caed487c713336e0f\nparent 0654a4c0926f07696a4fc0043b79d6c24464c822\nauthor sahassakhare <shapitsahas@gmail.com> 1787075623 +0530\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1787075623 +0530\n\nfix(studio): bound the Page Designer component palette with its own scrollbar (#44)\n\nAs the component/surface list grew, the Page Designer''s left palette card\nexpanded to full height, pushing the center canvas (regions/composition) down\nand out of view. The palette had no height bound (unlike the Form Designer,\nwhich already scrolls its palette).\n\nWrap the palette items in a scrollable container (`max-height:46vh; overflow-y`),\nmake the left column sticky, and add `align-items:start` so the columns size\nindependently. The center design panel now stays in view while a long palette\nscrolls on its own.","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqhJwnCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAAcgQAIgnRum36a5dAKia/I/fTqLO\nkY5BUbG+XGrCTUjdlPe8MofcHuHo6y33TSNJxOfZY6MiiU+MPMqO0LiZIwmpqqcM\ntNuosTA58sBn9IRFQlV6rzM2oJs//eJvBxmz5EWwcQnek+qlbXMaipwcFXKk5VXt\nhqmBxiNAA2Xo18Mr/hypiuwzUkFcvEOU2k5EylGqkly8gM0DIGEavaLgRpKq0RSZ\nGrN9i0uOQR2LnTCZcGNkD9bnNPm/13OLDLJtnkCSmBBSnJovrk5nTXY+YFv9YcdG\ndbPUmFqQtZ0+b2nwRTeQKtAww6wNLnNtnP9xXTUfRQnjoWlx6FIXQ6FiOAAp2EV8\ny7PH9baZgaou/2H