"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/21344002?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sahassakhare/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sahassakhare/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sahassakhare/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sahassakhare/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/sahassakhare","id":21344002,"login":"sahassakhare","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIxMzQ0MDAy","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sahassakhare/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sahassakhare/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sahassakhare/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sahassakhare/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sahassakhare/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/sahassakhare","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sahassakhare/agentic-ui/commits/0654a4c0926f07696a4fc0043b79d6c24464c822/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-18T17:36:14Z","email":"shapitsahas@gmail.com","name":"sahassakhare"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-18T17:36:14Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"feat(studio): MFEs registry page — view + manage federated remotes (#43)\n\nThe Studio had no view of the federated remotes the Hub loads — you could upload\na library but not see or manage the resulting remotes. Adds an \"MFEs\" page with\nmanagement actions, backed by new ingest-service admin endpoints.\n\nIngest service:\n- RegistryStore now tracks admin metadata per remote (ingest `source`,\n  `ingestedAt`, a `disabled` flag) and gains remove()/setDisabled()/get()/\n  adminList(). Public GET /registry.json is unchanged for the Hub: it omits\n  disabled remotes and projects to canonical RemoteSpec fields only.\n- Endpoints: GET /admin/remotes (full records), PATCH /admin/remotes/:name\n  {disabled}, DELETE /admin/remotes/:name (registry entry + served artifacts +\n  best-effort catalog kind:''component'' cleanup via unregisterComponents),\n  POST /admin/remotes/:name/reingest (rebuild from the stored npm/url source).\n- Pipeline records the ingest source + timestamp on upsert.\n\nStudio:\n- MfeRegistryComponent (/mfes, nav \"MFEs\"): lists remotes from\n  /admin/remotes with status, source, remoteEntry, and the components each\n  exposes (cross-referenced from catalog kind:''component'' by remoteName).\n  Actions: Enable/Disable, Remove (confirm), Re-ingest, Refresh + Upload link.\n\nVerified: disable → /registry.json drops the remote, enable → returns; service\ntypechecks + specs pass; Studio builds.\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"a27d4496bc53c07bcdffa5c93fea5e40fcafde32","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sahassakhare/agentic-ui/git/trees/a27d4496bc53c07bcdffa5c93fea5e40fcafde32"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sahassakhare/agentic-ui/git/commits/0654a4c0926f07696a4fc0043b79d6c24464c822","verification":{"payload":"tree a27d4496bc53c07bcdffa5c93fea5e40fcafde32\nparent fe6fdc53848658224552a6fd8a26a9b257d330d8\nauthor sahassakhare <shapitsahas@gmail.com> 1787074574 +0530\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1787074574 +0530\n\nfeat(studio): MFEs registry page — view + manage federated remotes (#43)\n\nThe Studio had no view of the federated remotes the Hub loads — you could upload\na library but not see or manage the resulting remotes. Adds an \"MFEs\" page with\nmanagement actions, backed by new ingest-service admin endpoints.\n\nIngest service:\n- RegistryStore now tracks admin metadata per remote (ingest `source`,\n  `ingestedAt`, a `disabled` flag) and gains remove()/setDisabled()/get()/\n  adminList(). Public GET /registry.json is unchanged for the Hub: it omits\n  disabled remotes and projects to canonical RemoteSpec fields only.\n- Endpoints: GET /admin/remotes (full records), PATCH /admin/remotes/:name\n  {disabled}, DELETE /admin/remotes/:name (registry entry + served artifacts +\n  best-effort catalog kind:''component'' cleanup via unregisterComponents),\n  POST /admin/remotes/:name/reingest (rebuild from the stored npm/url source).\n- Pipeline records the ingest source + timestamp on upsert.\n\nStudio:\n- MfeRegistryComponent (/mfes, nav \"MFEs\"): lists remotes from\n  /admin/remotes with status, source, remoteEntry, and the components each\n  exposes (cross-referenced from catalog kind:''component'' by remoteName).\n  Actions: Enable/Disable, Remove (confirm), Re-ingest, Refresh + Upload link.\n\nVerified: disable → /registry.json drops the remote, enable → returns; service\ntypechecks + specs pass; Studio builds.\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqhJgOCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAA3fAQAH5erNm5MV8mZnqs+nJt4W+F\nLzDE5iUWb3sYoDzxTANgAKMFTkyxmrpVRj4Pj5lA+PanMr1Je/NSgx/vtzVkIjXU\nhIgKQlo9GIE1p7A2Jn/WbZuaQvZdC16gU6QFjDAN7jKXr73bbDqyxuVeEsIzr6Fj\nN599I9FddFUu6LTjTe91B2Xfr+yBJsAIuLOgyAcmVDonOX7vnJ1/IzLRJOpL3GUn\nz93Qny2WJuxyb6uRWLDp4PhJzC9alKFupXuvcI+eJ31jmtJQyYyE3cgXkG+Ccz6d\nfTtbzkYdFmdGVL4hFuH5XQe/YvqoBXIhD6Im6N0PFAAKL2k5Cm2D+JwozS4UTMWk\nwp2CSVg8D8sso2IZK84N/UMuuM8wOjQWezeN/7L9ChMbc1WwThrnM+37qcL2a3T8\ngC2sXIIgXn0TlCPTnsnlJwu2aCwrbnfMNqZv6vRphG/Ogqd/a7+AnMJSDynXVaTl\nGsS5U73Xnz1w23WUhn9kWL7HRvozpllr96fHSYB6PJMJvHSmLTnPtFGkrzVgO2My\nWvTHnQc2zj9oQW5EGgzbufD2PHm6XvHYKj+1KwIIbAP6qwBDVYOljJBxobq0t8uZ\n+LVH2GoPc2vAWPQi7q8K13CT8u6KuXeZs5AgdzuFxSbGOB2tHHYqUSHteCIaiq8K\nxPJ1ciUqZs7NpE55UNMI\n=4ge6\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-08-18T17:36:15Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.githu