api.github.com/users/sahassakhare/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sahassakhare/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sahassakhare/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/sahassakhare","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sahassakhare/agentic-ui/commits/fe6fdc53848658224552a6fd8a26a9b257d330d8/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-18T17:16:27Z","email":"shapitsahas@gmail.com","name":"sahassakhare"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-18T17:16:27Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"feat(studio): author a decision-driven workflow branch in the Workflow Designer (#42)\n\nCompletes workflow branch-on-decision (runtime shipped in the lib + Hub). A\nbranching step now chooses \"branch on: state fields | a decision\". In decision\nmode the author picks a governed kind:''decision'', an optional output, and maps\noutput values → target steps (+ else default) — serialized as the lib''s\nDecisionNext.\n\n- Step model gains mode/decisionRef/output/cases; resolved() emits DecisionNext\n  when in decision mode; fromRaw() round-trips it (so opening + saving a\n  workflow no longer clobbers a DecisionNext step).\n- journey-flow StepNext + the live preview render a decision branch\n  (decision.output = value → step).\n- workflow-validate targetsOf() reads a DecisionNext''s cases + default, so\n  dead-target / reachability checks cover decision branches too.\n\nStudio builds; workflow-validate specs pass (16).\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"44e2a9097356e293440c1f48cbea45a1c71870b6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sahassakhare/agentic-ui/git/trees/44e2a9097356e293440c1f48cbea45a1c71870b6"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sahassakhare/agentic-ui/git/commits/fe6fdc53848658224552a6fd8a26a9b257d330d8","verification":{"payload":"tree 44e2a9097356e293440c1f48cbea45a1c71870b6\nparent c09d8825c880d0c627fcef1a890940306ad90946\nauthor sahassakhare <shapitsahas@gmail.com> 1787073387 +0530\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1787073387 +0530\n\nfeat(studio): author a decision-driven workflow branch in the Workflow Designer (#42)\n\nCompletes workflow branch-on-decision (runtime shipped in the lib + Hub). A\nbranching step now chooses \"branch on: state fields | a decision\". In decision\nmode the author picks a governed kind:''decision'', an optional output, and maps\noutput values → target steps (+ else default) — serialized as the lib''s\nDecisionNext.\n\n- Step model gains mode/decisionRef/output/cases; resolved() emits DecisionNext\n  when in decision mode; fromRaw() round-trips it (so opening + saving a\n  workflow no longer clobbers a DecisionNext step).\n- journey-flow StepNext + the live preview render a decision branch\n  (decision.output = value → step).\n- workflow-validate targetsOf() reads a DecisionNext''s cases + default, so\n  dead-target / reachability checks cover decision branches too.\n\nStudio builds; workflow-validate specs pass (16).\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqhJNrCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAz/QQAGquD0o4SaLIce92WtZdKR9+\n4t4yqOfMt7MqHgg/yi3x+PTy9R5dLbuODi4kRLUMEn5S6fBbibpawfpwOuvjMRUM\nP+fKRDzqfw2pX6xWGidrx32m0h81PJFCP3YDl404WqkVyGD3AqN6cmlnc2G2lmIQ\nZ2mA2YjLsPPnNpn9cfLHmMpMl6AJR9UDNb5bH48azjJdseppUTZpbTtZmhvwNzcA\nnD059UjxE0Q19yUCKX1VgOUfiELLphIRwWC5xWUAOqkX/EXqkYAwamzxKNyYFwxi\n6lKZuaEl+NitjdTyoCUrnQGGPK6s2gpgCTw6xmovy6LEPww9FUsKQBnNuvAZE/7j\nqH9gs7NJbLC7skzDcf6jaddXTeekAY+wl1eOOJ4KjncpJkRLaCX1Dq570j+xbves\nsZbLmu1OcJR/Kp4f2k02o8aKetVb5B8F77KhpceUZLtvLPiGn6gbPR9PnIkRtGb8\nMJThlakKJD0GKuM1zn1NZu29UwUNrGjU+/4ZjGFv8qmazdAO1+6l7U21qc1l2Wws\nZYvJo5Utdd4KX4aOLrZtnZvO2KYhjkU8QQj/u0ItBJv3h9wPobdM4jPO06+Jjx8D\npz9jw6KEqlIk+vfn+EXhHj4h7guvNYBkPuGTrB7JPl02FwDipAHsh3LMUCugXpZl\n2IHYaVr3rhsv4DjIjz4d\n=uQLX\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-08-18T17:16:27Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","id":19864447,"login":"web-flow","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/sahassakhare/agentic-ui/commit/fe6fdc53848658224552a6fd8a26a9b257d330d8","node_id":"C_kwDOSNG7mtoAKGZlNmZkYzUzODQ4NjU4MjI0NTUyYTZmZDhhMjZhOWIyNTdkMzMwZDg","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/sahassakhare/agentic-ui/commit/c09d8825c880d0c627fcef1a890940306ad90946","sha":"c09d8825c880d0c627fcef1a890940306ad90946","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sahassakhare/agentic-ui/commits/c09d8825c880d0c627fcef1a890940306ad90946"}],"sha":"fe6fdc53848658224552a6fd8a26a9b257d330d8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sahassakhare/agentic-ui/commits/fe6fdc53848658224552a6fd8a26a9b257d330d8"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/21344002?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sahassakhare/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sahassakhare/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sahassakhare/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sahassakhare/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/sahassakhare","id":21344002,"login":"sahassakhare","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIxMzQ0MDAy","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sahassakhare/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sahassakhare/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sahassakhare/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sahassakhare/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sahassakhare/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/sahassakhare","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sahassakhare/agentic-ui/commits/c09d8825c880d0c627fcef1a890940306ad90946/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-18T17:09:41Z","email":"shapitsahas@gmail.com","name":"sahassakhare"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-18T17:09:41Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"feat(workflow): branch on a governed decision (DecisionNext + evaluator seam) (#41)\n\nA workflow step could branch on state (ConditionalNext) or a code function, but\nnot on a governed kind:''decision'' — the audit''s remaining gap. Add a serializable,\nStudio-authorable decision branch.\n\nLibrary:\n- DecisionNext { decision, output?, cases, default } added to WorkflowStep.next.\n- AGENTIC_DECISION_EVALUATOR: an InjectionToken the host implements (mirrors\n  TOOL_FILTER) — a DecisionEvaluator that maps a decision name + input → outputs.\n  Default is a no-op (branches fall to `default`), so the lib depends only on the\n  token, never on the app. + provideDecisionEvaluator() helper.\n- resolveNextAsync(next, state, evaluator): resolves a DecisionNext by running the\n  evaluator and mapping the chosen output through `cases`; all other forms delegate\n  to the pure sync resolveNext (which safely returns a DecisionNext''s `default`).\n- workflow-renderer next() is now async and awaits resolveNextAsync with the\n  injected evaluator.\n- agenticWorkflow validates DecisionNext case/default step reachability at\n  registration. +resolve-next.spec coverage. FESM 855 KiB (under the 864 cap).\n\nRuntime (Hub):\n- Provide AGENTIC_DECISION_EVALUATOR backed by DecisionRegistry, so a workflow\n  branches on any catalog-authored decision, evaluated on the workflow state.\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"ba3836eda901e5a64cc85bc4000241f98ef705e8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sahassakhare/agentic-ui/git/trees/ba3836eda901e5a64cc85bc4000241f98ef705e8"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sahassakhare/agentic-ui/git/commits/c09d8825c880d0c627fcef1a890940306ad90946","verification":{"payload":"tree ba3836eda901e5a64cc85bc4000241f98ef705e8\nparent 75f24aec9fb07d541bfc89f626c1dc9c596fcbcd\nauthor sahassakhare <shapitsahas@gmail.com> 1787072981 +0530\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1787072981 +0530\n\nfeat(workflow): branch on a governed decision (DecisionNext + evaluator seam) (#41)\n\nA workflow step could branch on state (ConditionalNext) or a code function, but\nnot on a governed kind:''decision'' — the audit''s remaining gap. Add a serializable,\nStudio-authorable decision branch.\n\nLibrary:\n- DecisionNext { decision, output?, cases, default } added to WorkflowStep.next.\n- AGENTIC_DECISION_EVALUATOR: an InjectionToken the host implements (mirrors\n  TOOL_FILTER) — a DecisionEvaluator that maps a decision name + input → outputs.\n  Default is a no-op (branches fall to `default`), so the lib depends only on the\n  token, never on the app. + provideDecisionEvaluator() helper.\n- resolveNextAsync(next, state, evaluator): resolves a DecisionNext by running the\n  evaluator and mapping the chosen output through `cases`; all other forms delegate\n  to the pure sync resolveNext (which safely returns a DecisionNext''s `default`).\n- workflow-renderer next() is now async and awaits resolveNextAsync with the\n  injected evaluator.\n- agenticWorkflow validates DecisionNext case/default step reachability at\n  registration. +resolve-next.spec coverage. FESM 855 KiB (under the 864 cap).\n\nRuntime (Hub):\n- Provide AGENTIC_DECISION_EVALUATOR backed by DecisionRegistry, so a workflow\n  branches on any catalog-authored decision, evaluated on the workflow state.\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqhJHVCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAv4oQAGVOhgyi4hlNttt0GaFAZove\ne1J0Q4HXcKHSQF4Myp6m5m04WGueF/UOKbFUuNK8/ArjXoUvv0js1maW42be9gFT\n8bxWVzVu/XdqPvy2Wz56ihFjOnH8mDlsFFkw6D6Z4qxJeriIK45U1ebc3aUXPZnN\nzdLnlV+ICCiXjp3+8vMY9nS4Q5YPPs6ffXTchPzXs8PUyKT9Z2mh/WVNPCBeoMo9\n/nt8vrQIvD51d17Jgc8TWoHysCjYVS9uarJonmN9+7PlsapmfZFTWe21wFEAnjhO\nE/V2pJSFnROq9i50UqGuml/LrjAEoyHbSEGbRF1v4LZICDFuxqUjr8lulSBXVjp8\nO5WxB1kd1HJdLUiiZ2O68/lEq7W0/ZcEeJeEp7GHPGcFLbO1f8NEbKyS4c44pbro\nbUazR8N3O5/zNPTmjSfCdMEMTzCqdI9fLKtsM+88aZlnfa8nJAg0EtN51SUU6qJh\nihIOpLJEf/jBkXNJ7LXyVHb0ndskA56PU/huqymLbDraa/GApC8qYT4qUDfmMkPo\n0g1eAb69hKokgJfzZzvfe2JR6tZFOp6z14z9xS+0saHNUKcf9BSJxk4t7CAI/6ep\nFys4SpGNThBgUk21wQptQ4qEMb/WIrZ35Ve09+VKV8j5zPEAnIy0GZzMCejchHW6\ncEl8ooWYjWjxvwFV4Bve\n=1grf\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-08-18T17:09:42Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","id":19864447,"login":"web-flow","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/sahassakhare/agentic-ui/commit/c09d8825c880d0c627fcef1a890940306ad90946","node_id":"C_kwDOSNG7mtoAKGMwOWQ4ODI1Yzg4MGQwYzYyN2ZjZWYxYTg5MDk0MDMwNmFkOTA5NDY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/sahassakhare/agentic-ui/commit/75f24aec9fb07d541bfc89f626c1dc9c596fcbcd","sha":"75f24aec9fb07d541bfc89f626c1dc9c596fcbcd","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sahassakhare/agentic-ui/commits/75f24aec9fb07d541bfc89f626c1dc9c596fcbcd"}],"sha":"c09d8825c880d0c627fcef1a890940306ad90946","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sahassakhare/agentic-ui/commits/c09d8825c880d0c627fcef1a890940306ad90946"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/21344002?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sahassakhare/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sahassakhare/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sahassakhare/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sahassakhare/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/sahassakhare","id":21344002,"login":"sahassakhare","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIxMzQ0MDAy","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sahassakhare/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sahassakhare/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sahassakhare/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sahassakhare/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sahassakhare/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/sahassakhare","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sahassakhare/agentic-ui/commits/75f24aec9fb07d541bfc89f626c1dc9c596fcbcd/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-18T15:41:43Z","email":"shapitsahas@gmail.com","name":"sahassakhare"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-18T15:41:43Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"feat(studio): run a decision from a form button (form values → outputs) (#40)\n\nDecisions are exposed as runtime tools (CatalogDecisionSource) and a form''s\n`tool` action already spreads the form values into the tool args\n(form-renderer.component.ts:511). So a form button bound to a decision evaluates\nthat decision on the form''s inputs with no lib change — the only missing piece\nwas letting the Form Designer pick a decision as an action target.\n\nThe `tool` action dropdown now also lists decisions (◆ …, name-matched to the\nruntime decision-tool). Loaded via listByKind(''decision'').\n\n(Validation authoring is already complete end-to-end — the Form Designer''s\nper-field validators picker predates the runtime bridge (PR #38); no change\nneeded there.)\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"d50119b8ac84a63b6dc31d08d794f489e5939fc9","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sahassakhare/agentic-ui/git/trees/d50119b8ac84a63b6dc31d08d794f489e5939fc9"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sahassakhare/agentic-ui/git/commits/75f24aec9fb07d541bfc89f626c1dc9c596fcbcd","verification":{"payload":"tree d50119b8ac84a63b6dc31d08d794f489e5939fc9\nparent 1994d747bedea274c95aa2bf982883dda124b758\nauthor sahassakhare <shapitsahas@gmail.com> 1787067703 +0530\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1787067703 +0530\n\nfeat(studio): run a decision from a form button (form values → outputs) (#40)\n\nDecisions are exposed as runtime tools (CatalogDecisionSource) and a form''s\n`tool` action already spreads the form values into the tool args\n(form-renderer.component.ts:511). So a form button bound to a decision evaluates\nthat decision on the form''s inputs with no lib change — the only missing piece\nwas letting the Form Designer pick a decision as an action target.\n\nThe `tool` action dropdown now also lists decisions (◆ …, name-matched to the\nruntime decision-tool). Loaded via listByKind(''decision'').\n\n(Validation authoring is already complete end-to-end — the Form Designer''s\nper-field validators picker predates the runtime bridge (PR #38); no change\nneeded there.)\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqhH03CRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAKMMQAGo4XgT2FT0oPULZEDy9goIl\nFwL4mNPXw5qigq21AeSGq9mj90NTSGZooCpnL7rmABKBWYqyM642AwpDp/LI3x8u\nOBYLjnOIcICXT7d1fKy+yEvhHj74+qEx0lcqnUI0VqIJhZ/gvAWoIgHwqqTzoS96\n/7NP53U+t5Z/AyAelR43SuELgczPiDExVRL3FUwArCjZgJwfOMMSMxR20eGnKX9D\nd6r0lwbx9UrMJqeIhUE03spcsX0jfAU+mf9/ocGW+YZSEI3RNKRx7FlnCUu2wFqh\nlC1hmMUrdW9IwEMUYqvnYBmRkmmi/rsQ4Z0cN8Yhk1DVzvA636mDPYfq91DG0hmG\nR6zgfYta26P3Tro6SAGg5qIccf0lIQRrcRhyAI9N6Rx3mVzLCeo+cdYNzxp/63a4\ncQykAqTTqn7u03mNyGH6GlIVFZJyoXn6kcHOnmVVNnqKaWAtpDn5FcWD6S3MDCOw\nO49NwDQ7uoAK6Erns4eyfewGx/ynV3qt9aBJngOOYXi+MZnKHWxW+8kZR4lH/eKS\noIflT6i+hWvSY1eb1eCe4JXEMc4az1a/7JFrKOOsZwxGD7zpYWKNSvaM803AGdwZ\nPUw0jaqxIUzw+Eq/64it1kFA9R7nNl2/agPOQSxXxH2YGGuxjLC6+m9vPgMvuM6G\nrjRRrdTZAl5RPxLc4Uon\n=nxd/\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-08-18T15:41:43Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","id":19864447,"login":"web-flow","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","site_admin":