l":"https://api.github.com/repos/jagreehal/mountly/commits/dd3af803413335fbf2595a3f8b845556772717cc"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/3634906?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jagreehal/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jagreehal/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jagreehal/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jagreehal/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/jagreehal","id":3634906,"login":"jagreehal","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM2MzQ5MDY=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jagreehal/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jagreehal/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jagreehal/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jagreehal/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jagreehal/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/jagreehal","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jagreehal/mountly/commits/45e067a9011837e97cf30602930514a7701d888a/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-24T18:33:05Z","email":"jag.reehal@gmail.com","name":"Jag Reehal"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-24T18:33:05Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"feat(embed): host function props, cross-origin workers, shadow-root portals (#270)\n\nFunction props: `on*` props dispatch DOM events. Other function-typed props\nare properties the host assigns (`el.getToken = …`), so the component\nreceives the host''s function and its return value. They have no attribute,\nwhich keeps tokens out of the markup.\n\nWeb Workers: the elements build routes each `new Worker(…)` through a\nsame-origin `blob:` shim that imports the real script, so a distribution on\na CDN can start workers on the consumer''s page. The rewrite parses each\nchunk and follows scopes, touching only calls that construct the platform''s\nWorker. Workers build as ES modules and keep the provider''s\n`import.meta.url`.\n\nReact portals: `usePortalContainer()` returns a node inside the widget''s\nshadow root under `shadow: true`, so Radix and shadcn popups keep the\nadopted stylesheet, and `null` in light DOM.\n\nDocs and the publish-component-embed skill cover all three.","tree":{"sha":"f1f34b7649fe79d8e6c1f0807a9f65e75bafa4c8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jagreehal/mountly/git/trees/f1f34b7649fe79d8e6c1f0807a9f65e75bafa4c8"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jagreehal/mountly/git/commits/45e067a9011837e97cf30602930514a7701d888a","verification":{"payload":"tree f1f34b7649fe79d8e6c1f0807a9f65e75bafa4c8\nparent 1c8d709ac544be7587ee7d6ed8c081cbb97ff7b3\nauthor Jag Reehal <jag.reehal@gmail.com> 1790274785 +0100\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1790274785 +0100\n\nfeat(embed): host function props, cross-origin workers, shadow-root portals (#270)\n\nFunction props: `on*` props dispatch DOM events. Other function-typed props\nare properties the host assigns (`el.getToken = …`), so the component\nreceives the host''s function and its return value. They have no attribute,\nwhich keeps tokens out of the markup.\n\nWeb Workers: the elements build routes each `new Worker(…)` through a\nsame-origin `blob:` shim that imports the real script, so a distribution on\na CDN can start workers on the consumer''s page. The rewrite parses each\nchunk and follows scopes, touching only calls that construct the platform''s\nWorker. Workers build as ES modules and keep the provider''s\n`import.meta.url`.\n\nReact portals: `usePortalContainer()` returns a node inside the widget''s\nshadow root under `shadow: true`, so Radix and shadcn popups keep the\nadopted stylesheet, and `null` in light DOM.\n\nDocs and the publish-component-embed skill cover all three.","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqtWzhCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAA7KsQALGiK