 mountly / mountly-react pins existed only to work around the\nfile: pack and are now dead weight.","tree":{"sha":"abf17a75d5ea7407456aeeda26871dcbed5cb121","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jagreehal/mountly/git/trees/abf17a75d5ea7407456aeeda26871dcbed5cb121"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jagreehal/mountly/git/commits/5c5b200aa6a183daa50bdc7869a42481ea29902c","verification":{"payload":"tree abf17a75d5ea7407456aeeda26871dcbed5cb121\nparent 4c8becef271c0030f9a9dcda311c15228845cd68\nauthor Jag Reehal <jag.reehal@gmail.com> 1787499556 +0100\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1787499556 +0100\n\nfix(tests): link local mountly-mcp in scaffold test instead of file: (#243)\n\nfile: packs the package and then resolves its own dependencies from npm.\nOn a release PR changesets has already bumped those ranges to versions that\npublish after CI, so the scaffold install failed with\nERR_PNPM_NO_MATCHING_VERSION and every release PR — plus the main-branch run\nright after merge — stayed red until the release it gated was already out.\n\nlink: symlinks the checkout, so mountly-mcp resolves through the monorepo.\nThe top-level mountly / mountly-react pins existed only to work around the\nfile: pack and are now dead weight.","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqixQkCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAG2UQAIMfnW3jmopYYofhpZYd2h19\noHGsH35rwKR5UOd9h1QJb+aFt/WQMkSUZaVBYOuYzzYuw+y2k/ENHWf+TuqODNon\nFs33pqAvuxaBN6Jp0cacZttk8MYcp4NxFlZhBoIO6p+rYQoexmI28pS93MpwbnFb\n70RFu5eoOI/KnfzCP9YA+vYXpO2qmH13yl8MEh9GRZ1eeEenIJiZwJWKp6uFRlyA\nmFBcfASqmyT5+GHiYYABdKvVBkW2N9ic0qru73kyyeCoig23OZAbHbEogdv473xQ\nxTzxxJR3I+8rqiDh7xhvuYae6Ul1io0WhK1fCaQgZamEgHde+Ucu+TNf1cSHJDGg\nyWoHg+UqR42kI5gy1NjFeZQ4F0qcBjNTM85rsAcUZOy1+jWdk8ubARjb5pXQsSAn\n0Bpj1I4A523XIII9IJjSbL48/nn8kn5veWKWKRd+TEeq76mi5O4PYBMkVIoHxHQ5\npwLmbp/oLMpqj6bWuLSTcX+hSnkPsrWnkYRWWq7BKPtHqOSC/slMZxXZub3NQB/0\nnUH+1FIbWPDQLGRmk6oL6Jzy1Fcflam3npbekeNZpuPf/A8f+pUlYvQeMGGDZdXs\nrzMMt0rYk9o1P9jHSHGSFau+SRflmtiTPg/