969 +0100\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1787484969 +0100\n\nfeat(mountly): frame protocols, manifest iframe isolation, and MCP scaffold fixes (#231)\n\nFramed verticals become participants instead of dead ends: typed cross-frame\nevents, host-owned routing and history, overlay breakout for modals, manifest\nisolation flip, optional same-origin proxy, and pre-activation placeholders.\n\nAlso fixes on-demand loading under strict CSP (dynamic import fallback when eval\nis blocked), reports silent iframe failures via readyTimeout/onError, pins MCP\nscaffold deps to the generating CLI version, and adds a vanilla MCP template.","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqitspCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAEAcQAJUDrtb1TuGdyhHRqcNw8QW7\nsTSFeuvKM4jvYKTGnPk1hStw/VYDgGBrJmBUofNWecvm8mAcRlUELwtYoCYngFJA\nH82eALlH1xh+P8NEBG1/KaYaBYOYOJSoMFUqgfXrQUXZN8nEmuyxBa2ObTis4/N1\n5f3v+8oIlij0HHywrvQlx3SqsrQTZzS+ymob6qWtJwAZFrSNtjn1HpFGYjGApiVD\nox7DpC3Ik8ge3ubBFsOq8WpQTHYXniqrtJxdNSgT2MH0F0LtvXqQRek+3ir9sBs/\nWw0Y4o3RUtob/2p0ifyqoX10dHeftCIB8my5LWClms49HkqDQejZXtVTcgHDykmI\nuaRagCKk+ElFKfZZ+wTy9c0oBz4KeScIp7Rd/YnHnEIajUPOduAiqJ8s1V29STuZ\nh7w06iiCOc9BoeA0Rg7tTe9EhjZgJYilYS6aZGsaZ2SqhFpBir4ayFR98voUwJPz\nldXXc38Sho7EgokVY3+VT+P034y6N0xcJnB47Y9Z8aOKTb6ngXv8UxakdF9OGyd0\nd+xEONOX4mDFn1NAqX0tFDmJfx+ubzA6GEelg6ToamCKYfOQaUxK2++6A2G7LGiV\nxEqpEzCZdkMmb0TBpchJLfzalWurOdY4ObWdJZHgvQe88FLUCEpHnVww5b816fkB\nyh28eflm5Netbsmd4cYK\n=6n+V\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-08-23T11:36:10Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","id":19864447,"login":"web-flow","n