nt":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-19T15:27:02Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"fix: harden runtime and mcp apps dx across core packages (#223)\n\n* fix: harden runtime behavior and mcp app integrations\n\nAddress correctness and DX issues across mountly core, adapters, and mcp tooling by fixing leaks and race conditions, adding safer host/runtime behavior, and expanding test coverage for regressions.\n\nUpdate Vue and Svelte update fixtures to reflect patch-style updates so Playwright adapter parity checks observe updated props under the new adapter behavior.","tree":{"sha":"45eac0243ed9c2955fbf933f515754a507d5be65","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jagreehal/mountly/git/trees/45eac0243ed9c2955fbf933f515754a507d5be65"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jagreehal/mountly/git/commits/2ad7d913b7feaf6d8134c37e89b8ab7731f9b51c","verification":{"payload":"tree 45eac0243ed9c2955fbf933f515754a507d5be65\nparent 59b8c0a42504742635f780a09a6bd3c68ad3e52e\nauthor Jag Reehal <jag.reehal@gmail.com> 1787153222 +0200\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1787153222 +0200\n\nfix: harden runtime and mcp apps dx across core packages (#223)\n\n* fix: harden runtime behavior and mcp app integrations\n\nAddress correctness and DX issues across mountly core, adapters, and mcp tooling by fixing leaks and race conditions, adding safer host/runtime behavior, and expanding test coverage for regressions.\n\nUpdate Vue and Svelte update fixtures to reflect patch-style updates so Playwright adapter parity checks observe updated props under the new adapter behavior.","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqhctGCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAJzsQAHp5poRN56X+77CGor5VahNr\nhECehJRnEFeyZAGGqUYx7hDVKaxlI+5pIxhc0ICZceNqnx6JmGXNbEMfEyzR/zJv\nSb4OvVsfisxTAvOyrJptlFyhlf45RuPcFuKw12NKI8nqswW2Y9UgJcvFTOh438wt\nl/As80z+Q+r+VAJbQ4jmrTOGvZ3sd2iEq6ORShfC40twM+6HJ9EnLQCP9Kgn1efx\nCKm6Ix+asUv1zdFQF1Vzk6lEKfAkq6r5xtgYzuFhdls2UW8A7+iCjarx4C1QA93m\ngzZyzgS+sSgiX