44b0db36ad25c"}],"sha":"610a105c2633544c303a3358b983f8f6a17bcb1e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jagreehal/mountly/commits/610a105c2633544c303a3358b983f8f6a17bcb1e"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/3634906?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jagreehal/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jagreehal/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jagreehal/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jagreehal/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/jagreehal","id":3634906,"login":"jagreehal","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM2MzQ5MDY=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jagreehal/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jagreehal/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jagreehal/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jagreehal/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jagreehal/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/jagreehal","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jagreehal/mountly/commits/d4a38461347ecbfc5c4fa580ad544b0db36ad25c/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-11T17:04:23Z","email":"jag.reehal@gmail.com","name":"Jag Reehal"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-11T17:04:23Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"feat: import-map-native micro-frontends (#159)\n\n* feat: import-map-native micro-frontends — 8 packages, federation-beating Vite DX\n\nConsolidate the package surface and ship a Vite micro-frontend DX that beats\nvite-plugin-federation while staying import-map-native.\n\nPackages (16 → 8)\n- Remove the Module-Federation-style drift: mountly-share (share-scope runtime +\n  admission), mountly-shell + mountly-shell-tanstack (SPA shell), mountly-tsrx,\n  and the spa-shell-host example. Import maps already pin one URL per specifier,\n  so the browser loads one React; the duplicate-React/version-skew check lives in\n  validateManifest off platform.imports.\n- Fold mountly-contracts into mountly/contracts (zod-free; core has zero runtime deps).\n- Merge mountly-mcp-react / -server / mountly-json-render into mountly-mcp subpaths\n  (./react, ./server, ./json-render, ./json-render/server).\n- mountly-manifest: drop platform.shared, per-vertical shared, mounts/routes, and\n  share-scope helpers.\n\nVite DX\n- mountlyRemote({ name, exposes }): a remote is one plugin + `vite build` — no build\n  script, no `shared` block to sync with the host.\n- mountlyHostPlugin gains federation-style remotes:{ name: url } — fetches the\n  remote''s published fragment to auto-wire the import map AND types over HTTP; the\n  old dev-origin option is renamed devOrigins. Native typed import(\"remote/Sub\");\n  runtime loadVertical(url, export).\n- mountly/runtime hides its dynamic import() from Vite''s analyzer (dynamic-import.ts\n  + patch-vite-ignore build step).\n\nExamples, tests, docs\n- examples/vite-host-remotes-url + a self-orchestrating browser proof\n  (tests/vite-host-remotes-url.spec.ts).\n- Published Starlight docs synced with the new DX; stop-slop prose pass across\n  md/mdx and READMEs.\n- Lint clean (0 errors / 0 warnings); generated mountly-remotes.d.ts / .mountly\n  artifacts gitignored.\n\n* chore: update test examples and add validation commands\n\n- Updated the `test:examples` script in `package.json` to include `tests/platform-embed.spec.ts`.\n- Added a new Playwright configuration for the `platform-embed-host-example` to validate example manifests.\n- Introduced `doctor` command in the CLI for manifest validation and added it to the example package scripts.\n- Enhanced documentation to reflect new architecture choices and validation processes.\n\n* fix(docs): pin @astrojs/starlight to ^0.40.0 for astro 6 compat\n\nThe dependabot bump to starlight 0.41.3 pulled in @astrojs/mdx@7.0.2,\nwhich requires astro ^7 and imports chunkToString — unexported by the\npinned astro 6.4.8 — breaking the docs build. Revert to starlight 0.40.0\n(astro ^6 peer, mdx 6.0.3) and regenerate the lockfile.\n\n* fix: restore missing command key in vite-host-import webServer\n\nThe vite-host-import webServer entry in playwright.config.ts had lost its\n`command:` key, leaving a bare string that broke lint/typecheck.\n\n* chore(docs): upgrade to Astro 7 + Starlight 0.41.3\n\nStarlight 0.41.0+ adds Astro v7 support and drops v6. Bump astro ^6.4.8\n→ ^7.0.7 and @astrojs/starlight ^0.40.0 → ^0.41.3 together (mdx 7.0.2\npeer-satisfied). Supersedes the temporary 0.40.0 pin; docs build verified.","tree":{"sha":"e5732bc5d15d01d739138ad45d9980162a7990e0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jagreehal/mountly/git/trees/e5732bc5d15d01d739138ad45d9980162a7990e0"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jagreehal/mountly/git/commits/d4a38461347ecbfc5c4fa580ad544b0db36ad25c","verification":{"payload":"tree e5732bc5d15d01d739138ad45d9980162a7990e0\nparent 4bc2dcd2a007dd16822ee5de7936684b24e00e36\nauthor Jag Reehal <jag.reehal@gmail.com> 1783789463 +0100\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1783789463 +0100\n\nfeat: import-map-native micro-frontends (#159)\n\n* feat: import-map-native micro-frontends — 8 packages, federation-beating Vite DX\n\nConsolidate the package surface and ship a Vite micro-frontend DX that beats\nvite-plugin-federation while staying import-map-native.\n\nPackages (16 → 8)\n- Remove the Module-Federation-style drift: mountly-share (share-scope runtime +\n  admission), mountly-shell + mountly-shell-tanstack (SPA shell), mountly-tsrx,\n  and the spa-shell-host example. Import maps already pin one URL per specifier,\n  so the browser loads one React; the duplicate-React/version-skew check lives in\n  validateManifest off platform.imports.\n- Fold mountly-contracts into mountly/contracts (zod-free; core has zero runtime deps).\n- Merge mountly-mcp-react / -server / mountly-json-render into mountly-mcp subpaths\n  (./react, ./server, ./json-render, ./json-render/server).\n- mountly-manifest: drop platform.shared, per-vertical shared, mounts/routes, and\n  share-scope helpers.\n\nVite DX\n- mountlyRemote({ name, exposes }): a remote is one plugin + `vite build` — no build\n  script, no `shared` block to sync with the host.\n- mountlyHostPlugin gains federation-style remotes:{ name: url } — fetches the\n  remote''s published fragment to auto-wire the import map AND types over HTTP; the\n  old dev-origin option is renamed devOrigins. Native typed import(\"remote/Sub\");\n  runtime loadVertical(url, export).\n- mountly/runtime hides its dynamic import() from Vite''s analyzer (dynamic-import.ts\n  + patch-vite-ignore build step).\n\nExamples, tests, docs\n- examples/vite-host-remotes-url + a self-orchestrating browser proof\n  (tests/vite-host-remotes-url.spec.ts).\n- Published Starlight docs synced with the new DX; stop-slop prose pass across\n  md/mdx and READMEs.\n- Lint clean (0 errors / 0 warnings); generated mountly-remotes.d.ts / .mountly\n  artifacts gitignored.\n\n* chore: update test examples and add validation commands\n\n- Updated the `test:examples` script in `package.json` to include `tests/platform-embed.spec.ts`.\n- Added a new Playwright configuration for the `platform-embed-host-example` to validate example manifests.\n- Introduced `doctor` command in the CLI for manifest validation and added it to the example package scripts.\n- Enhanced documentation to reflect new architecture choices and validation processes.\n\n* fix(docs): pin @astrojs/starlight to ^0.40.0 for astro 6 compat\n\nThe dependabot bump to starlight 0.41.3 pulled in @astrojs/mdx@7.0.2,\nwhich requires astro ^7 and imports chunkToString — unexported by the\npinned astro 6.4.8 — breaking the docs build. Revert to starlight 0.40.0\n(astro ^6 peer, mdx 6.0.3) and regenerate the lockfile.\n\n* fix: restore missing command key in vite-host-import webServer\n\nThe vite-host-import webServer entry in playwright.config.ts had lost its\n`command:` key, leaving a bare string that broke lint/typecheck.\n\n* chore(docs): upgrade to Astro 7 + Starlight 0.41.3\n\nStarlight 0.41.0+ adds Astro v7 support and drops v6. Bump astro ^6.4.8\n→ ^7.0.7 and @astrojs/starlight ^0.40.0 → ^0.41.3 together (mdx 7.0.2\npeer-satisfied). Supersedes the temporary 0.40.0 pin; docs build verified.","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqUneXCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAdZAQAJVkpj/zUmj2hGchOEA6TGs9\noiUd617mkgXo3LSVsaOgdl4L42t5Lf7gMP086EyCCc4jP4nzt8Cw6aZvOzQ61Ers\nECVZjiE0DhOnyTX5dGPWbSu8Nid/DLlT5vP4Isltz0RUlUIw7FNVg8I9ViIioPr9\nN7vQY6e1YWU6MQqcR7PIpU2OX3oxudv0BJq8EXA/ulneMsdCqcaJqweVqNYSrd8D\n5uocGVLemAKvb9Hxf1neh1dByDzKapo/aHfVliMkBTdjxXjPMXq7RJtmDoNJ2+7l\nOKtjb1Hw89JoFgD4dvwuCnJocfI1qhtGaiY2HNnzAHvg46n+pySnh+1Q34XyH9Af\nvZ0wFKp+ba8QR5ZoW2Y+7OZzweNqug5SIS6E+FSc/RIHj7sKBBRWsso/yG8x5Wci\nEOTuL27GOhXq6G1F/LJCISsOebn1OOKLmFIwvC0o0mpBCsOOJJHMx4MaA9W6WhaZ\nGct1XXlCMu4XYXdLj3Ays3BOk7j7Wf9HjXjY2ZFm0GHkooKL/+X2Cqkh2RCDaSG3\nbQ+gMLpkVbiWluf+vyZ4+R1sX+XCb+FUwInJBshlfigIIY9+YhPPkTzkSEju+o+9\nhkdMPhnyLOp3gXkMPl8Vh+F7qrzKmDKAETaaqXiX5i8tAYV74iuRq62JcmAMuVAU\nE7zGLKc9V90JJ3oxp5hC\n=ksuZ\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-07-11T17:04:23Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","id":19864447,"login":"web-flow","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos",