tory pattern is\nreal and well-defined. Adds three pages — Microsoft''s Dynamic AI Agents\nat Scale (the canonical factory pattern + semantic-cache flat-token-cost\nmechanism), NVIDIA''s Enterprise AI Factory AgentOps (operating discipline\n+ per-agent workspace/Skills/sandbox primitives, bridging the data-center\nand agentic senses), and Berkeley CMR''s Agentic Operating Model (four-layer\ngovernance + HITL->HOTL) — plus an \"Agent factories & operating at scale\"\nPatterns subsection. Records the Gartner agent-sprawl scale stat and the\nrefuted blog-level \"factory\" framings. From a June 2026 deep-research pass\n(Synthesize step failed; reconstructed from the 21-claim verified set).\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"eb753ab485dcf40cdcd789016944b880ca437c8d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/alcherkas/claude/git/trees/eb753ab485dcf40cdcd789016944b880ca437c8d"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/alcherkas/claude/git/commits/7986416226ad4347da02600aac4528fe767f7a3c","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/7316197?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alcherkas/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alcherkas/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alcherkas/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alcherkas/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/alcherkas","id":7316197,"login":"alcherkas","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjczMTYxOTc=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alcherkas/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alcherkas/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alcherkas/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alcherkas/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alcherkas/sub