herkas"},"message":"Add agentic loops & the Ralph Loop to orchestration\n\nCloses the loops gap (the Ralph Loop was previously name-only). Adds two\npages — the Ralph Loop (Huntley, Jul 2025: bash loop restarts a fresh\nagent each iteration, git/progress.txt/prd.json as memory, one task per\nloop; the named mirror of Anthropic''s long-running-agent harness) and the\n\"loop engineering\" paradigm (write loops not prompts; the maker-checker\n/goal pattern) — plus an \"Agentic loops\" Patterns subsection. Records the\ntwo refuted misconceptions (not an error-feedback loop; not a fixed\nfive-phase pipeline). From a June 2026 deep-research pass; core mechanism\nhigh-confidence, the 2026 loop-engineering framing medium.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"bf590d1b06006108cf53158fcab4e1d4e4fe136e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/alcherkas/claude/git/trees/bf590d1b06006108cf53158fcab4e1d4e4fe136e"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/alcherkas/claude/git/commits/7a4d445e1dcc0f608f3ba119a02c652e1dffbf77","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/7316197?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alcherkas/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alcherkas/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alcherkas/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alcherkas/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/alcherkas","id":7316197,"login":"alcherkas","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjczMTYxOTc=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alcherkas/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alcherkas/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alcherkas/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alcherkas/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.g