:"https://api.github.com/users/alcherkas/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/alcherkas","id":7316197,"login":"alcherkas","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjczMTYxOTc=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alcherkas/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alcherkas/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alcherkas/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alcherkas/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alcherkas/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/alcherkas","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/alcherkas/claude/commits/80587555bf5de6d2fd5d9ba3dac02750b6d2a396/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-28T19:21:20Z","email":"cherkasalexandr@gmail.com","name":"Aleksandr Cherkas"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-28T19:21:20Z","email":"cherkasalexandr@gmail.com","name":"Aleksandr Cherkas"},"message":"Add spec-driven reference architecture (end-to-end spec→code system)\n\nSynthesis page assembling the specify → constrain → plan → implement →\nverify pipeline from the topic''s primary sources, gated by a rigor\ndecision and closed by review + spec-adherence evaluation. Maps the\ncanonical tools (Spec Kit, Kiro, Antigravity, Claude Code) onto layer\nsubsets and documents the two seams (the unnamed constraint layer;\nspec-as-source rarely realized). Wired into nav and the index \"Start\nhere\" tip; not a manifest entry (hand-authored synthesis, like the\nother reference-architecture pages).\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"1f0a32ce908c7226714b139a97375b4a13eaee73","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/alcherkas/claude/git/trees/1f0a32ce908c7226714b139a97375b4a13eaee73"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/alcherkas/claude/git/commits/80587555bf5de6d2fd5d9ba3dac02750b6d2a396","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"