tml_url":"https://github.com/alcherkas","id":7316197,"login":"alcherkas","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjczMTYxOTc=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alcherkas/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alcherkas/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alcherkas/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alcherkas/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alcherkas/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/alcherkas","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/alcherkas/claude/commits/35c10f961a05ad6d3d6bd39e6d12d6c5966c863f/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-28T19:19:09Z","email":"cherkasalexandr@gmail.com","name":"Aleksandr Cherkas"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-28T19:19:09Z","email":"cherkasalexandr@gmail.com","name":"Aleksandr Cherkas"},"message":"Add managed agent runtimes (AgentCore/Vertex Agent Engine/Foundry) to orchestration\n\nCloses the deployment-runtime gap: where an orchestration actually runs\nin production (distinct from the self-hosted durable substrate). Adds two\nprimary-source pages (AWS Bedrock AgentCore microVM-per-session runtime;\nAzure Foundry Agent Service agents-as-versioned-assets), reuses the\nexisting Vertex Agent Engine page, and adds a \"Managed agent runtimes\"\nTools subsection plus a deploy/runtime layer (7) to the reference\narchitecture. All three are framework-/model-agnostic; they differ on\nisolation, state model, pricing, and IaC. From a June 2026 deep-research\npass — 24 claims verified unanimous 3-0 against primary vendor docs\n(the Synthesize step failed and was reconstructed from the verified set).\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"59646bb0de3c47e653dc40866aa4fc03e2b9a629","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/alcherkas/claude/git/trees/59646bb0de3c47e653dc40866aa4fc03e2b9a629"},"url":"https://a