com/users/alcherkas/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alcherkas/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/alcherkas","id":7316197,"login":"alcherkas","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjczMTYxOTc=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alcherkas/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alcherkas/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alcherkas/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alcherkas/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alcherkas/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/alcherkas","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/alcherkas/claude/commits/f49ade17667cbdcdee3cc1e014fc04bfb17ea164/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-28T18:41:40Z","email":"cherkasalexandr@gmail.com","name":"Aleksandr Cherkas"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-28T18:41:40Z","email":"cherkasalexandr@gmail.com","name":"Aleksandr Cherkas"},"message":"Add orchestration reference architecture (end-to-end golden path)\n\nSynthesis page matching the context-engineering and security-governance\nreference-architecture pattern: a six-layer build pipeline (pattern →\nframework → interop → context → memory → durable execution) gated by a\nsingle-vs-multi decision step and closed by an evaluate+observe loop,\nwrapped by governance (cross-pointing to the sec-gov reference arch).\nMaps the canonical implementations (Anthropic multi-agent research,\nMagentic-One, Google ADK) onto the layers and names three seams: no\npublished blueprint, scale-triggered memory, no multi-agent eval\nstandard. Links only pages already in the corpus. Surfaced via a \"Start\nhere\" callout in the topic index and the .pages nav.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"aefc5e06f7877287a291ae53ac3f441874f3e0a4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/al