3): Claude Code\ncheckpointing/rewind, Microsoft Defender AI agent runtime protection,\nEntra Agent ID governance, Google SCC agent-credential detection, and\nthe Unit 42 \"Double Agents\" Vertex AI exploit.\n\nUpdates index.md (TL;DR, two new Tools subsections, six new Patterns,\nresolved gap/open-question items, Preview/vendor-framing caveats) and\nadds 12 hand-registered manifest entries (additive; existing entries\nbyte-identical). Committed with --no-verify per CLAUDE.md.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"775cdf44283abf753e1ff2f97aab9fc55f73120b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/alcherkas/claude/git/trees/775cdf44283abf753e1ff2f97aab9fc55f73120b"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/alcherkas/claude/git/commits/e68213299420f26605922bdbecfef93cfa7b4a9a","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/7316197?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alcherkas/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alcherkas/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alcherkas/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alcherkas/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/alcherkas","id":7316197,"login":"alcherkas","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjczMTYxOTc=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alcherkas/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alcherkas/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alcherkas/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alcherkas/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alcherkas/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/alcherkas","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/alcherkas/claude/commit/e68213299420f26605922bdbecfef93cfa7b4a9a","node_id":"C_kwD