 byte-identical code; the only variable is the AI-agent context layer.\n\n- best/: full spine — canonical PLATFORM_SPEC.md, layered root + 24 per-repo CLAUDE.md, AGENTS.md, Copilot instructions, .meta manifest, multi-root .code-workspace, components.lock, oasdiff contract-check + CI workflow, cross-repo change-set guide.\n\n- naive/: same repos, PLATFORM_SPEC removed, only a thin root CLAUDE.md.\n\ndifferences.md catalogs the full delta and the tip-task demo protocol.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"d57ddae6bc4446dcc9a40faf904ff76848d42117","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/alcherkas/claude/git/trees/d57ddae6bc4446dcc9a40faf904ff76848d42117"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/alcherkas/claude/git/commits/c8812a42f26b617fa00f88b57e070883b2c27098","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/7316197?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alcherkas/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alcherkas/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alcherkas/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alcherkas/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/alcherkas","id":7316197,"login":"alcherkas","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjczMTYxOTc=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alcherkas/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alcherkas/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alcherkas/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alcherkas/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alcherkas/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/alcherkas","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/alcherkas/claude/commit/c8812a42f26b617fa00f88b57e070883b2c27098","node_id":"C_kwDOSNOf29oA