ithub.com/users/alcherkas/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/alcherkas","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/alcherkas/claude/commits/aa1ca060ae3dd9283faa46d7641a89812b847986/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-21T06:04:11Z","email":"cherkasalexandr@gmail.com","name":"Aleksandr Cherkas"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-21T06:04:11Z","email":"cherkasalexandr@gmail.com","name":"Aleksandr Cherkas"},"message":"Add review workbench for approving wiki articles pre-commit\n\nA visual approval page in the browser: each added article renders in a\nlive mkdocs-serve iframe next to approve / reject / skip controls and a\nstatus queue. Decisions persist to a URL-keyed review_ledger.json\n(committed); render and report skip rejected sources so a rebuild never\nresurrects them. A pre-commit gate blocks the commit while any added\narticle is still unreviewed.\n\nNew CLI commands (stdlib only, no new deps): tools.wikigen review\n(--cli terminal fallback) / gate / install-hook.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"8671b896c2decb4bcfc79f13950ccb98dfc90139","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/alcherkas/claude/git/trees/8671b896c2decb4bcfc79f13950ccb98dfc90139"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/alcherkas/claude/git/commits/aa1ca060ae3dd9283faa46d7641a89812b847986","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/7316197?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alcherkas/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alcherkas/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alcherkas/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alcherkas/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/alcherkas","id":7316197,"login":"alcherkas","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjczMTY