ikp"},"message":"feat: RAGA.AI Healthcare SaaS - Complete frontend application\n\n- Firebase Authentication with login validation, error states, session handling\n- 4 Pages: Login, Dashboard, Analytics, Patient Details\n- Patient module with Grid/List toggle, search, status & department filters\n- Service Worker with push/local notifications (welcome alert on login)\n- Redux Toolkit state management across all modules\n- Recharts analytics: trend lines, bar charts, donut charts\n- Dark theme design system with CSS custom properties\n- Code splitting with React.lazy + Suspense\n- React.memo optimized patient cards/rows\n- Feature-based micro-frontend ready architecture\n- Deployed on Vercel: https://raga-healthcare-dun.vercel.app","tree":{"sha":"ba208e1e2a2011781dd21fa5b2f613b3edda3781","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pratiksana/RAGA.AI-ASSESMENT/git/trees/ba208e1e2a2011781dd21fa5b2f613b3edda3781"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pratiksana/RAGA.AI-ASSESMENT/git/commits/41e80be6cc64170924913194b74241cd6321f8a8","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/223823747?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pratiksana/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pratiksana/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pratiksana/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pratiksana/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/pratiksana","id":223823747,"login":"pratiksana","node_id":"U_kgDODVdHgw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pratiksana/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pratiksana/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pratiksana/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pratiksana/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pratiksana/