esh@gmail.com","name":"Abhimanyu Rajeesh"},"message":"feat: Enhance AI Vision and OCR functionalities\n\n- Updated localization strings in `en.json` for improved user experience.\n- Refactored `DiagnosticReportOCR` component to support multiple file uploads and enhanced extraction process.\n- Introduced new utility functions for blood group normalization and date formatting in `utils.ts`.\n- Improved lab result extraction logic in `care-ai.ts` to handle multiple files and remap results accurately.\n- Added highlighting functionality for lab observations in `utils.ts`.\n- Enhanced form filling animation in `OCRFormFill` component for better user feedback.\n- Updated draggable FAB functionality to improve usability.","tree":{"sha":"46248d524eba303a799e3bcb334870ae0df20288","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ohcnetwork/care_ai_vision_fe/git/trees/46248d524eba303a799e3bcb334870ae0df20288"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ohcnetwork/care_ai_vision_fe/git/commits/daf367fa41c8c1483d91085205005ae26adb1424","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/63541653?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abhimanyurajeesh/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abhimanyurajeesh/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abhimanyurajeesh/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abhimanyurajeesh/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/abhimanyurajeesh","id":63541653,"login":"abhimanyurajeesh","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYzNTQxNjUz","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abhimanyurajeesh/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abhimanyurajeesh/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abhimanyurajeesh/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abhimanyurajeesh/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscript