":{"date":"2026-08-17T07:14:56Z","email":"abhimanyurajeesh@gmail.com","name":"Abhimanyu Rajeesh"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-17T07:14:56Z","email":"abhimanyurajeesh@gmail.com","name":"Abhimanyu Rajeesh"},"message":"feat: implement draggable FAB for AI Vision widget with persistent position storage\n\n- Added `useDraggableFab` hook to enable dragging of the floating AI Vision widget, allowing users to reposition it within the viewport.\n- Introduced position persistence per user to prevent leakage of dragged positions across sessions on shared devices.\n- Implemented long-press functionality to reset the widget''s position to the default corner.\n- Created utility functions for managing FAB position storage in local storage.\n- Enhanced CSS with animations for the AI Vision widget and OCR field highlighting.\n- Updated OCR-related functions to support real-time transcript updates during processing.\n- Refactored settings page to improve layout and maintainability.","tree":{"sha":"a11268af4f24310ab30eab0b8a990f6672c2f8db","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ohcnetwork/care_ai_vision_fe/git/trees/a11268af4f24310ab30eab0b8a990f6672c2f8db"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ohcnetwork/care_ai_vision_fe/git/commits/db2f2a7ebe24e7004007268994035215f4ab8b4b","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/63541653?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abhimanyurajeesh/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abhimanyurajeesh/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abhimanyurajeesh/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abhimanyurajeesh/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/abhimanyurajeesh","id":63541653,"login":"abhimanyurajeesh","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYzNTQxNjUz","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abhimanyurajees