452155?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vadim-Khristenko/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vadim-Khristenko/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vadim-Khristenko/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vadim-Khristenko/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Vadim-Khristenko","id":124452155,"login":"Vadim-Khristenko","node_id":"U_kgDOB2r9Ow","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vadim-Khristenko/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vadim-Khristenko/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vadim-Khristenko/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vadim-Khristenko/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vadim-Khristenko/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vadim-Khristenko","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/misshanya/PRODHugs/commits/61a52942a4582a38107e4d529bbcce267644c859/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-17T13:20:31Z","email":"vadim@vai-rice.space","name":"Vadim Khristenko"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-17T13:20:31Z","email":"vadim@vai-rice.space","name":"Vadim Khristenko"},"message":"feat(frontend): @username everywhere + UX polish\n\n- Centralize profile linking in a tiny profileLink() helper. Every\n  remaining /user/ usage (Dashboard top streaks + history,\n  Feed, Leaderboard rows, intimacy leaderboard pairs, Inbox,\n  Outgoing slots, HugDetail modal, Settings blocked list,\n  Connections) now routes through @username. The legacy UUID route\n  still works and self-redirects, but no UI ever generates it\n  anymore.\n- Stop showing \"Купить слот\" when at max: tighten the canBuy check\n  from \"!== null\" to \"!= null\". oapi-codegen serializes nil *int\n  as an omitted field, which arrives in JS as \"undefined\", not\n  \"null\" — so the strict comparison was always true at max and the\n  button stayed visible.\n- Bounce logged-in users away from /login and /register: the\n  router guard now attempts a silent refresh on guest routes too,\n  so opening either page directly (no in-memory token but a valid\n  refresh cookie) lands on /dashboard instead of the form.\n\nCo-Authored-By: AVRORA AI (27B) <avrora@vai-prog.ru>","tree":{"sha":"1eed80a89d054233472fee6fcc382170745513ba","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/misshanya/PRODHugs/git/trees/1eed80a89d054233472fee6fcc382170745513ba"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/misshanya/PRODHugs/git/commits/61a52942a4582a38107e4d529bbcce267644c859","verification":{"payload":"tree 1eed80a89d054233472fee6fcc382170745513ba\nparent ab306838289e1a831c8f8c60aff2d01970d759e3\nauthor Vadim Khristenko <vadim@vai-rice.space> 1779024031 +0300\ncommitter Vadim Khristenko <vadim@vai-rice.space> 1779024031 +0300\n\nfeat(frontend): @username everywhere + UX polish\n\n- Centralize profile linking in a tiny profileLink() helper. Every\n  remaining /user/ usage (Dashboard top streaks + history,\n  Feed, Leaderboard rows, intimacy leaderboard pairs, Inbox,\n  Outgoing slots, HugDetail modal, Settings blocked list,\n  Connections) now routes through @username. The legacy UUID route\n  still works and self-redirects, but no UI ever generates it\n  anymore.\n- Stop showing \"Купить слот\" when at max: tighten the canBuy check\n  from \"!== null\" to \"!= null\". oapi-codegen serializes nil *int\n  as an omitted field, which arrives in JS as \"undefined\", not\n  \"null\" — so the strict comparison was always true at max and the\n  button stayed visible.\n- Bounce logged-in users away from /login and /register: the\n  router guard now attempts a silent refresh on guest routes too,\n  so opening either page directly (no in-memory token but a valid\n  refresh cookie) lands on /dashboard instead of the form.\n\nCo-Authored-By: AVRORA AI (27B) <avrora@vai-prog.ru>\n","reason":"valid","signa