d759e3/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-17T12:07:28Z","email":"vadim@vai-rice.space","name":"Vadim Khristenko"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-17T12:07:28Z","email":"vadim@vai-rice.space","name":"Vadim Khristenko"},"message":"ci: bump tooling, fix fork-PR comment 403 via workflow_run\n\nTool bumps:\n- golangci-lint v2.5.0 -> v2.12.2 (full v2.6-v2.12 changelog;\n  notably the modernize suite and gosec rule additions)\n- actions/checkout v4 -> v6, setup-go v5 -> v6, paths-filter v3 -> v4,\n  github-script v7 -> v9, setup-buildx v3 -> v4 (clears the Node 20\n  deprecation warnings; June 2026 hard cutoff)\n\nThe v2.12 lint run flagged three deferred Close() calls that\nsilently dropped errors; switch each to \"defer func() { _ = x.Close() }() \"\nto be explicit about ignoring (these are DB shutdown / HTTP body\ndrain / WS post-loop teardown — no useful recovery).\n\nFix the persistent \"Resource not accessible by integration\" 403 on\nPR comments: GitHub downgrades GITHUB_TOKEN to read-only for fork PRs\nregardless of the workflow''s \"permissions:\" block. Split the comment\nposting into a separate workflow triggered by \"workflow_run\", which\nruns in the base-repo context with a normal write token. pr-checks\nnow just uploads report.md + pr-number.txt as an artifact;\npr-comment downloads it and calls the existing post-comment.js\nhelper. The comment workflow never checks out PR code under elevated\npermissions.\n\nCo-Authored-By: AVRORA AI (27B) <avrora@vai-prog.ru>","tree":{"sha":"5ef85e8fa77b3c0bc4b058f27d5096e0ac1468bd","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/misshanya/PRODHugs/git/trees/5ef85e8fa77b3c0bc4b058f27d5096e0ac1468bd"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/misshanya/PRODHugs/git/commits/ab306838289e1a831c8f8c60aff2d01970d759e3","verification":{"payload":"tree 5ef85e8fa77b3c0bc4b058f27d5096e0ac1468bd\nparent 21d3063335e7bb6c5fe7f4c69d0c94b2c0e0c91a\nauthor Vadim Khristenko <vadim@vai-rice.space> 1779019648 +0300\ncommitter Vadim Khristenko <vadim@vai-rice.space> 1779019648 +0300\n\nci: bump tooling, fix fork-PR comment 403 via workflow_run\n\nTool bumps:\n- golangci-lint v2.5.0 -> v2.12.2 (full v2.6-v2.12 changelog;\n  notably the modernize suite and gosec rule additions)\n- actions/checkout v4 -> v6, setup-go v5 -> v6, paths-filter v3 -> v4,\n  github-script v7 -> v9, setup-buildx v3 -> v4 (clears the Node 20\n  deprecation warnings; June 2026 hard cutoff)\n\nThe v2.12 lint run flagged three deferred Close() calls that\nsilently dropped errors; switch each to \"defer func() { _ = x.Close() }() \"\nto be explicit about ignoring (these are DB shutdown / HTTP body\ndrain / WS post-loop teardown — no useful recovery).\n\nFix the persistent \"Resource not accessible by integration\" 403 on\nPR comments: GitHub downgrades GITHUB_TOKEN to read-only for fork PRs\nregardless of the workflow''s \"permissions:\" block. Split the comment\nposting into a separate workflow triggered by \"workflow_run\", which\nruns in the base-repo context with a normal write token. pr-checks\nnow just uploads report.md + pr-number.txt as an artifact;\npr-comment downloads it and calls the existing post-comment.js\nhelper. The comment workflow never checks out PR code under elevated\npermissions.\n\nCo-Authored-By: AVRORA AI (27B) <avrora@vai-prog.ru>\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\niJEEABYKADkWIQRN+vYIq3SQEYMdx70r1Gio6+T07wUCagmvgRsUgAAAAAAEAA5t\nYW51MiwyLjUrMS4xMiwyLDEACgkQK9RoqOvk9O/RWQEAhANNbMYUVBeAEXhvEb+a\n4fxBDrVgNa/rGNo3+w9DLrcBANoxRQfowvJaDOWxF/ugVf3w5i0/5Z9aSuX9h7eN\nyogM\n=6YHX\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-05-17T12:07:47Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/124452155?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vadim-Khristenko/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vadim-Khristenko/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vadim-Khristenko/following{/other_user}",