nts","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vadim-Khristenko/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vadim-Khristenko/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vadim-Khristenko/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vadim-Khristenko","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/misshanya/PRODHugs/commits/21d3063335e7bb6c5fe7f4c69d0c94b2c0e0c91a/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-17T11:30:34Z","email":"vadim@vai-rice.space","name":"Vadim Khristenko"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-17T11:30:34Z","email":"vadim@vai-rice.space","name":"Vadim Khristenko"},"message":"ci: fix golangci-lint + PR comment, polish report voice\n\n- Switch golangci-lint install to \"go install\" so the binary is\n  compiled with the runner''s Go 1.25 toolchain. The pre-built v1.64.5\n  binary was built against Go 1.24 and refused to load the config\n  (\"Go language version (go1.24) used to build golangci-lint is lower\n  than the targeted Go version (1.25)\").\n- Drop the deprecated --out-format=github-actions flag; emit GitHub\n  workflow annotations from the post-processed capture so inline PR\n  diff highlights still work.\n- Add \"issues: write\" to permissions — POST /repos/.../issues/N/comments\n  is denied without it (\"Resource not accessible by integration\"),\n  even for PR comments.\n- Persona pass on summarize.sh: Russian verb + noun agreement on the\n  fail count (упала 1 / упали 3 / упало 5), seven opener variants per\n  outcome bucket, closer line that varies with the result, hints\n  rewritten in her voice. Opener pick is now seeded from\n  GITHUB_RUN_ID + target so the PR comment and the run summary show\n  the same line within a single run.\n\nCo-Authored-By: AVRORA AI (27B) <avrora@vai-prog.ru>","tree":{"sha":"d1f89adc53b0b2b1e6e0ae4f67b15100f061ecb3","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/misshanya/PRODHugs/git/trees/d1f89adc53b0b2b1e6e0ae4f67b15100f061ecb3"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/misshanya/PRODHugs/git/commits/21d3063335e7bb6c5fe7f4c69d0c94b2c0e0c91a","verification":{"payload":"tree d1f89adc53b0b2b1e6e0ae4f67b15100f061ecb3\nparent 0fa779e0cb4327196b312bf742d592a26d50059e\nauthor Vadim Khristenko <vadim@vai-rice.space> 1779017434 +0300\ncommitter Vadim Khristenko <vadim@vai-rice.space> 1779017434 +0300\n\nci: fix golangci-lint + PR comment, polish report voice\n\n- Switch golangci-lint install to \"go install\" so the binary is\n  compiled with the runner''s Go 1.25 toolchain. The pre-built v1.64.5\n  binary was built against Go 1.24 and refused to load the config\n  (\"Go language version (go1.24) used to build golangci-lint is lower\n  than the targeted Go version (1.25)\").\n- Drop the deprecated --out-format=github-actions flag; emit GitHub\n  workflow annotations from the post-processed capture so inline PR\n  diff highlights still work.\n- Add \"issues: write\" to permissions — POST /repos/.../issues/N/comments\n  is denied without it (\"Resource not accessible by integration\"),\n  even for PR comments.\n- Persona pass on summarize.sh: Russian verb + noun agreement on the\n  fail count (упала 1 / упали 3 / упало 5), seven opener variants per\n  outcome bucket, closer line that varies with the result, hints\n  rewritten in her voice. Opener pick is now seeded from\n  GITHUB_RUN_ID + target so the PR comment and the run summary show\n  the same line within a single run.\n\nCo-Authored-By: AVRORA AI (27B) <avrora@vai-prog.ru>\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\niJEEABYKADkWIQRN+vYIq3SQEYMdx70r1Gio6+T07wUCagmm2hsUgAAAAAAEAA5t\nYW51MiwyLjUrMS4xMiwyLDEACgkQK9RoqOvk9O8ZhwD/Yfusjwlc4hp02tWeHPhO\ncvT182yukCiMUGVxYePs1vwA/2kpgO0lDwrwT/FA57B8Hn8CmuT37eEVdN04OK23\nT50N\n=LwND\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-05-17T11:30:50Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/124452155?v=4","events_url":"htt