,"id":124452155,"login":"Vadim-Khristenko","node_id":"U_kgDOB2r9Ow","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vadim-Khristenko/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vadim-Khristenko/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vadim-Khristenko/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vadim-Khristenko/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vadim-Khristenko/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vadim-Khristenko","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/misshanya/PRODHugs/commits/0fa779e0cb4327196b312bf742d592a26d50059e/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-17T11:11:47Z","email":"vadim@vai-rice.space","name":"Vadim Khristenko"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-17T11:11:47Z","email":"vadim@vai-rice.space","name":"Vadim Khristenko"},"message":"ci: stickier, snarkier PR reports\n\n- Provision a docker-container builder via setup-buildx-action so\n  the gha cache backend actually works (was failing with \"Cache\n  export is not supported for the docker driver\").\n- Replace the golangci-lint action with a pinned manual install +\n  --out-format=github-actions; we still get inline annotations on\n  the PR diff AND a captured text dump for the summary comment.\n- New post-comment.js (via actions/github-script) maintains a single\n  sticky PR comment per area (backend / frontend) using a hidden\n  marker, so each push edits the same comment instead of opening\n  a new one.\n- Rewrite summarize.sh: tone is now a permanently irritated DevOps\n  engineer — random opener line per run, Russian plural agreement\n  on the failure count, concrete copy-pasteable fix command for\n  every failed check, and a collapsible details block with the\n  tool''s actual output (capped at 12 KB / 200 lines so we stay\n  under GitHub''s comment-size limit).\n- Pin oapi-codegen v2.7.0, sqlc v1.30.0, golangci-lint v1.64.5 in\n  CI so the drift checks reproduce locally exactly.\n\nCo-Authored-By: AVRORA AI (27B) <avrora@vai-prog.ru>","tree":{"sha":"aee75e8c3b37b84c626ce326932beb359fb5ed99","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/misshanya/PRODHugs/git/trees/aee75e8c3b37b84c626ce326932beb359fb5ed99"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/misshanya/PRODHugs/git/commits/0fa779e0cb4327196b312bf742d592a26d50059e","verification":{"payload":"tree aee75e8c3b37b84c626ce326932beb359fb5ed99\nparent 051e1a3252eb1c43939be9a77d92a7ff1872a029\nauthor Vadim Khristenko <vadim@vai-rice.space> 1779016307 +0300\ncommitter Vadim Khristenko <vadim@vai-rice.space> 1779016307 +0300\n\nci: stickier, snarkier PR reports\n\n- Provision a docker-container builder via setup-buildx-action so\n  the gha cache backend actually works (was failing with \"Cache\n  export is not supported for the docker driver\").\n- Replace the golangci-lint action with a pinned manual install +\n  --out-format=github-actions; we still get inline annotations on\n  the PR diff AND a captured text dump for the summary comment.\n- New post-comment.js (via actions/github-script) maintains a single\n  sticky PR comment per area (backend / frontend) using a hidden\n  marker, so each push edits the same comment instead of opening\n  a new one.\n- Rewrite summarize.sh: tone is now a permanently irritated DevOps\n  engineer — random opener line per run, Russian plural agreement\n  on the failure count, concrete copy-pasteable fix command for\n  every failed check, and a collapsible details block with the\n  tool''s actual output (capped at 12 KB / 200 lines so we stay\n  under GitHub''s comment-size limit).\n- Pin oapi-codegen v2.7.0, sqlc v1.30.0, golangci-lint v1.64.5 in\n  CI so the drift checks reproduce locally exactly.\n\nCo-Authored-By: AVRORA AI (27B) <avrora@vai-prog.ru>\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\niJEEABYKADkWIQRN+vYIq3SQEYMdx70r1Gio6+T07wUCagmidBsUgAAAAAAEAA5t\nYW51MiwyLjUrMS4xMiwyLDEACgkQK9RoqOvk