x the four handler call sites\nthat pass cookieStr -> &cookieStr.\n\nCo-Authored-By: AVRORA AI (27B) <avrora@vai-prog.ru>","tree":{"sha":"50af0b4b3bde8930f9e47d12995b30b04e2d91ae","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/misshanya/PRODHugs/git/trees/50af0b4b3bde8930f9e47d12995b30b04e2d91ae"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/misshanya/PRODHugs/git/commits/38db72b478e9c83738d4e4555ff5392aa8ca9d65","verification":{"payload":"tree 50af0b4b3bde8930f9e47d12995b30b04e2d91ae\nparent d72c3b545e8cba08c842b82223702fdccf3db827\nauthor Vadim Khristenko <vadim@vai-rice.space> 1779016304 +0300\ncommitter Vadim Khristenko <vadim@vai-rice.space> 1779016304 +0300\n\nchore(backend): regenerate v1 OpenAPI on oapi-codegen v2.7.0\n\nv1''s api.gen.go was generated on v2.4.1 while v2 had already been\nregenerated on v2.7.0, so the codegen-drift CI check (which only\nknows one version) was always going to scream about one of them.\nMove both onto v2.7.0. The only behavioural delta is SetCookie now\ntyped *string instead of string; fix the four handler call sites\nthat pass cookieStr -> &cookieStr.\n\nCo-Authored-By: AVRORA AI (27B) <avrora@vai-prog.ru>\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\niJEEABYKADkWIQRN+vYIq3SQEYMdx70r1Gio6+T07wUCagmicRsUgAAAAAAEAA5t\nYW51MiwyLjUrMS4xMiwyLDEACgkQK9RoqOvk9O9PeQEA+A4c+y+oAMvJZdLW5KN+\n+4uXSqN31QJJVkw09omIomcA/3z99cpj9dO2SKr94nraRtnVdh3l7k2hxnlV6o7+\nCzEC\n=gJoZ\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-05-17T11:12:05Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/124452155?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vadim-Khristenko/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vadim-Khristenko/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vadim-Khristenko/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vadim-Khristenko/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Vadim-Khristenko","id":124452155,"login":"Vadim-Khristenko","node_id":"U_kgDOB2r9Ow","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vadim-Khristenko/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vadim-Khristenko/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vadim-Khristenko/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vadim-Khristenko/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vadim-Khristenko/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vadim-Khristenko","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/misshanya/PRODHugs/commit/38db72b478e9c83738d4e4555ff5392aa8ca9d65","node_id":"C_kwDOSPTt1NoAKDM4ZGI3MmI0NzhlOWM4MzczOGQ0ZTQ1NTVmZjUzOTJhYThjYTlkNjU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/misshanya/PRODHugs/commit/d72c3b545e8cba08c842b82223702fdccf3db827","sha":"d72c3b545e8cba08c842b82223702fdccf3db827","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/misshanya/PRODHugs/commits/d72c3b545e8cba08c842b82223702fdccf3db827"}],"sha":"38db72b478e9c83738d4e4555ff5392aa8ca9d65","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/misshanya/PRODHugs/commits/38db72b478e9c83738d4e4555ff5392aa8ca9d65"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/124452155?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vadim-Khristenko/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vadim-Khristenko/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vadim-Khristenko/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vadim-Khristenko/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Vadim-Khristenko","id":124452155,"login":"Vadim-Khristenko","node_id":"U_kgDOB2r9Ow","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vadim-Khristenko/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vadim-Khristenko/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vadim-Khristenko/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vadim-Khristenko/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vadim-Khristenko/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vadim-Khristenko","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/misshanya/PRODHugs/commits/d72c3b545e8cba08c842b82223702fdccf3db827/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-17T10:50:05Z","email":"vadim@vai-rice.space","name":"Vadim Khristenko"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-17T10:50:05Z","email":"vadim@vai-rice.space","name":"Vadim Khristenko"},"message":"ci: add detailed PR-time quality gates with rich summaries\n\nAdds .github/workflows/pr-checks.yml that runs on every pull_request\nto master, alongside the existing master-only image build/push\nworkflows. Uses dorny/paths-filter so backend / frontend jobs only\nspin up when their tree actually changed, and a concurrency group\nthat cancels stale runs when the PR is pushed again.\n\nBackend job runs: gofmt, go vet, go build, go test -race,\ngolangci-lint (inline PR annotations), OpenAPI v1/v2 codegen drift,\nsqlc codegen drift, and a non-push Docker build. Frontend job runs:\noxlint, eslint, vue-tsc type-check, vite build, and a non-push Docker\nbuild.\n\nEach check uses continue-on-error so a single failure doesn''t mask\nthe rest; a dedicated \"Conclude\" step aggregates outcomes and fails\nthe job. .github/scripts/summarize.sh writes a markdown report to\n\"GITHUB_STEP_SUMMARY\": a one-line verdict, a per-check table, and\ncollapsible details (captured output + copy-pasteable fix hint) for\nevery red check.\n\n.gitattributes pins shell scripts to \"LF\" endings so they keep\nexecuting on Linux runners regardless of developer platform.\n\nCo-Authored-By: AVRORA AI (27B) <avrora@vai-prog.ru>","tree":{"sha":"badcc29ebb0c096dd5bd66988f874e2719c32f17","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/misshanya/PRODHugs/git/trees/badcc29ebb0c096dd5bd66988f874e2719c32f17"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/misshanya/PRODHugs/git/commits/d72c3b545e8cba08c842b82223702fdccf3db827","verification":{"payload":"tree badcc29ebb0c096dd5bd66988f874e2719c32f17\nparent bbdd90001cf85ec7570e502d8bd8c66206846931\nauthor Vadim Khristenko <vadim@vai-rice.space> 1779015005 +0300\ncommitter Vadim Khristenko <vadim@vai-rice.space> 1779015005 +0300\n\nci: add detailed PR-time quality gates with rich summaries\n\nAdds .github/workflows/pr-checks.yml that runs on every pull_request\nto master, alongside the existing master-only image build/push\nworkflows. Uses dorny/paths-filter so backend / frontend jobs only\nspin up when their tree actually changed, and a concurrency group\nthat cancels stale runs when the PR is pushed again.\n\nBackend job runs: gofmt, go vet, go build, go test -race,\ngolangci-lint (inline PR annotations), OpenAPI v1/v2 codegen drift,\nsqlc codegen drift, and a non-push Docker build. Frontend job runs:\noxlint, eslint, vue-tsc type-check, vite build, and a non-push Docker\nbuild.\n\nEach check uses continue-on-error so a single failure doesn''t mask\nthe rest; a dedicated \"Conclude\" step aggregates outcomes and fails\nthe job. .github/scripts/summarize.sh writes a markdown report to\n\"GITHUB_STEP_SUMMARY\": a one-line verdict, a per-check table, and\ncollapsible details (captured output + copy-pasteable fix hint) for\nevery red check.\n\n.gitattributes pins shell scripts to \"LF\" endings so they keep\nexecuting on Linux runners regardless of developer platform.\n\nCo-Authored-By: AVRORA AI (27B) <avrora@vai-prog.ru>\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\niJEEABYKADkWIQRN+vYIq3SQEYMdx70r1Gio6+T07wUCagmdXRsUgAAAAAAEAA5t\nYW51MiwyLjUrMS4xMiwyLDEACgkQK9RoqOvk9O82XQD+J4WxBNkXAz5yVYvdj1kF\nyTiJw2DChQ2+xPQJBRrJMQUA/3wGr0ahSUoSUY0CDI+Jhpmlvni7wnjFloq5qU0h\nmBcF\n=xGfR\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-05-17T10:50:21Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/124452155?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vadim-Khristenko