,"node_id":"U_kgDOB2r9Ow","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vadim-Khristenko/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vadim-Khristenko/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vadim-Khristenko/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vadim-Khristenko/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vadim-Khristenko/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vadim-Khristenko","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/misshanya/PRODHugs/commits/bbdd90001cf85ec7570e502d8bd8c66206846931/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-17T10:50:04Z","email":"vadim@vai-rice.space","name":"Vadim Khristenko"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-17T10:50:04Z","email":"vadim@vai-rice.space","name":"Vadim Khristenko"},"message":"fix(sudoku-repo): instantiate storage.Queries from the pool\n\nThe sudoku repo passed *pgxpool.Pool straight into repository.Queries,\nwhich expects *storage.Queries. Match the pattern every other\nrepository uses: hold a storage.New(db) handle on the struct and feed\nthat into repository.Queries(ctx, r.q). Restores a clean go build\n./... across the module.\n\nCo-Authored-By: AVRORA AI (27B) <avrora@vai-prog.ru>","tree":{"sha":"137c6dca471ed6635b4641d06187387babe22fd1","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/misshanya/PRODHugs/git/trees/137c6dca471ed6635b4641d06187387babe22fd1"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/misshanya/PRODHugs/git/commits/bbdd90001cf85ec7570e502d8bd8c66206846931","verification":{"payload":"tree 137c6dca471ed6635b4641d06187387babe22fd1\nparent 756bef836fb998b1c1b6576db8ed1ef654f05f23\nauthor Vadim Khristenko <vadim@vai-rice.space> 1779015004 +0300\ncommitter Vadim Khristenko <vadim@vai-rice.space> 1779015004 +0300\n\nfix(sudoku-repo): instantiate storage.Queries from the pool\n\nThe sudoku repo passed *pgxpool.Pool straight into repository.Queries,\nwhich expects *storage.Queries. Match the pattern every other\nrepository uses: hold a storage.New(db) handle on the struct and feed\nthat into repository.Queries(ctx, r.q). Restores a clean go build\n./... across the module.\n\nCo-Authored-By: AVRORA AI (27B) <avrora@vai-prog.ru>\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\niJEEABYKADkWIQRN+vYIq3SQEYMdx70r1Gio6+T07wUCagmdXBsUgAAAAAAEAA5t\nYW51MiwyLjUrMS4xMiwyLDEACgkQK9RoqOvk9O/x4AEA8TxgPgz5aAUkEeJ3Yt9c\nf+VyVKKVFlMf2MJ3rLBd5MoA/2rYRZp6LxKZ37Xj30PFUdx6Rois3qNYsTi73wgJ\n0hEL\n=eBGu\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-05-17T10:50:21Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/124452155?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vadim-Khristenko/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vadim-Khristenko/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vadim-Khristenko/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vadim-Khristenko/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Vadim-Khristenko","id":124452155,"login":"Vadim-Khristenko","node_id":"U_kgDOB2r9Ow","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vadim-Khristenko/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vadim-Khristenko/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vadim-Khristenko/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vadim-Khristenko/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vadim-Khristenko/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vadim-Khristenko","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/misshanya/PRODHugs/commit/bbdd90001cf85ec7570e502d8bd8c66206846931","node_id":"C_kwDOSPTt1NoAKGJiZGQ5MDAwMWNmODVlYzc1NzBlNTAyZDhiZDhjNjYyMDY4NDY5MzE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/misshanya/PRODHugs/commit/756bef836fb998b1c1b6576db8ed1ef654f05f23","sha":"756bef836fb998b1c1b6576db8ed1ef654f05f23","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/misshanya/PRODHugs/commits/756bef836fb998b1c1b6576db8ed1ef654f05f23"}],"sha":"bbdd90001cf85ec7570e502d8bd8c66206846931","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/misshanya/PRODHugs/commits/bbdd90001cf85ec7570e502d8bd8c66206846931"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/124452155?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vadim-Khristenko/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vadim-Khristenko/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vadim-Khristenko/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vadim-Khristenko/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Vadim-Khristenko","id":124452155,"login":"Vadim-Khristenko","node_id":"U_kgDOB2r9Ow","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vadim-Khristenko/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vadim-Khristenko/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vadim-Khristenko/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vadim-Khristenko/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vadim-Khristenko/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vadim-Khristenko","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/misshanya/PRODHugs/commits/756bef836fb998b1c1b6576db8ed1ef654f05f23/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-17T10:36:28Z","email":"vadim@vai-rice.space","name":"Vadim Khristenko"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-17T10:36:28Z","email":"vadim@vai-rice.space","name":"Vadim Khristenko"},"message":"chore(frontend): clean up ESLint errors\n\n- Add an override for src/components/ui/** so the vendored shadcn-vue\n  files don''t trip multi-word-component-names, no-explicit-any, or\n  no-unused-vars — those are upstream conventions we don''t want to\n  diverge over.\n- In our own code, replace \"catch (e: any)\" with \"catch (e: unknown)\"\n  + a narrow local cast, drop unused catch bindings, kill the\n  remaining \"as any\" casts (captcha responses already have generic\n  types), and remove unused imports (Crown/Coin/Input, Button in\n  SudokuModal).\n- Introduce a SearchUser interface in the hugs store so vips/users\n  refs are typed instead of \"any[]\"; type the telegram-poll response\n  user field as the auth store''s User shape.\n\nBoth \"bun run lint:oxlint\" and \"bun run lint:eslint\" now report 0\nerrors; \"bun run type-check\" is clean.\n\nCo-Authored-By: AVRORA AI (27B) <avrora@vai-prog.ru>","tree":{"sha":"877aaddfd2ed45e202a807a923d58b0d897a8087","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/misshanya/PRODHugs/git/trees/877aaddfd2ed45e202a807a923d58b0d897a8087"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/misshanya/PRODHugs/git/commits/756bef836fb998b1c1b6576db8ed1ef654f05f23","verification":{"payload":"tree 877aaddfd2ed45e202a807a923d58b0d897a8087\nparent 257ae888c185f0d1742dc843eb94e7338b7d4137\nauthor Vadim Khristenko <vadim@vai-rice.space> 1779014188 +0300\ncommitter Vadim Khristenko <vadim@vai-rice.space> 1779014188 +0300\n\nchore(frontend): clean up ESLint errors\n\n- Add an override for src/components/ui/** so the vendored shadcn-vue\n  files don''t trip multi-word-component-names, no-explicit-any, or\n  no-unused-vars — those are upstream conventions we don''t want to\n  diverge over.\n- In our own code, replace \"catch (e: any)\" with \"catch (e: unknown)\"\n  + a narrow local cast, drop unused catch bindings, kill the\n  remaining \"as any\" casts (captcha responses already have generic\n  types), and remove unused imports (Crown/Coin/Input, Button in\n  SudokuModal).\n- Introduce a SearchUser interface in the hugs store so vips/users\n  refs are typed instead of \"any[]\"; type the telegram-poll response\n  user field as the auth store''s User shape.\n\nBoth \"bun run lint:oxlint\" and \"bun run lint:eslint\" now report 0\nerrors; \"bun run type-check\" is clean.\n\nCo-Authored-By: AVRORA AI (27B) <avrora@vai-prog.ru>\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\niJEEABYKADkWIQRN+vYIq3SQEYMdx70r1Gio6+T07wUCagmaLBsUgAAAAAAEAA5t\nYW51MiwyLjUrMS4xMiwyLDEACgkQK9RoqOvk9O+ZgAD+LYQ3cziKULYriPtdUtJU\noCvSG/JM/svKYVFXJ1Q9NIUA/2tDF1Yin4e/pn9PmkGbk99SX3KWwOxfdBSmHIUg\nzq0M\n=6Ncl\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-05-17T10:36:45Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/124452155?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vadim-Khristenko/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vadim-Khristenko/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vadim-Khristenko/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vadim-Khristenko/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Vadim-Khristenko","id":124452155,"login":"Vadim-Khristenko","node_id":"U_kgDOB2r9Ow","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vadim-Khristenko/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vadim-Khristenko/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vadim-Khristenko/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vadim-Khristenko/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vadim-Khristenko/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vadim-Khristenko","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/misshanya/PRODHugs/commit/756bef836fb998b1c1b6576db8ed1ef654f05f23","node_id":"C_kwDOSPTt1NoAKDc1NmJlZjgzNmZiOTk4YjFjMWI2NTc2ZGI4ZWQxZWY2NTRmMDVmMjM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/misshanya/PRODHugs/commit/257ae888c185f0d1742dc843eb94e7338b7d4137","sha":"257ae888c185f0d1742dc843eb94e7338b7d4137","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/misshanya/PRODHugs/commits/257ae888c185f0d1742dc843eb94e7338b7d4137"}],"sha":"756bef836fb998b1c1b6576db8ed1ef654f05f23","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/misshanya/PRODHugs/commits/756bef836fb998b1c1b6576db8ed1ef654f05f23"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/124452155?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vadim-Khristenko/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vadim-Khristenko/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vadim-Khristenko/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vadim-Khristenko/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Vadim-Khristenko","id":124452155,"login":"Vadim-Khristenko","node_id":"U_kgDOB2r9Ow","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vadim-Khristenko/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vadim-Khristenko/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vadim-Khristenko/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vadim-Khristenko/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vadim-Khristenko/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vadim-Khristenko","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/misshanya/PRODHugs/commits/257ae888c185f0d1742dc843eb94e7338b7d4137/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-17T10:36:27Z","email":"vadim@vai-rice.space","name":"Vadim Khristenko"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-17T10:36:27Z","email":"vadim@vai-rice.space","name":"Vadim Khristenko"},"message":"fix(notes): align note validation with backend and avoid stale render\n\n- Stop rendering a stale note from a previous profile when the user\n  navigates mid-fetch: capture the route key before the request and\n  drop the result if the key no longer matches.\n- Count Unicode code points (not UTF-16 code units) in both the\n  client-side length check and the editor character counter so emoji\n  and supplementary-plane chars match the backend''s RuneCountInString\n  / Postgres char_length validation.\n- Replace the native maxlength attribute (UTF-16 code units) with an\n  input handler that truncates by code points, so the field doesn''t\n  reject input that the API would accept.\n- Expand the openapi-v2.yaml description to cover all current v2\n  endpoints (notes CRUD + /notes list) so generated docs stay\n  accurate.\n\nCo-Authored-By: AVRORA Reasoning Agent (0.7B BitNet 1.58b) <avrora+deep-reasoning@vai-prog.ru>","tree":{"sha":"de5009653e4eb5d1720f26f529a8962ded2091b2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/misshanya/PRODHugs/git/trees/de5009653e4eb5d1720f26f529a8962ded2091b2"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/misshanya/PRODHugs/git/commits/257ae888c185f0d1742dc843eb94e7338b7d4137","verification":{"payload":"tree de5009653e4eb5d1720f26f529a8962ded2091b2\nparent a9ec3f365c9645f7fde1998aea94d1e2c3ed9749\nauthor Vadim Khristenko <vadim@vai-rice.space> 1779014187 +0300\ncommitter Vadim Khristenko <vadim@vai-rice.space> 1779014187 +0300\n\nfix(notes): align note validation with backend and avoid stale render\n\n- Stop rendering a stale note from a previous profile when the user\n  navigates mid-fetch: capture the route key before the request and\n  drop the result if the key no longer matches.\n- Count Unicode code points (not UTF-16 code units) in both the\n  client-side length check and the editor character counter so emoji\n  and supplementary-plane chars match the backend''s RuneCountInString\n  / Postgres char_length validation.\n- Replace the native maxlength attribute (UTF-16 code units) with an\n  input handler that truncates by code points, so the field doesn''t\n  reject input that the API would accept.\n- Expand the openapi-v2.yaml description to cover all current v2\n  endpoints (notes CRUD + /notes list) so generated docs stay\n  accurate.\n\nCo-Authored-By: AVRORA Reasoning Agent (0.7B BitNet 1.58b) <avrora+deep-reasoning@vai-prog.ru>\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\niJEEABYKADkWIQRN+vYIq3SQEYMdx70r1Gio6+T07wUCagmaKxsUgAAAAAAEAA5t\nYW51MiwyLjUrMS4xMiwyLDEACgkQK9RoqOvk9O8BbwEAl0YLzP7sz5bCxxHqTt3x\nrqJb0UzHnTdElOMhmDfz3j0A/35yxlalc9yTc0CnXN21R6oVMoE9iAqdBX6686+u\nJJIM\n=rMZj\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-05-17T10:36:45Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/124452155?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vadim-Khristenko/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vadim-Khristenko/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vadim-Khristenko/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vadim-Khristenko/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Vadim-Khristenko","id":124452155,"login":"Vadim-Khristenko","node_id":"U_kgDOB2r9Ow","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vadim-Khristenko/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vadim-Khristenko/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vadim-Khristenko/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vadim-Khristenko/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vadim-Khristenko/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vadim-Khristenko","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/misshanya/PRODHugs/commit/257ae888c185f0d1742dc843eb94e7338b7d4137","node_id":"C_kwDOSPTt1NoAKDI1N2FlODg4YzE4NWYwZDE3NDJkYzg0M2ViOTRlNzMzOGI3ZDQxMzc","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/misshanya/PRODHugs/commit/a9ec3f365c9645f7fde1998aea94d1e2c3ed9749","sha":"a9ec3f365c9645f7fde1998aea94d1e2c3ed9749","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/misshanya/PRODHugs/commits/a9ec3f365c9645f7fde1998aea94d1e2c3ed9749"}],"sha":"257ae888c185f0d1742dc843eb94e7338b7d4137","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/misshanya/PRODHugs/commits/257ae888c185f0d1742dc843eb94e7338b7d4137"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/135170478?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/misshanya/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users