ail.com","name":"jsk11L"},"message":"feat(import): Obsidian vault import (Block 6)\n\nImporterService.importObsidian unzips a vault (≤200MB), uploads image\nassets, and converts each .md to a note: folders→tags, frontmatter\ntitle/tags, [[wikilinks]] resolved to note links (unresolved left as\ntext), ![[embeds]] mapped to uploaded images, duplicate titles suffixed.\nTwo-pass so wikilinks resolve to real ids. Returns a summary report.\n\nPOST /import/obsidian (throttled, 200MB limit). Frontend: /app/notes/import\ndropzone page with the result report, linked from the Notes header.","tree":{"sha":"23e0944ba982320a4184c18c2ec400141538af39","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jsk11L/OmniDesk/git/trees/23e0944ba982320a4184c18c2ec400141538af39"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jsk11L/OmniDesk/git/commits/67eaa6b0be7b20874dc6ac07e473d362dfa7452e","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/127500553?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jsk11L/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jsk11L/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jsk11L/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jsk11L/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/jsk11L","id":127500553,"login":"jsk11L","node_id":"U_kgDOB5mBCQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jsk11L/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jsk11L/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jsk11L/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jsk11L/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jsk11L/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/jsk11L","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/jsk11L/OmniDesk/commit/67eaa6b0be7b20874dc6ac07e473d362dfa7452e","node_id":"C_kwDOSPVpHNoAKD