ration captcha + terms acceptance\n\n- AuthService.login now returns TokenPair or a { requires2FA, tempToken }\n  challenge; added verifyTwoFactor, 2FA management, deleteAccount,\n  restoreAccount, and captchaToken on register/forgot. User gains isAdmin.\n- Login shows a code step when 2FA is required.\n- Register adds Terms + no-data-selling checkboxes (requiredTrue) and a\n  Cloudflare Turnstile widget (CaptchaComponent; hidden when no site key).\n- environments + inject-env carry captchaSiteKey (CAPTCHA_SITE_KEY arg).","tree":{"sha":"dd2489f0ddfa099f0283d130422b263e664c4a17","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jsk11L/OmniDesk/git/trees/dd2489f0ddfa099f0283d130422b263e664c4a17"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jsk11L/OmniDesk/git/commits/43ed726d7cef46174c3f967cd55c570767648258","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/127500553?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jsk11L/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jsk11L/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jsk11L/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jsk11L/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/jsk11L","id":127500553,"login":"jsk11L","node_id":"U_kgDOB5mBCQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jsk11L/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jsk11L/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jsk11L/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jsk11L/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jsk11L/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/jsk11L","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/jsk11L/OmniDesk/commit/43ed726d7cef46174c3f967cd55c570767648258","node_id":"C_kwDOSPVpHNoAKDQzZWQ3MjZkN2NlZjQ2MTc0YzNmOTY3Y2Q1NWM1NzA3Njc2NDgyNTg","par