ublic"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Gaurav-XD/Pricing-Optimization-Engine/commits/a61b106e327749b0202cc416c8c2ed32e51c428d/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-04-29T04:14:26Z","email":"shaga0005@gmail.com","name":"Gaurav-XD"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-04-29T04:14:26Z","email":"shaga0005@gmail.com","name":"Gaurav-XD"},"message":"feat: full-stack conversion — React frontend + SQLite DB + Docker\n\n- React 19 + Vite 8 frontend with React Router, Recharts, Tailwind CSS\n- 4 pages: Dashboard (KPI cards + elasticity/revenue charts), Products\n  (sortable table), Optimizer (form + revenue curve), History (run log)\n- Dark-themed professional UI with sidebar navigation\n- FastAPI v2 backend: CORS, 8 endpoints including /stats, /products,\n  /history CRUD\n- SQLAlchemy + SQLite persistence layer (api/database.py, api/db_models.py)\n- Dockerfile for backend (python:3.11-slim + uvicorn)\n- Dockerfile for frontend (node:22-alpine builder + nginx)\n- docker-compose.yml with healthcheck and shared volume\n- 42/42 pytest tests still passing","tree":{"sha":"cb6e3ee85aa098762f19749a5b87bf98e647d1e5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Gaurav-XD/Pricing-Optimization-Engine/git/trees/cb6e3ee85aa098762f19749a5b87bf98e647d1e5"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Gaurav-XD/Pricing-Optimization-Engine/git/commits/a61b106e327749b0202cc416c8c2ed32e51c428d","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/221392528?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bunnyboy001/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bunnyboy001/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bunnyboy001/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bunnyboy001/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/bunnyboy001","id":221392528,"login":"bunnyboy001","node_id":"U_kgDODTIuk