thub.com/users/bunnyboy001/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/bunnyboy001","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Gaurav-XD/Pricing-Optimization-Engine/commits/440cb9ac9dbc0cf1c28070385e5b4cc222764b7a/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-04-29T03:57:42Z","email":"shaga0005@gmail.com","name":"Gaurav-XD"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-04-29T03:57:42Z","email":"shaga0005@gmail.com","name":"Gaurav-XD"},"message":"Initial commit: Pricing Optimisation Engine v1.0\n\n- Full ML pipeline: synthetic data generation, preprocessing, log-log\n  elasticity regression, demand modelling, price optimisation\n- FastAPI REST API (4 endpoints: /health, /products, /optimize-price,\n  /revenue-curve/{product_id})\n- 42 pytest tests (100% passing)\n- 30 portfolio-quality visualisations in results/\n- Jupyter exploration notebook\n- QA report and portfolio visual generator scripts\n\nTechnical highlights:\n  - Price elasticity estimation via OLS log-log regression (scikit-learn)\n  - Numerically stable p-value computation using scipy.stats.t.sf\n  - Bounded grid-search optimisation (±30%, 200 candidate prices)\n  - Profit mode support (cost_per_unit parameter)\n  - Pydantic v2 request/response validation\n  - Structured JSON logging throughout pipeline","tree":{"sha":"0869340f549f10a179db88ed71fc2f8f4a8ef4e9","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Gaurav-XD/Pricing-Optimization-Engine/git/trees/0869340f549f10a179db88ed71fc2f8f4a8ef4e9"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Gaurav-XD/Pricing-Optimization-Engine/git/commits/440cb9ac9dbc0cf1c28070385e5b4cc222764b7a","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/221392528?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bunnyboy001/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bunnyboy001/followers","following_url":"https://